(433667, 40040, 5792, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge in a unique way. Decent color. Nice soft background. I would have cropped out the yellow forground object on the left side of the frame.</td>', 'Meets the challenge in a unique way. Decent color. Nice soft background. I would have cropped out the yellow forground object on the left side of the frame.', '2003-09-29 02:43:53.000000', NULL, 1),
