(433682, 39044, 10084, '<td valign="top">The beautiful sunset really frames the wings well. The wings silhouette has a great sharp contrast. Great sensation of flight. Well done.</td>', 'The beautiful sunset really frames the wings well. The wings silhouette has a great sharp contrast. Great sensation of flight. Well done.', '2003-09-29 03:00:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(433693, 39802, 12075, '<td valign="top">This is the one for me...stunning</td>', 'This is the one for me...stunning', '2003-09-29 03:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433716, 39985, 10084, '<td valign="top">What a fun shot. Good composition. The colorful dress really makes her pop out of the shot. If you were able to frame more of the sky to contrast with the girl it would really make for a great photo. Currently the girls blends in a bit with the background. If she was jumping in front of the blue sky or at less more then half the image it would really be appealing.</td>', 'What a fun shot. Good composition. The colorful dress really makes her pop out of the shot. If you were able to frame more of the sky to contrast with the girl it would really make for a great photo. Currently the girls blends in a bit with the background. If she was jumping in front of the blue sky or at less more then half the image it would really be appealing.', '2003-09-29 04:08:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(433717, 39511, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Would like more contrast to really bring out the hang glider. He blends in with the background a bit. The good part is the is the neon colored glider. The angle you were able to capture is incredible. Love the sky and the clouds. Brighting the main subject would really help out with the composition.</td>', 'Great shot. Would like more contrast to really bring out the hang glider. He blends in with the background a bit. The good part is the is the neon colored glider. The angle you were able to capture is incredible. Love the sky and the clouds. Brighting the main subject would really help out with the composition.', '2003-09-29 04:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433718, 39649, 10084, '<td valign="top">The contrast of the airplane really brings it up to the foreground. The clouds and the sky really makes the plane pop out of the shot. The black frame also helps with this.</td>', 'The contrast of the airplane really brings it up to the foreground. The clouds and the sky really makes the plane pop out of the shot. The black frame also helps with this.', '2003-09-29 04:15:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(433719, 40084, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would like more lighting in the bird to give more interest. The brightness of the background helps to make the bird pop out of the shot. The building helps with the composition and gives it some depth of field. Larger shot would be nice.</td>', 'Would like more lighting in the bird to give more interest. The brightness of the background helps to make the bird pop out of the shot. The building helps with the composition and gives it some depth of field. Larger shot would be nice.', '2003-09-29 04:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(433722, 40096, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sense of flight. Great vivid image very sharp. Blurring background really gives a sense of speed also. Good shadows in the feathers makes a bold statement.</td>', 'Beautiful sense of flight. Great vivid image very sharp. Blurring background really gives a sense of speed also. Good shadows in the feathers makes a bold statement.', '2003-09-29 04:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(433723, 39954, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great sky shot. The bold silhouette of the plane in flight makes for a great composition. Beautiful colors in the clouds. A little contrast and levels work may make them fluffier.</td>', 'Great sky shot. The bold silhouette of the plane in flight makes for a great composition. Beautiful colors in the clouds. A little contrast and levels work may make them fluffier.', '2003-09-29 04:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433727, 40042, 7151, '<td valign="top">He looks pretty trapped to me.  :)</td>', 'He looks pretty trapped to me.  :)', '2003-09-29 04:41:53.000000', NULL, 1),
