(433765, 39812, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great job, background is superb, angle is great also.</td>', 'Great job, background is superb, angle is great also.', '2003-09-29 07:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(433766, 39542, 7543, '<td valign="top">Great capture, Neatimage could clean up the grainy sky if that''s what you whant. Fill in flash could also be interesting, to light up the girls'' face. Good job!</td>', 'Great capture, Neatimage could clean up the grainy sky if that''s what you whant. Fill in flash could also be interesting, to light up the girls'' face. Good job!', '2003-09-29 07:38:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(433767, 40035, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure</td>', 'Nice exposure', '2003-09-29 07:40:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(433768, 40047, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice capture, nice to see the sky white for a change</td>', 'Nice capture, nice to see the sky white for a change', '2003-09-29 07:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(433769, 39471, 9295, '<td valign="top">I love the near-prefect symmetry, the grey-blue tones, teh softness of the feathers. I think the darker sky on the right is perhaps a little distracting--maybe if the sky held the same symmetry as the bird?  I dunno. I guess I''d have to see what that would look like to compare before I say for sure if that would improve an already terrific shot. Can''t give you a vote, but if I could it''d be a 10.  Good luck!</td>', 'I love the near-prefect symmetry, the grey-blue tones, teh softness of the feathers. I think the darker sky on the right is perhaps a little distracting--maybe if the sky held the same symmetry as the bird?  I dunno. I guess I''d have to see what that would look like to compare before I say for sure if that would improve an already terrific shot. Can''t give you a vote, but if I could it''d be a 10.  Good luck!', '2003-09-29 08:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(433770, 40035, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is nifty. I''m glad you made it black and white.  I think I''d lose the little guy on the top left. I think he''s a little distracting from the bird in flight.  Nevertheless, I like this a lot. If I could vote in this challenge, I''d give you an 8...and then probably reconsider and up it to a 9 or 10. LOL!  Good luck.</td>', 'This is nifty. I''m glad you made it black and white.  I think I''d lose the little guy on the top left. I think he''s a little distracting from the bird in flight.  Nevertheless, I like this a lot. If I could vote in this challenge, I''d give you an 8...and then probably reconsider and up it to a 9 or 10. LOL!  Good luck.', '2003-09-29 08:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(433771, 39964, 7543, '<td valign="top">Nice different idea for this challenge, no plane no seagull here :) Nice crop, and good call on the b/w. Fill in flash might have done good for this shot. Good lock</td>', 'Nice different idea for this challenge, no plane no seagull here :) Nice crop, and good call on the b/w. Fill in flash might have done good for this shot. Good lock', '2003-09-29 08:11:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(433774, 39521, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a creative and amusing take on the challenge theme.  You captured him at just the right moment with the ears looking like little wings, and what a great expression on his face, looking straight into the camera. Good job.</td>', 'This is a creative and amusing take on the challenge theme.  You captured him at just the right moment with the ears looking like little wings, and what a great expression on his face, looking straight into the camera. Good job.', '2003-09-29 08:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(433777, 40057, 9295, '<td valign="top">One of my favorites so far. I love the title!  I don''t know if it''s possible to have gotten the planes any crisper with them being in motion and so far away, but I think that may be the only thing I find less than perfect. Even so, with them being so small, it''s hardly distracting from the overall appeal of the shot.  Great fun. The clear blue sky couldn''t have been more cooperating for a shot like this, huh.</td>', 'One of my favorites so far. I love the title!  I don''t know if it''s possible to have gotten the planes any crisper with them being in motion and so far away, but I think that may be the only thing I find less than perfect. Even so, with them being so small, it''s hardly distracting from the overall appeal of the shot.  Great fun. The clear blue sky couldn''t have been more cooperating for a shot like this, huh.', '2003-09-29 08:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(433778, 40050, 4388, '<td valign="top">very interesting shot, i think it would be improved if you leveled the background, even though you probably shot on the level with your camera. still one of the top picks.</td>', 'very interesting shot, i think it would be improved if you leveled the background, even though you probably shot on the level with your camera. still one of the top picks.', '2003-09-29 08:18:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(433780, 39966, 7263, '<td valign="top">can''t see anything in flight.</td>', 'can''t see anything in flight.', '2003-09-29 08:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(433781, 39873, 7263, '<td valign="top">can''t see anything in flight</td>', 'can''t see anything in flight', '2003-09-29 08:19:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433782, 39959, 4388, '<td valign="top">too bad it''s left wingtip is out of the picture, still a nice image.</td>', 'too bad it''s left wingtip is out of the picture, still a nice image.', '2003-09-29 08:19:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(433784, 40078, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is a nice capture. I like the red tones and the halo affect behind the head of the rear horse.  I wish the photo were a little larger so I could better see some of the detail since it appears to be a little blurry and I think in this particular instance, a crisper focus would enhance the shot more than a soft focus.</td>', 'This is a nice capture. I like the red tones and the halo affect behind the head of the rear horse.  I wish the photo were a little larger so I could better see some of the detail since it appears to be a little blurry and I think in this particular instance, a crisper focus would enhance the shot more than a soft focus.', '2003-09-29 08:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(433785, 39471, 4388, '<td valign="top">nice composition though a bit grainy</td>', 'nice composition though a bit grainy', '2003-09-29 08:21:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(433786, 39802, 9295, '<td valign="top">Wow, I feel like I''ve been transported back in time!  This is just wonderful.  I love the textures in both the field and the sky which make the smooth lines of the airplane and the boy really stand out.  I also like that the moment you captured this shot, the plane was right in front of the one real break in the clouds, brightening it up and almost giving the impression that it''s what parted the sky. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'Wow, I feel like I''ve been transported back in time!  This is just wonderful.  I love the textures in both the field and the sky which make the smooth lines of the airplane and the boy really stand out.  I also like that the moment you captured this shot, the plane was right in front of the one real break in the clouds, brightening it up and almost giving the impression that it''s what parted the sky. Good luck with the challenge.', '2003-09-29 08:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433788, 40071, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is so interesting. It looks almost like a painting.  I love how the flock of birds is spackled across the sky in such a random flurry and what I suppose is actually an overexposure causing the clouds to seem so stark (I''m not a photographer so I don''t know techniques, all I really know is the affect and I like it here). I wish your title was as creative as the shot.  ;-)</td>', 'This is so interesting. It looks almost like a painting.  I love how the flock of birds is spackled across the sky in such a random flurry and what I suppose is actually an overexposure causing the clouds to seem so stark (I''m not a photographer so I don''t know techniques, all I really know is the affect and I like it here). I wish your title was as creative as the shot.  ;-)', '2003-09-29 08:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433789, 39870, 9295, '<td valign="top">This is so unique and your title is wonderful. I like how the lighting captures so much detail of the seed feathers and how you captured the one lone seed taking flight.  Very nice.</td>', 'This is so unique and your title is wonderful. I like how the lighting captures so much detail of the seed feathers and how you captured the one lone seed taking flight.  Very nice.', '2003-09-29 08:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(433791, 39851, 9295, '<td valign="top">This has good potential (great colors and use of sunlight) but that pole is really distracting and I think maybe a little more of the person''s body, or maybe even his arms in the air pulling him more into the shot, would have been better. I like the angle you shot from though, getting the underbelly of the frisbee that way.</td>', 'This has good potential (great colors and use of sunlight) but that pole is really distracting and I think maybe a little more of the person''s body, or maybe even his arms in the air pulling him more into the shot, would have been better. I like the angle you shot from though, getting the underbelly of the frisbee that way.', '2003-09-29 08:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(433795, 39886, 9295, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful, inspirational shot this is, enhanced by a great title.  I love how the bird would have been lost against the darkness of the sky had the light not outlined it the way it did. Try a different border. If I were voting, I''d never take that into consideration, but I think when you put this into your gallery, a diffrerent, or no border, for this would be better.</td>', 'What a beautiful, inspirational shot this is, enhanced by a great title.  I love how the bird would have been lost against the darkness of the sky had the light not outlined it the way it did. Try a different border. If I were voting, I''d never take that into consideration, but I think when you put this into your gallery, a diffrerent, or no border, for this would be better.', '2003-09-29 08:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(433803, 40085, 7703, '<td valign="top">I would like this so much better if this border would not be there.</td>', 'I would like this so much better if this border would not be there.', '2003-09-29 08:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(433804, 39543, 7703, '<td valign="top">The airplain is not the main subject here so I can''t give this picture much -3</td>', 'The airplain is not the main subject here so I can''t give this picture much -3', '2003-09-29 08:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(433806, 40069, 7703, '<td valign="top">The butterfly is to bright -3</td>', 'The butterfly is to bright -3', '2003-09-29 08:59:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(433807, 40094, 7703, '<td valign="top">Ok, I''m sorry but I don''t see anything flying? -1</td>', 'Ok, I''m sorry but I don''t see anything flying? -1', '2003-09-29 09:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(433808, 39603, 7703, '<td valign="top">To blurry -4</td>', 'To blurry -4', '2003-09-29 09:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(433810, 39995, 8522, '<td valign="top">I wonder why you chose to place the plane in the centre of the frame? This is usually not a good place to put your subject, and I really don''t think it works here. If it was on the right, it would make sense as the negative space would exist compositionally for it to fly into. The clouds don''t seem to work as a compositional device either, and look accidental here. For a stronger shot, an additional element is needed, such as an interesting cloud formation, sunset, or foreground element. 5</td>', 'I wonder why you chose to place the plane in the centre of the frame? This is usually not a good place to put your subject, and I really don''t think it works here. If it was on the right, it would make sense as the negative space would exist compositionally for it to fly into. The clouds don''t seem to work as a compositional device either, and look accidental here. For a stronger shot, an additional element is needed, such as an interesting cloud formation, sunset, or foreground element. 5', '2003-09-29 09:14:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(433811, 39986, 8522, '<td valign="top">Would have been much nicer without the intrusive border. I''d be interested to know why you thought it was necessary/ appropriate. 6</td>', 'Would have been much nicer without the intrusive border. I''d be interested to know why you thought it was necessary/ appropriate. 6', '2003-09-29 09:15:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(433812, 39901, 9287, '<td valign="top">nice one, the shallow DOF look good. 9</td>', 'nice one, the shallow DOF look good. 9', '2003-09-29 09:16:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(433813, 40071, 8522, '<td valign="top">An interesting effect, but the composition of the pigeons looks random and chaotic. I like the use of contrast and grain. 6</td>', 'An interesting effect, but the composition of the pigeons looks random and chaotic. I like the use of contrast and grain. 6', '2003-09-29 09:16:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433814, 39870, 9287, '<td valign="top">like this idea, very nice</td>', 'like this idea, very nice', '2003-09-29 09:16:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(433815, 40078, 9287, '<td valign="top">Flight? I don''t get it, sorry. 3</td>', 'Flight? I don''t get it, sorry. 3', '2003-09-29 09:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(433816, 39528, 8522, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sky, but the birds don''t take up enough of the frame for this to work for me. Shame about the burnt out highlights at the bottom of the frame. 6</td>', 'Beautiful sky, but the birds don''t take up enough of the frame for this to work for me. Shame about the burnt out highlights at the bottom of the frame. 6', '2003-09-29 09:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(433817, 39876, 8522, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t work for me centred in the frame. Maybe rule of thirds could have helped? A little underexposed for my taste. 5</td>', 'This doesn''t work for me centred in the frame. Maybe rule of thirds could have helped? A little underexposed for my taste. 5', '2003-09-29 09:19:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(433818, 39957, 8522, '<td valign="top">Very, very nice. Not sure about the crop though... the ratio of bird to water doesn''t balance for me. Either a much tighter crop, or more water to the right could have worked I think. Maybe rotating the shot so the bird is flying more toward the upper right hand corner could have made this more effective. Beautiful textures captured in the water. 6</td>', 'Very, very nice. Not sure about the crop though... the ratio of bird to water doesn''t balance for me. Either a much tighter crop, or more water to the right could have worked I think. Maybe rotating the shot so the bird is flying more toward the upper right hand corner could have made this more effective. Beautiful textures captured in the water. 6', '2003-09-29 09:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(433820, 39802, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very well exposed. Great sky. One small quibble... I''d have lowered or raised the shot so the horizon did''t cut across his torso. I also think a tighter crop would have worked better. 8</td>', 'Nice shot, very well exposed. Great sky. One small quibble... I''d have lowered or raised the shot so the horizon did''t cut across his torso. I also think a tighter crop would have worked better. 8', '2003-09-29 09:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(433822, 40085, 8522, '<td valign="top">That nice, delicate feather and that horrible obtrusive blocky border. Shame. Score: 7<br/>Without border, score maybe: 9<br/>Nice use of negative space.</td>', 'That nice, delicate feather and that horrible obtrusive blocky border. Shame. Score: 7Without border, score maybe: 9Nice use of negative space.', '2003-09-29 09:25:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(433823, 39949, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great light, effective composition. I like the cloud. Border a bit thick for this photo in my opinion. 7</td>', 'Great light, effective composition. I like the cloud. Border a bit thick for this photo in my opinion. 7', '2003-09-29 09:26:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(433825, 39956, 8522, '<td valign="top">Far too much sharpening, you can see artifacting around all the pigeons as a result. Could do with a bit more saturation. Copmposition seems a bit chaotic. 5</td>', 'Far too much sharpening, you can see artifacting around all the pigeons as a result. Could do with a bit more saturation. Copmposition seems a bit chaotic. 5', '2003-09-29 09:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(433826, 39580, 772, '<td valign="top">one of the best photos I have ever seen on dpchallenge... i love it.. = 10</td>', 'one of the best photos I have ever seen on dpchallenge... i love it.. = 10', '2003-09-29 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(433827, 39603, 8522, '<td valign="top">Shame it''s out of focus. 4</td>', 'Shame it''s out of focus. 4', '2003-09-29 09:29:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(433829, 39869, 8522, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the hue you''ve chosen for your duotone, I think playing about with Colour Balance could have done wonders for this shot. Nice composition. 6</td>', 'Not sure about the hue you''ve chosen for your duotone, I think playing about with Colour Balance could have done wonders for this shot. Nice composition. 6', '2003-09-29 09:31:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(433831, 39954, 8522, '<td valign="top">Hmm, very much ''out of the blue'' unless it''s going tail first. I''d have liked a little more detail in the sky. The plane is already sillhouetted, so you didn''t need to over-expose this much.  5</td>', 'Hmm, very much ''out of the blue'' unless it''s going tail first. I''d have liked a little more detail in the sky. The plane is already sillhouetted, so you didn''t need to over-expose this much.  5', '2003-09-29 09:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(433832, 39933, 4639, '<td valign="top">I would suggest a crop down and in on both sides to reduse the sense that the clipped wings was unintentional. That focus here is the talons leaving the perch. If you were to crop down enough, you might not need to crop the sides. Great focus on the feet!</td>', 'I would suggest a crop down and in on both sides to reduse the sense that the clipped wings was unintentional. That focus here is the talons leaving the perch. If you were to crop down enough, you might not need to crop the sides. Great focus on the feet!', '2003-09-29 09:37:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(433833, 40081, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great shot, gorgeous light. Not sure about your crop though. You can see artifacting around the bird as a result of over-sharpening. 7<br/>Edit: I''m always baffled as to why I feel that some people mark out my comments as not being helpful.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-06 11:21:58.</i></td>', 'Great shot, gorgeous light. Not sure about your crop though. You can see artifacting around the bird as a result of over-sharpening. 7Edit: I''m always baffled as to why I feel that some people mark out my comments as not being helpful.', '2003-09-29 09:37:49.000000', '2003-10-06 12:21:58.000000', 1),
(433834, 39124, 4639, '<td valign="top">Very nice use of space!</td>', 'Very nice use of space!', '2003-09-29 09:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(433835, 39891, 8522, '<td valign="top">Could have done with a tighter crop. Great shot though, the foreground tree is very effective. 7</td>', 'Could have done with a tighter crop. Great shot though, the foreground tree is very effective. 7', '2003-09-29 09:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433836, 39893, 4639, '<td valign="top">I would have prefered the bubble in focus and the background blurred for this challenge. There is certainly artistic merit to this image the way that you have it.</td>', 'I would have prefered the bubble in focus and the background blurred for this challenge. There is certainly artistic merit to this image the way that you have it.', '2003-09-29 09:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(433838, 39991, 4639, '<td valign="top">Very "Hitchcockian" (if that is a word). I have a slight issue with the right edge of the builing on this one. The bright wedge of light really draws my eye. It might be worth the loss of the to right birds to crop.</td>', 'Very "Hitchcockian" (if that is a word). I have a slight issue with the right edge of the builing on this one. The bright wedge of light really draws my eye. It might be worth the loss of the to right birds to crop.', '2003-09-29 09:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(433839, 40071, 4639, '<td valign="top">Whoa! I hope that you did not get hit by any falling matter. This image is way overexposed. In a situation like this, you should meter the sky first and then set you camera for those high light exposures. I do not know what camera you have or the cercumstances of this shot so I can only be broad in my suggestion.</td>', 'Whoa! I hope that you did not get hit by any falling matter. This image is way overexposed. In a situation like this, you should meter the sky first and then set you camera for those high light exposures. I do not know what camera you have or the cercumstances of this shot so I can only be broad in my suggestion.', '2003-09-29 09:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433840, 40081, 4639, '<td valign="top">Very interesting light!</td>', 'Very interesting light!', '2003-09-29 09:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(433845, 39184, 4639, '<td valign="top">You should watch your horizon lines. In my opinion, this should have been rotated or cropped up. Good focus on the helicopter.</td>', 'You should watch your horizon lines. In my opinion, this should have been rotated or cropped up. Good focus on the helicopter.', '2003-09-29 09:50:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(433846, 39802, 4639, '<td valign="top">Very nicely executed! I love the choice of tones!</td>', 'Very nicely executed! I love the choice of tones!', '2003-09-29 09:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(433847, 39044, 4639, '<td valign="top">Shots like this do not get enough credit! Great color and composition!</td>', 'Shots like this do not get enough credit! Great color and composition!', '2003-09-29 09:51:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(433848, 39986, 4639, '<td valign="top">Very nice. I feel that it does not need the frame line though. I think that it crowds the subject. Just my ever so humble opinion. Survey says...</td>', 'Very nice. I feel that it does not need the frame line though. I think that it crowds the subject. Just my ever so humble opinion. Survey says...', '2003-09-29 09:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(433854, 39984, 9504, '<td valign="top">I just love the character of this shot.  I love title, the lighting, the differences of each bird in flight -- everything!!  Solid 10 from me.  Excellent capture!</td>', 'I just love the character of this shot.  I love title, the lighting, the differences of each bird in flight -- everything!!  Solid 10 from me.  Excellent capture!', '2003-09-29 10:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(433857, 39521, 9504, '<td valign="top">What an exceptional photo!  The facial expression of this guy says "I''m having a blast!!" <br/> <br/>I love the ocean in the background and the footprints.   He looks like a young dog, is he? <br/> <br/>As an animal lover, you can''t help but be captivated by this shot.<br/> <br/>Great photo.  You get a 10 from me for this one!!</td>', 'What an exceptional photo!  The facial expression of this guy says "I''m having a blast!!"  I love the ocean in the background and the footprints.   He looks like a young dog, is he?  As an animal lover, you can''t help but be captivated by this shot. Great photo.  You get a 10 from me for this one!!', '2003-09-29 10:15:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(433859, 39133, 9504, '<td valign="top">Excellent, excellent photo.  It is a little busy in the background but not enough to bother me because your capture of the hummer is so perfect.  Solid 10.</td>', 'Excellent, excellent photo.  It is a little busy in the background but not enough to bother me because your capture of the hummer is so perfect.  Solid 10.', '2003-09-29 10:16:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(433866, 40047, 9504, '<td valign="top">This looks like a toy model plane -- not a real one -- but on close inspection, you see the people, the propeller moving and other signs of flight.  Incredible capture!!!  If you aren''t a professional photographer for a living -- maybe you should consider it?  My highest compliments...10<br/> <br/>You''ll win this challenge, hands down.  Congrats!</td>', 'This looks like a toy model plane -- not a real one -- but on close inspection, you see the people, the propeller moving and other signs of flight.  Incredible capture!!!  If you aren''t a professional photographer for a living -- maybe you should consider it?  My highest compliments...10 You''ll win this challenge, hands down.  Congrats!', '2003-09-29 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(433895, 39133, 772, '<td valign="top">Your hummingbird photos are some of the best I have seen... i hope you are planning to get these published somewhere :) = 10</td>', 'Your hummingbird photos are some of the best I have seen... i hope you are planning to get these published somewhere :) = 10', '2003-09-29 11:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(433898, 39602, 772, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot... reminds me of some scene from an old alfred hitchcock movie :) = 10</td>', 'beautiful shot... reminds me of some scene from an old alfred hitchcock movie :) = 10', '2003-09-29 11:13:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(433909, 39802, 8159, '<td valign="top">Excellent interpretation of the challenge. I think the modifier (in this case, the boy) is what will set this picture apart from many of the others in the challenge. Well done.</td>', 'Excellent interpretation of the challenge. I think the modifier (in this case, the boy) is what will set this picture apart from many of the others in the challenge. Well done.', '2003-09-29 11:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(433916, 39602, 8159, '<td valign="top">I really like how the slow shutter speed has captured the birds motion and blurred their wings slightly. Combined with the duotone coloring of the image, it really adds a sense of "feeling" to this image. The bales of hay are a great setting... I can almost hear the birds "cawing"...</td>', 'I really like how the slow shutter speed has captured the birds motion and blurred their wings slightly. Combined with the duotone coloring of the image, it really adds a sense of "feeling" to this image. The bales of hay are a great setting... I can almost hear the birds "cawing"...', '2003-09-29 11:48:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(433917, 40055, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the blurred tree limbs in the foreground.  It gives the some sense of depth.  Nice framing and good focus.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like the blurred tree limbs in the foreground.  It gives the some sense of depth.  Nice framing and good focus.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-09-29 11:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(433921, 39870, 8159, '<td valign="top">I would have rated this higher if the little seed was floating above and to the right of the plant (dandelion?) since the challenge brief specifically says to photograph something "in flight". Nice composition and macro though.</td>', 'I would have rated this higher if the little seed was floating above and to the right of the plant (dandelion?) since the challenge brief specifically says to photograph something "in flight". Nice composition and macro though.', '2003-09-29 11:55:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(433923, 39949, 472, '<td valign="top">beautiful wing light.  i think for this kind of subject, people wanted to see it really close. not unlike the winning bug shots.  i like the comp alot tho. 8.</td>', 'beautiful wing light.  i think for this kind of subject, people wanted to see it really close. not unlike the winning bug shots.  i like the comp alot tho. 8.', '2003-09-29 11:57:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(433924, 40071, 3599, '<td valign="top">First impression for this photo is that it is too grainy and over sharpened however at second glance I like it.  It reminds me of the movie "The Birds".  Maybe the title Homage to Hitchcock would fit this photo better?</td>', 'First impression for this photo is that it is too grainy and over sharpened however at second glance I like it.  It reminds me of the movie "The Birds".  Maybe the title Homage to Hitchcock would fit this photo better?', '2003-09-29 11:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433925, 39802, 472, '<td valign="top">Great light, composition, and execution.  Hope you get a ribbon!</td>', 'Great light, composition, and execution.  Hope you get a ribbon!', '2003-09-29 11:59:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(433926, 40078, 714, '<td valign="top">Your idea is awesome.  Looks like you have a cheap camera or had to zoom in and then crop quite a bit.  Good luck!</td>', 'Your idea is awesome.  Looks like you have a cheap camera or had to zoom in and then crop quite a bit.  Good luck!', '2003-09-29 12:00:02.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(433927, 40047, 472, '<td valign="top">wow!! will probably win!!</td>', 'wow!! will probably win!!', '2003-09-29 12:00:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(433930, 39991, 472, '<td valign="top">love the moodiness</td>', 'love the moodiness', '2003-09-29 12:01:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(433931, 39985, 472, '<td valign="top">yippee!! fun!!! :)</td>', 'yippee!! fun!!! :)', '2003-09-29 12:01:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(433932, 39959, 472, '<td valign="top">the best gull shot yet!</td>', 'the best gull shot yet!', '2003-09-29 12:01:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(433933, 39964, 714, '<td valign="top">lol this is a great shot!  Really makes me wonder if it is being thrown out the window by a girlfriend or what!  Very creative.</td>', 'lol this is a great shot!  Really makes me wonder if it is being thrown out the window by a girlfriend or what!  Very creative.', '2003-09-29 12:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(433934, 40035, 3599, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure what technic was applied here.  I like the contrast between the birds and the background.</td>', 'I''m not sure what technic was applied here.  I like the contrast between the birds and the background.', '2003-09-29 12:02:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(433938, 39986, 714, '<td valign="top">Very nice!  I like the border I wish I there was more sky around the plane.  Good luck.</td>', 'Very nice!  I like the border I wish I there was more sky around the plane.  Good luck.', '2003-09-29 12:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(433939, 39554, 8159, '<td valign="top">I have the exact same garbage can! Cool stroboscopic effect. But unfortunately this is "falling" to me and not "in flight".</td>', 'I have the exact same garbage can! Cool stroboscopic effect. But unfortunately this is "falling" to me and not "in flight".', '2003-09-29 12:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(433940, 40094, 3599, '<td valign="top">Maybe it is because the photo is really small but I can''t see any flight in this photo.</td>', 'Maybe it is because the photo is really small but I can''t see any flight in this photo.', '2003-09-29 12:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(433943, 39905, 10686, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, but I don''t care for the background. I think either a darker background or one with a bit more detail would help. Also, there seems to be quite a bit of noise.</td>', 'Interesting shot, but I don''t care for the background. I think either a darker background or one with a bit more detail would help. Also, there seems to be quite a bit of noise.', '2003-09-29 12:07:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(433944, 40081, 8159, '<td valign="top">Ok, this blows away my seagull shot! Nice and close and the positioning of the subject within the frame is great. Love the light and the shallow DOF that blurs out the water. Terrific job!</td>', 'Ok, this blows away my seagull shot! Nice and close and the positioning of the subject within the frame is great. Love the light and the shallow DOF that blurs out the water. Terrific job!', '2003-09-29 12:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(433945, 39542, 714, '<td valign="top">This is a very creative kids shot.  I like the fact that you are only showing the arms of the dad.  She looks so high!!  As a mother I don''t think i would let my hubby do that. hehe</td>', 'This is a very creative kids shot.  I like the fact that you are only showing the arms of the dad.  She looks so high!!  As a mother I don''t think i would let my hubby do that. hehe', '2003-09-29 12:08:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(433946, 39884, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the silhoutte of the bird on the water.  I personally don''t like the fact that your subject is centered, I would try something a little of center.</td>', 'I like the silhoutte of the bird on the water.  I personally don''t like the fact that your subject is centered, I would try something a little of center.', '2003-09-29 12:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(433947, 40069, 10686, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, but for insect shots, I like to see much sharper shots.</td>', 'I like the idea, but for insect shots, I like to see much sharper shots.', '2003-09-29 12:08:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(433949, 39528, 714, '<td valign="top">I wouldn''t mind a bit more cropping to get rid of the white at the bottom.  Very pretty colors! Good luck!</td>', 'I wouldn''t mind a bit more cropping to get rid of the white at the bottom.  Very pretty colors! Good luck!', '2003-09-29 12:09:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(433950, 39957, 714, '<td valign="top">The water almosts looks fake.  Very nice!</td>', 'The water almosts looks fake.  Very nice!', '2003-09-29 12:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(433952, 39990, 10686, '<td valign="top">Great shot, might like to see what a wider shot looked like.</td>', 'Great shot, might like to see what a wider shot looked like.', '2003-09-29 12:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(433953, 40083, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like the fact you gave the bird space to fly into.  Good composition.</td>', 'I like the fact you gave the bird space to fly into.  Good composition.', '2003-09-29 12:12:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(433954, 40048, 2, '<td valign="top">Beautiful use of negative space and shapes.  Amazing colors.  Certainly a 10.</td>', 'Beautiful use of negative space and shapes.  Amazing colors.  Certainly a 10.', '2003-09-29 12:12:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(433956, 40093, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but the subject''s hair and pants blend too much with the background and the overall setting is not very pleasing.</td>', 'Nice idea, but the subject''s hair and pants blend too much with the background and the overall setting is not very pleasing.', '2003-09-29 12:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(433957, 40080, 714, '<td valign="top">Great image!  You should be proud of this shot!  Perfect in my opinion!  Good luck!</td>', 'Great image!  You should be proud of this shot!  Perfect in my opinion!  Good luck!', '2003-09-29 12:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(433958, 39563, 3599, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I like the composition of this photo.  I''d prefer to see where he is flying as opposed to where he came from.  Still a great capture of the bird though.</td>', 'I''m not sure I like the composition of this photo.  I''d prefer to see where he is flying as opposed to where he came from.  Still a great capture of the bird though.', '2003-09-29 12:15:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(433959, 40048, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. To me though, the plane is moving away, which suggests that it is leaving, not coming home as the title suggests. No points off for that though.</td>', 'Nice shot. To me though, the plane is moving away, which suggests that it is leaving, not coming home as the title suggests. No points off for that though.', '2003-09-29 12:15:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(433960, 39794, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice tight shot, poor image quality though.</td>', 'Nice tight shot, poor image quality though.', '2003-09-29 12:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(433961, 40026, 3599, '<td valign="top">Good composition and focus.  Nice work.</td>', 'Good composition and focus.  Nice work.', '2003-09-29 12:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(433962, 39966, 11182, '<td valign="top">I love this picture! It''s spectacular.</td>', 'I love this picture! It''s spectacular.', '2003-09-29 12:18:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(433964, 39849, 714, '<td valign="top">HOw on earth did you get this shot?  This shot rocks.  Good luck!</td>', 'HOw on earth did you get this shot?  This shot rocks.  Good luck!', '2003-09-29 12:20:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(433971, 39956, 10686, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the structure and vehicle (whatever that yellow thing is) on the right distract me from the birds. I think this would be much better if the right side was cropped.</td>', 'Good shot, but the structure and vehicle (whatever that yellow thing is) on the right distract me from the birds. I think this would be much better if the right side was cropped.', '2003-09-29 12:24:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(433974, 40042, 10686, '<td valign="top">The tether contradicts the title</td>', 'The tether contradicts the title', '2003-09-29 12:25:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(433975, 39949, 714, '<td valign="top">The colors here are very nice and suddle.  Makes for a peaceful looking shot.  I really like the angle and composition!</td>', 'The colors here are very nice and suddle.  Makes for a peaceful looking shot.  I really like the angle and composition!', '2003-09-29 12:26:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(433977, 39133, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow! Excellent shot!</td>', 'Wow! Excellent shot!', '2003-09-29 12:26:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(433978, 39990, 714, '<td valign="top">That looks like fun.  I would have like a little more sky.</td>', 'That looks like fun.  I would have like a little more sky.', '2003-09-29 12:28:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(433984, 40041, 10686, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2003-09-29 12:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(433986, 40096, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice pan! I think the bottom could be cropped off</td>', 'Nice pan! I think the bottom could be cropped off', '2003-09-29 12:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(433988, 40081, 10686, '<td valign="top">SHarp, nice light. A very good shot, and I don''t even like birds..</td>', 'SHarp, nice light. A very good shot, and I don''t even like birds..', '2003-09-29 12:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(433990, 39192, 10686, '<td valign="top">nice shot, terrible image quality.</td>', 'nice shot, terrible image quality.', '2003-09-29 12:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(433991, 39954, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice sky, but the plane is too dark</td>', 'Nice sky, but the plane is too dark', '2003-09-29 12:38:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(433992, 39867, 10686, '<td valign="top">Nice use of foreground elements.</td>', 'Nice use of foreground elements.', '2003-09-29 12:39:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(433998, 39994, 2764, '<td valign="top">starighten it</td>', 'starighten it', '2003-09-29 12:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
