(434006, 39314, 2764, '<td valign="top">more pixels please</td>', 'more pixels please', '2003-09-29 13:00:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(434008, 39649, 2764, '<td valign="top">The border is confining it makes the whole scene feel crowded.</td>', 'The border is confining it makes the whole scene feel crowded.', '2003-09-29 13:02:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434009, 39849, 3599, '<td valign="top">Splendid photo.  I''m interested to know how you got this shot.</td>', 'Splendid photo.  I''m interested to know how you got this shot.', '2003-09-29 13:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(434011, 40041, 8522, '<td valign="top">Great colours, although the detail has gone on the highlights. Shame the clouds weren''t more dramatic. I''m not sure about the right to left composition. 6</td>', 'Great colours, although the detail has gone on the highlights. Shame the clouds weren''t more dramatic. I''m not sure about the right to left composition. 6', '2003-09-29 13:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(434012, 40043, 8522, '<td valign="top">There''s an awful lot of negative space, which is exaggerated by the fact that the plane is facing away from it. 5</td>', 'There''s an awful lot of negative space, which is exaggerated by the fact that the plane is facing away from it. 5', '2003-09-29 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(434015, 39910, 8522, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t appear to be in flight. 3</td>', 'Doesn''t appear to be in flight. 3', '2003-09-29 13:10:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(434020, 39133, 7969, '<td valign="top">The bird is great here, sharp, clear.  The background while slightly blurred is still a bit busy unfortunately (probably camera limitation). well done</td>', 'The bird is great here, sharp, clear.  The background while slightly blurred is still a bit busy unfortunately (probably camera limitation). well done', '2003-09-29 13:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(434022, 39910, 3599, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The reflection is great.  It looks like your at an airshow.  Was there nothing in flight that you could take photos of?  Your photo is one of the best looking of the challenge but it isn''t in flight.  I''m sorry but I have to vote this down on that fact.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The reflection is great.  It looks like your at an airshow.  Was there nothing in flight that you could take photos of?  Your photo is one of the best looking of the challenge but it isn''t in flight.  I''m sorry but I have to vote this down on that fact.', '2003-09-29 13:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(434024, 39959, 7969, '<td valign="top">This is a great capture, too bad did n''t get wing in, not that it matters, is still really sharp, close and has great lighting  and tones. After spending many hours this week trying for a good shot of a flying bird I know how hard it is!!</td>', 'This is a great capture, too bad did n''t get wing in, not that it matters, is still really sharp, close and has great lighting  and tones. After spending many hours this week trying for a good shot of a flying bird I know how hard it is!!', '2003-09-29 13:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(434025, 40090, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and composition, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice subject and composition, good luck in the challenge.', '2003-09-29 13:16:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(434027, 39985, 6504, '<td valign="top">Most creative shot!  The dress is a perfect butterfly dress.  Good and clear.</td>', 'Most creative shot!  The dress is a perfect butterfly dress.  Good and clear.', '2003-09-29 13:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(434028, 39936, 3599, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you got this but it''s pretty cool.  I like that you didn''t use a higher speed to freeze its wings.  I think freezing them would''ve made this look fake.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Don''t know how you got this but it''s pretty cool.  I like that you didn''t use a higher speed to freeze its wings.  I think freezing them would''ve made this look fake.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-09-29 13:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(434029, 39984, 7969, '<td valign="top">LOl this one is funny, the one on the left looks like he has forgotten how to fly and was thrown from a plane, impressive you got 2 flying birds, I had hard enough time getting one!</td>', 'LOl this one is funny, the one on the left looks like he has forgotten how to fly and was thrown from a plane, impressive you got 2 flying birds, I had hard enough time getting one!', '2003-09-29 13:19:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(434030, 39133, 6504, '<td valign="top">Very good shot of a hummingbird.   These little beauties are not easy to capture, they''re so fast.  But you did a beautiful job!  Nice clear picture. What kind is he?</td>', 'Very good shot of a hummingbird.   These little beauties are not easy to capture, they''re so fast.  But you did a beautiful job!  Nice clear picture. What kind is he?', '2003-09-29 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(434032, 40019, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very humorous.  Good timing with this one.</td>', 'Very humorous.  Good timing with this one.', '2003-09-29 13:20:40.000000', NULL, 1),
