(434037, 39554, 6504, '<td valign="top">Creative!   How in the world did you do it?   I like the simplicity of the shot.</td>', 'Creative!   How in the world did you do it?   I like the simplicity of the shot.', '2003-09-29 13:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
