(434141, 39991, 10985, '<td valign="top">Lost of mood, here. I like this.</td>', 'Lost of mood, here. I like this.', '2003-09-29 14:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(434147, 39563, 675, '<td valign="top">i don''t know why you chose to crop this picture this way, i think in cases like this, the bird would look better entering the frame from the upper right corner, rather than leaving the lower left corner</td>', 'i don''t know why you chose to crop this picture this way, i think in cases like this, the bird would look better entering the frame from the upper right corner, rather than leaving the lower left corner', '2003-09-29 14:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(434148, 39991, 11923, '<td valign="top">Very dramatic.  I like the imagery this brings forth.  I''m not usually fond of darker photographs but this one works very well!   I like it because the birds are completely in silhouette as is the building.  Great job!</td>', 'Very dramatic.  I like the imagery this brings forth.  I''m not usually fond of darker photographs but this one works very well!   I like it because the birds are completely in silhouette as is the building.  Great job!', '2003-09-29 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(434157, 39802, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ok, This is the BEST shot of the challenge! I wouldn''t change a thing! Thanks for inspiring! :o) 10!!!!!!!</td>', 'Ok, This is the BEST shot of the challenge! I wouldn''t change a thing! Thanks for inspiring! :o) 10!!!!!!!', '2003-09-29 14:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(434158, 39901, 4482, '<td valign="top">Technically balloons float not fly.  ;-) Nice shot noetheless! I don''t think that the use of shallow DOF adds anything to the photo. My eye tends to want to see the other balloon in focus as well. 5</td>', 'Technically balloons float not fly.  ;-) Nice shot noetheless! I don''t think that the use of shallow DOF adds anything to the photo. My eye tends to want to see the other balloon in focus as well. 5', '2003-09-29 14:37:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(434161, 39542, 4482, '<td valign="top">In my tops! Original and the croppinf isn''t too tight. To get a stonger effect it would''ve been nice to see some blue sky the thrower and the kid''s feet. Justa tad oversaturated blue but the DPCers will love that! ;-) 8</td>', 'In my tops! Original and the croppinf isn''t too tight. To get a stonger effect it would''ve been nice to see some blue sky the thrower and the kid''s feet. Justa tad oversaturated blue but the DPCers will love that! ;-) 8', '2003-09-29 14:40:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(434163, 39666, 675, '<td valign="top">great closeup, not in flight</td>', 'great closeup, not in flight', '2003-09-29 14:41:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(434166, 39992, 327, '<td valign="top">I see what you were trying to capture...however I believe all the background [crane, truck] are distracting. the color is good and the idea is very good. Yes, I do see this as flight. Good.</td>', 'I see what you were trying to capture...however I believe all the background [crane, truck] are distracting. the color is good and the idea is very good. Yes, I do see this as flight. Good.', '2003-09-29 14:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(434167, 39867, 327, '<td valign="top">Color is very nice. The foreground is very distracting and most of it could of been cropped out. You sure did hit the challenge on the head.</td>', 'Color is very nice. The foreground is very distracting and most of it could of been cropped out. You sure did hit the challenge on the head.', '2003-09-29 14:46:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(434169, 40042, 4482, '<td valign="top">Nice shot and points for originality! The colors are greatand the angle adds a dynatic feel to the photo. Good job! 8</td>', 'Nice shot and points for originality! The colors are greatand the angle adds a dynatic feel to the photo. Good job! 8', '2003-09-29 14:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(434170, 40079, 327, '<td valign="top">Neat capture. Little grain/noise but a wonderful plane just the same.</td>', 'Neat capture. Little grain/noise but a wonderful plane just the same.', '2003-09-29 14:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(434173, 40041, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting to look at and defiantly on the challenge.</td>', 'Interesting to look at and defiantly on the challenge.', '2003-09-29 14:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434176, 39818, 327, '<td valign="top">Of course the shot would of been great if the bee was in focus and facing the camera. Still I do like this shot....the color is very rich and the challenge has been met.</td>', 'Of course the shot would of been great if the bee was in focus and facing the camera. Still I do like this shot....the color is very rich and the challenge has been met.', '2003-09-29 14:48:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(434177, 40081, 675, '<td valign="top">what''s with the colors? is that natural? or a photoshop desaturation?</td>', 'what''s with the colors? is that natural? or a photoshop desaturation?', '2003-09-29 14:48:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(434178, 39991, 4482, '<td valign="top">Nice mood on your pic. My eye is drawn more towards the building than the birds... maybe cropping a chuck out would help focus back on the birds. :-) 6</td>', 'Nice mood on your pic. My eye is drawn more towards the building than the birds... maybe cropping a chuck out would help focus back on the birds. :-) 6', '2003-09-29 14:48:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(434179, 39898, 327, '<td valign="top">Swimming or flight. LOL I get the idea and think it works okay.</td>', 'Swimming or flight. LOL I get the idea and think it works okay.', '2003-09-29 14:49:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(434181, 40017, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice light and nice over all shot. Yes, on the challenge topic.</td>', 'Nice light and nice over all shot. Yes, on the challenge topic.', '2003-09-29 14:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(434182, 39649, 327, '<td valign="top">Cool clouds and you were sure in a good spot for this shot.</td>', 'Cool clouds and you were sure in a good spot for this shot.', '2003-09-29 14:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(434183, 39528, 4482, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh... the DPCer will love this one i think. :-) I like it but the white at the botom distracts me from the birds. Considering the amount of clouds, cropping the white out would improve it IMO. Still a nice 7 from me. Great capture!</td>', 'Ahhhh... the DPCer will love this one i think. :-) I like it but the white at the botom distracts me from the birds. Considering the amount of clouds, cropping the white out would improve it IMO. Still a nice 7 from me. Great capture!', '2003-09-29 14:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(434184, 39986, 327, '<td valign="top">I love gliders...love them.This is a super shot. Really well done and 10 from me.</td>', 'I love gliders...love them.This is a super shot. Really well done and 10 from me.', '2003-09-29 14:50:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434186, 39884, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely color of blue here. I guess the lack of focus is the only down fall to this photo.</td>', 'Lovely color of blue here. I guess the lack of focus is the only down fall to this photo.', '2003-09-29 14:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(434188, 40083, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot, good title also.</td>', 'Pretty shot, good title also.', '2003-09-29 14:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(434191, 39644, 4482, '<td valign="top">Hehehe... funny. :-)  I see the shadow of the photographer... booboo #1. The colors are good but a full superman costume would''ve helped! :-)<br/></td>', 'Hehehe... funny. :-)  I see the shadow of the photographer... booboo #1. The colors are good but a full superman costume would''ve helped! :-)', '2003-09-29 14:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(434193, 39666, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. The focus could of been a bit more sharp along with a bit more light on the bird. This is very good and I applaud you.</td>', 'Nice capture. The focus could of been a bit more sharp along with a bit more light on the bird. This is very good and I applaud you.', '2003-09-29 14:53:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(434197, 39886, 327, '<td valign="top">Humm, this is really a neat shot. I like the outline affect of the gull.</td>', 'Humm, this is really a neat shot. I like the outline affect of the gull.', '2003-09-29 14:54:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434198, 39886, 4482, '<td valign="top">Another bird shot better than mine! Crap! :-)  The mood in this one is just fab! I would''nt change a thing with cropping and levels. Superb shot! 9</td>', 'Another bird shot better than mine! Crap! :-)  The mood in this one is just fab! I would''nt change a thing with cropping and levels. Superb shot! 9', '2003-09-29 14:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(434204, 39870, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe more focus and more levels adjustment was needed here. I do think this is a creative idea for the challenge and for the most part not a bad shot at all.</td>', 'Maybe more focus and more levels adjustment was needed here. I do think this is a creative idea for the challenge and for the most part not a bad shot at all.', '2003-09-29 14:55:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(434205, 40041, 675, '<td valign="top">why not rotate 90 degrees clockwise....would be much more striking</td>', 'why not rotate 90 degrees clockwise....would be much more striking', '2003-09-29 14:55:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(434210, 39966, 327, '<td valign="top">Nice blue and creative idea. I don''t think the composition added to this shot. The trees are more of a distraction to my eye.</td>', 'Nice blue and creative idea. I don''t think the composition added to this shot. The trees are more of a distraction to my eye.', '2003-09-29 14:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434223, 40091, 327, '<td valign="top">I love the idea here. I think to improve it you should crop off the junky looking bottom..Of course I don''t know the conditions you were in. I have been there and the wind/cold are miserable to deal with. The shot is somewhat dark but over all very good...super skyline. I''m not sure I see ''flight''.</td>', 'I love the idea here. I think to improve it you should crop off the junky looking bottom..Of course I don''t know the conditions you were in. I have been there and the wind/cold are miserable to deal with. The shot is somewhat dark but over all very good...super skyline. I''m not sure I see ''flight''.', '2003-09-29 14:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434230, 40089, 675, '<td valign="top">what is that, i don''t get it...sorry</td>', 'what is that, i don''t get it...sorry', '2003-09-29 14:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(434231, 39863, 327, '<td valign="top">I like your shot. The focus need to be a bit more sharp along with a bit of color saturation........ but this is good. You sure did capture the challenge 100%. Great find.</td>', 'I like your shot. The focus need to be a bit more sharp along with a bit of color saturation........ but this is good. You sure did capture the challenge 100%. Great find.', '2003-09-29 15:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(434239, 39984, 327, '<td valign="top">Lovely light...sundown? I think you have captured the challenge well.  The shot could of been a bit more in focus and a lot more sharp. However, these are great examples of \''flight\''.</td>', 'Lovely light...sundown? I think you have captured the challenge well.  The shot could of been a bit more in focus and a lot more sharp. However, these are great examples of \''flight\''.', '2003-09-29 15:01:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(434246, 40045, 327, '<td valign="top">I think I''d of cropped out the pilings for this shot. I do think your title, and your shot are very good over all. You have ''flight'' here.</td>', 'I think I''d of cropped out the pilings for this shot. I do think your title, and your shot are very good over all. You have ''flight'' here.', '2003-09-29 15:03:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(434247, 39972, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the pastel, misty colors and the way the one gull "pops" out - the other two gulls give the viewer an idea of the motion in the picture.  I''d crop the top to make the background completely abstract.</td>', 'I like the pastel, misty colors and the way the one gull "pops" out - the other two gulls give the viewer an idea of the motion in the picture.  I''d crop the top to make the background completely abstract.', '2003-09-29 15:03:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434252, 39905, 327, '<td valign="top">Different, unique and fun to look at. I see flight and like it. Good job.</td>', 'Different, unique and fun to look at. I see flight and like it. Good job.', '2003-09-29 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(434256, 40062, 327, '<td valign="top">Wow this is nice. Negative space and pretty blue sky. Flight!</td>', 'Wow this is nice. Negative space and pretty blue sky. Flight!', '2003-09-29 15:04:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(434264, 39794, 327, '<td valign="top">Crop dusters are really fun to watch. Thanks for submitting this. The grain/noise is a bit of a bother but the blue and yellow are very nice. You really have flight here.</td>', 'Crop dusters are really fun to watch. Thanks for submitting this. The grain/noise is a bit of a bother but the blue and yellow are very nice. You really have flight here.', '2003-09-29 15:06:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(434272, 40048, 4411, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot. The sunrise/set creates great lighting on the plane. Very nicely composed.</td>', 'Lovely shot. The sunrise/set creates great lighting on the plane. Very nicely composed.', '2003-09-29 15:08:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(434276, 39884, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the light on the water, the dark shap of the bird.  Wish the subject weren''t dead center - perhaps with the bird more to the right and up we would feel the bird in flying into the space in front of it.</td>', 'I like the light on the water, the dark shap of the bird.  Wish the subject weren''t dead center - perhaps with the bird more to the right and up we would feel the bird in flying into the space in front of it.', '2003-09-29 15:09:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434279, 39870, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!  I really love the delicacy of the image.  Quite the perfect moment.  I think the lighting is wonderful.  Nice job!</td>', 'Beautiful!  I really love the delicacy of the image.  Quite the perfect moment.  I think the lighting is wonderful.  Nice job!', '2003-09-29 15:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434291, 40090, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice composition - you can feel the sweep of the pelican across the sky.  Wish the clouds had better definition - a polarizing filter or perhaps playing with contrast on the computer.</td>', 'Nice composition - you can feel the sweep of the pelican across the sky.  Wish the clouds had better definition - a polarizing filter or perhaps playing with contrast on the computer.', '2003-09-29 15:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(434301, 39738, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the tilt - mimics the twirling of the stunt kite.  I wish the kite were pointing up into all that open sky instead of swooping downward.</td>', 'I like the tilt - mimics the twirling of the stunt kite.  I wish the kite were pointing up into all that open sky instead of swooping downward.', '2003-09-29 15:14:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(434308, 39870, 8522, '<td valign="top">Composition seems a little unimaginative, other than that this is great. Very effective lighting and background, the dof resulting in the foreground being a little out of focus works well here. Nice idea. 7</td>', 'Composition seems a little unimaginative, other than that this is great. Very effective lighting and background, the dof resulting in the foreground being a little out of focus works well here. Nice idea. 7', '2003-09-29 15:16:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(434310, 39968, 7628, '<td valign="top">Fun subject, good illusion.  I wish the subject stood out better from the background - if he were wearing all black or red perhaps or if he were lit and the trees were darker.</td>', 'Fun subject, good illusion.  I wish the subject stood out better from the background - if he were wearing all black or red perhaps or if he were lit and the trees were darker.', '2003-09-29 15:16:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(434315, 40089, 1897, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t you get him to look at the camera? <br/> <br/>What a shot!</td>', 'Couldn''t you get him to look at the camera?  What a shot!', '2003-09-29 15:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434323, 39580, 7628, '<td valign="top">Intriguing lighting.  It is hard to understand what you''re looking at at first, it makes you think, but maybe think too hard.  Perhaps cropping in on the sides would help make the subject more central, and the glare less apparent,</td>', 'Intriguing lighting.  It is hard to understand what you''re looking at at first, it makes you think, but maybe think too hard.  Perhaps cropping in on the sides would help make the subject more central, and the glare less apparent,', '2003-09-29 15:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434328, 39580, 11923, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo!  I usually don''t like images like this, but this one really works for me.  The color is fresh and even the glow from the sun to me enhances the feel of the image.</td>', 'I really like this photo!  I usually don''t like images like this, but this one really works for me.  The color is fresh and even the glow from the sun to me enhances the feel of the image.', '2003-09-29 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(434329, 39542, 8522, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, very effective. I wonder why the sky is so noisy... did you leave the camera on a high ISO? Well done for not having too many extreme highlights in the harsh light. The foreground hands work nicely. 7</td>', 'Nice shot, very effective. I wonder why the sky is so noisy... did you leave the camera on a high ISO? Well done for not having too many extreme highlights in the harsh light. The foreground hands work nicely. 7', '2003-09-29 15:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(434340, 39994, 7628, '<td valign="top">The subject is very difused - instead of first looking at the birds - I see the light house, then I notice the red-shirted biker, them the rock wall, then I notice the flurry of birds.  Perhaps a less distracting background, and less birds, or a few central focused birds and blury periferal ones.</td>', 'The subject is very difused - instead of first looking at the birds - I see the light house, then I notice the red-shirted biker, them the rock wall, then I notice the flurry of birds.  Perhaps a less distracting background, and less birds, or a few central focused birds and blury periferal ones.', '2003-09-29 15:22:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(434342, 39644, 8522, '<td valign="top">Such a brilliant idea... for heaven''s sakes why didn''t you get down to the seafront where it''s more photogenic? And watch out for including your shadow in the shot. Maybe you could have persuaded a swimmer to pretend they were in trouble... 5</td>', 'Such a brilliant idea... for heaven''s sakes why didn''t you get down to the seafront where it''s more photogenic? And watch out for including your shadow in the shot. Maybe you could have persuaded a swimmer to pretend they were in trouble... 5', '2003-09-29 15:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(434345, 39949, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the golden light on the wing, gives dimesnion to the bord and atmosphere to the picture.</td>', 'I like the golden light on the wing, gives dimesnion to the bord and atmosphere to the picture.', '2003-09-29 15:23:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434351, 39990, 8522, '<td valign="top">I wish he was flying INTO the negative space. Very nice otherwise. 7</td>', 'I wish he was flying INTO the negative space. Very nice otherwise. 7', '2003-09-29 15:24:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(434352, 39471, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like the position of the bird - the splayed tail feathers, gray lines on wings streatching to the black tips.  Nice nutral background - wish the bird stood out a bit more - a little more contrast?</td>', 'I like the position of the bird - the splayed tail feathers, gray lines on wings streatching to the black tips.  Nice nutral background - wish the bird stood out a bit more - a little more contrast?', '2003-09-29 15:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434353, 39802, 7758, '<td valign="top">Great shot, it has a real ''innocence'' about it. Love the relationship between the boy and the plane, his eyes (actually moreso the angle of his head)  and hand lead the view in an almost ''circular'' fashion back to the plane. This works really well in sepia, adds to the mood of the photo and the freedom and innocence of a bygone era. I shall watch this one with interest come the end of the challenge, but I doubt I''ll have to get off the front page to find it. Good Luck, Todd. 10</td>', 'Great shot, it has a real ''innocence'' about it. Love the relationship between the boy and the plane, his eyes (actually moreso the angle of his head)  and hand lead the view in an almost ''circular'' fashion back to the plane. This works really well in sepia, adds to the mood of the photo and the freedom and innocence of a bygone era. I shall watch this one with interest come the end of the challenge, but I doubt I''ll have to get off the front page to find it. Good Luck, Todd. 10', '2003-09-29 15:25:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434358, 39812, 7628, '<td valign="top">I like how unusual this looks - to see the face of a moth, usually you see the wings.  I like the gradient in the background.  I wonder how it would look a bit darker?  The brightness matched the "soft landing" title, but it feel just too bright.</td>', 'I like how unusual this looks - to see the face of a moth, usually you see the wings.  I like the gradient in the background.  I wonder how it would look a bit darker?  The brightness matched the "soft landing" title, but it feel just too bright.', '2003-09-29 15:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(434359, 39956, 4411, '<td valign="top">Way too random for me. Where''s the focal point? What is there to draw the viewer into looking at the shot more closely? Had you been stood on the bridge with the birds flying towards you I think you may have got a much more engaging shot.</td>', 'Way too random for me. Where''s the focal point? What is there to draw the viewer into looking at the shot more closely? Had you been stood on the bridge with the birds flying towards you I think you may have got a much more engaging shot.', '2003-09-29 15:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(434360, 39873, 8522, '<td valign="top">The challenge said it should be ''in flight''. 2</td>', 'The challenge said it should be ''in flight''. 2', '2003-09-29 15:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434361, 39893, 11923, '<td valign="top">great photo! Normally I''d think the bubble should be in focus, but I like how the background''s sharpness sets up the soft focus, dreamish aspect of the bubble, which matches your title well.</td>', 'great photo! Normally I''d think the bubble should be in focus, but I like how the background''s sharpness sets up the soft focus, dreamish aspect of the bubble, which matches your title well.', '2003-09-29 15:29:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(434362, 39972, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice clarity of the subject gull.  A bit small but still is good.</td>', 'Nice clarity of the subject gull.  A bit small but still is good.', '2003-09-29 15:29:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(434363, 40089, 7758, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject matter. Not sure whether this is flying or falling! Either way it''s a great capture and is a great shot photojournalistically (is that a word?). Good Luck, Todd. 8</td>', 'Interesting subject matter. Not sure whether this is flying or falling! Either way it''s a great capture and is a great shot photojournalistically (is that a word?). Good Luck, Todd. 8', '2003-09-29 15:29:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(434364, 40094, 8522, '<td valign="top">Pushing the challenge, and photo is far too small to examine. 1</td>', 'Pushing the challenge, and photo is far too small to examine. 1', '2003-09-29 15:30:05.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(434365, 40040, 3569, '<td valign="top">Background a bit busy, but colors are nice.</td>', 'Background a bit busy, but colors are nice.', '2003-09-29 15:30:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(434366, 39964, 11923, '<td valign="top">This image really gives me the feeling of freedom from the constraints of the 9-5 workday world.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for, but there it is all the same!  I do think it would be better if a fair amount of the upper sky was cropped out, but other than that I like the color scheme and the subject!</td>', 'This image really gives me the feeling of freedom from the constraints of the 9-5 workday world.  I''m not sure if that''s what you were going for, but there it is all the same!  I do think it would be better if a fair amount of the upper sky was cropped out, but other than that I like the color scheme and the subject!', '2003-09-29 15:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434367, 39991, 7758, '<td valign="top">Very moody, almost creepy, shot. Well done. Good Luck, Todd. 8</td>', 'Very moody, almost creepy, shot. Well done. Good Luck, Todd. 8', '2003-09-29 15:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(434368, 40083, 8522, '<td valign="top">I''d have prefered the subject not vertically centred. Nice backlighting though. 7</td>', 'I''d have prefered the subject not vertically centred. Nice backlighting though. 7', '2003-09-29 15:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(434369, 40035, 3569, '<td valign="top">Interesting background use with the crows.  I might have cropped the crows in more tightly/vertically.</td>', 'Interesting background use with the crows.  I might have cropped the crows in more tightly/vertically.', '2003-09-29 15:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434370, 39812, 8522, '<td valign="top">''In flight''?<br/>Shame, as this is an interesting picture. 4</td>', '''In flight''?Shame, as this is an interesting picture. 4', '2003-09-29 15:32:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434372, 39124, 8522, '<td valign="top">WHY are most of the birds flying OUT of the negative space? This could have been such a strong photo if the bird was on the left flying to the right. 6</td>', 'WHY are most of the birds flying OUT of the negative space? This could have been such a strong photo if the bird was on the left flying to the right. 6', '2003-09-29 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(434373, 39984, 11923, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photograph!  I really like the interplay between the two birds - their body differences, one being more vertical and the other more horizontal with the nice orangey coloring makes the image more interesting.  Excellent :)</td>', 'Beautiful photograph!  I really like the interplay between the two birds - their body differences, one being more vertical and the other more horizontal with the nice orangey coloring makes the image more interesting.  Excellent :)', '2003-09-29 15:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(434374, 39192, 3569, '<td valign="top">Great capture, bald eagle stealing road kill from ravens.</td>', 'Great capture, bald eagle stealing road kill from ravens.', '2003-09-29 15:34:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(434375, 39580, 4411, '<td valign="top">Okay, you''re this weeks winner of the ''What the heck?'' award!<br/>Beats me, but I do know that I like it. Very dreamy, and I do see an ''angel''.</td>', 'Okay, you''re this weeks winner of the ''What the heck?'' award!Beats me, but I do know that I like it. Very dreamy, and I do see an ''angel''.', '2003-09-29 15:35:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(434376, 39928, 8522, '<td valign="top">Selective desat seems a bit gratuitous here. The composition seems a bit off, I''d have prefered more ground. This was probably to vertically centre the paraglider, again I''d have prefered him on one of the thirds. 5</td>', 'Selective desat seems a bit gratuitous here. The composition seems a bit off, I''d have prefered more ground. This was probably to vertically centre the paraglider, again I''d have prefered him on one of the thirds. 5', '2003-09-29 15:35:33.000000', NULL, 1),
