(434524, 40078, 11923, '<td valign="top">I have to admit, when I first looked at this I found the sun glare to be distracting and harsh and voted it lower.  I still do think it is a bit much, but after looking the photo over more I think it does give an interesting affect and have adjusted my vote accordingly.  I do like the reddish hue the glare gives, has a warm energy to it which would be expected from horses in ''flight''.</td>', 'I have to admit, when I first looked at this I found the sun glare to be distracting and harsh and voted it lower.  I still do think it is a bit much, but after looking the photo over more I think it does give an interesting affect and have adjusted my vote accordingly.  I do like the reddish hue the glare gives, has a warm energy to it which would be expected from horses in ''flight''.', '2003-09-29 17:53:15.000000', NULL, 1),
