(434531, 40026, 6624, '<td valign="top">lovely soft light and detail of feathers (and I love the title - dayes me but I remember the song)</td>', 'lovely soft light and detail of feathers (and I love the title - dayes me but I remember the song)', '2003-09-29 18:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(434539, 39542, 7758, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, I like the perspective on this shot. My only criticism would be I would have liked to have seen the left hand completely in the shot and perhaps a little space between the right hand and the feet..... little things I know, but I think it would make for a stronger image that way. I also realise it''s not always possible.... it''s a great shot though and conveys both a sense of ''flying'' and the complete trust between the child and the adult.<br/>Good Luck, Todd. 8</td>', 'Excellent shot, I like the perspective on this shot. My only criticism would be I would have liked to have seen the left hand completely in the shot and perhaps a little space between the right hand and the feet..... little things I know, but I think it would make for a stronger image that way. I also realise it''s not always possible.... it''s a great shot though and conveys both a sense of ''flying'' and the complete trust between the child and the adult.Good Luck, Todd. 8', '2003-09-29 18:37:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(434540, 39928, 327, '<td valign="top">Kool. Don''t know how they have the nerve to jump from a plane. Looks like a nice ride. Good color but the sky and ground are a bit lost.</td>', 'Kool. Don''t know how they have the nerve to jump from a plane. Looks like a nice ride. Good color but the sky and ground are a bit lost.', '2003-09-29 18:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
