(434557, 39968, 327, '<td valign="top">Dare devil? Wow good shot only sorry you weren''t a bit closer and moved a bit to the right. Still this is fine shooting.......good work and good action.</td>', 'Dare devil? Wow good shot only sorry you weren''t a bit closer and moved a bit to the right. Still this is fine shooting.......good work and good action.', '2003-09-29 18:54:29.000000', NULL, 1),
