(434583, 40095, 327, '<td valign="top">Not too bad of an example of flight. I guess it''s just a bit boring. I do think you had a good idea.</td>', 'Not too bad of an example of flight. I guess it''s just a bit boring. I do think you had a good idea.', '2003-09-29 19:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(434586, 40055, 327, '<td valign="top">Wonderful colors. I think the right could of been cropped out as it''s not adding to the shot. Well done focus light and colors.</td>', 'Wonderful colors. I think the right could of been cropped out as it''s not adding to the shot. Well done focus light and colors.', '2003-09-29 19:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(434587, 39563, 327, '<td valign="top">Marvelous shot. The colors and focus are really nice here. I also like your composition/crop.</td>', 'Marvelous shot. The colors and focus are really nice here. I also like your composition/crop.', '2003-09-29 19:13:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(434588, 39949, 327, '<td valign="top">Pretty shot. I like this but it needed a tad bit more light. Good shooting.</td>', 'Pretty shot. I like this but it needed a tad bit more light. Good shooting.', '2003-09-29 19:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434589, 39886, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like the highlights at the edges of the seagull''s wings, nice!  A little less silhouette (or a little more) might have been nice, but that''s asking for a bit too much (no score affect).  Nice framing.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I like the highlights at the edges of the seagull''s wings, nice!  A little less silhouette (or a little more) might have been nice, but that''s asking for a bit too much (no score affect).  Nice framing.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(434590, 39802, 6999, '<td valign="top">Different from the run-of-the-mill birds and aeroplanes that were to be expected, but you haven''t compromised despite the great idea: excellent composition, location, and technical work. manges to create an aspirational feel - somehow it looks like an old-fashioned kid out playing, a kid who never heard of Flight Simulator. My top of this challenge.</td>', 'Different from the run-of-the-mill birds and aeroplanes that were to be expected, but you haven''t compromised despite the great idea: excellent composition, location, and technical work. manges to create an aspirational feel - somehow it looks like an old-fashioned kid out playing, a kid who never heard of Flight Simulator. My top of this challenge.', '2003-09-29 19:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434591, 39580, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot, different, unique.</td>', 'Interesting shot, different, unique.', '2003-09-29 19:15:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(434592, 39133, 327, '<td valign="top">Fantastic color, light, focus.......just about perfect.</td>', 'Fantastic color, light, focus.......just about perfect.', '2003-09-29 19:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(434594, 40086, 327, '<td valign="top">Amazing to see this from this perspective....are you in a plane? Great shooting and fun to view.</td>', 'Amazing to see this from this perspective....are you in a plane? Great shooting and fun to view.', '2003-09-29 19:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(434595, 39521, 6999, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition, light, a great moment caught: especially like the wave breaking alongside the dog - adds some dynamic to the shot, and keeps the eye moving in a good way. expect you might get voted down a little on the ''this is jumping, rather than flying'' pedants, but I do hope not. 9 from me.</td>', 'Wonderful composition, light, a great moment caught: especially like the wave breaking alongside the dog - adds some dynamic to the shot, and keeps the eye moving in a good way. expect you might get voted down a little on the ''this is jumping, rather than flying'' pedants, but I do hope not. 9 from me.', '2003-09-29 19:17:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(434597, 39898, 1005, '<td valign="top">Ehh, it''s a fine (but odd) portrait, and I do "get" the connection with the challenge, but no, I''m not going for "full challenge" credit.  The glare across the forehead and on the nose is a bit heavy.  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Ehh, it''s a fine (but odd) portrait, and I do "get" the connection with the challenge, but no, I''m not going for "full challenge" credit.  The glare across the forehead and on the nose is a bit heavy.  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(434600, 40071, 6999, '<td valign="top">memorable shot, but I''m undecided as to whether or not the processing really adds anything worth adding. I think perhaps it does: a little sense of mystery, perhaps. Feel there''s a lack of depth to the image however - they all seem to pretty much the same distance away (obviously they aren''t, but the range isn''t so great). I think also it might have been a pretty dull image without the level of processing, and whilst it helps that it can''t really completely mask it. Still gets a 8, for mood if nothing else.</td>', 'memorable shot, but I''m undecided as to whether or not the processing really adds anything worth adding. I think perhaps it does: a little sense of mystery, perhaps. Feel there''s a lack of depth to the image however - they all seem to pretty much the same distance away (obviously they aren''t, but the range isn''t so great). I think also it might have been a pretty dull image without the level of processing, and whilst it helps that it can''t really completely mask it. Still gets a 8, for mood if nothing else.', '2003-09-29 19:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(434601, 40037, 1005, '<td valign="top">Lovely photo - wrong challenge.  Too bad about the gutter (lower left).  The best I can go for this is a 6.  Rob the Swash</td>', 'Lovely photo - wrong challenge.  Too bad about the gutter (lower left).  The best I can go for this is a 6.  Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434603, 39886, 6999, '<td valign="top">Beautiful moment of light to capture - had any ''oversharpening'' comments yet? Like the feel of the wind you''ve captured, and the suggestion of the gull flying out of the black clouds. Would have liked some more subject matter in the background perhaps - the negative space gives the feel of isolation, but the breaking cloud at bottom right suggests there''s more to be seen.</td>', 'Beautiful moment of light to capture - had any ''oversharpening'' comments yet? Like the feel of the wind you''ve captured, and the suggestion of the gull flying out of the black clouds. Would have liked some more subject matter in the background perhaps - the negative space gives the feel of isolation, but the breaking cloud at bottom right suggests there''s more to be seen.', '2003-09-29 19:24:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(434604, 40059, 1005, '<td valign="top">An unusual take on this challenge, but I''ll take it!  Very sharp action shot!  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'An unusual take on this challenge, but I''ll take it!  Very sharp action shot!  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(434608, 39942, 1005, '<td valign="top">A bit too much saturation (I think), it makes the wings seem over-exposed.  Nice action stop!  I like the angle of this photo, nice capture.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'A bit too much saturation (I think), it makes the wings seem over-exposed.  Nice action stop!  I like the angle of this photo, nice capture.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(434611, 39471, 6668, '<td valign="top">wonderful capture, but it seems a tad grainy.</td>', 'wonderful capture, but it seems a tad grainy.', '2003-09-29 19:31:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(434613, 39873, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very well taken photo.  IMO, the challenge really was aimed at an action shot, this isn''t.  I''m not going to "punish" you greatly, just a little ;).....6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very well taken photo.  IMO, the challenge really was aimed at an action shot, this isn''t.  I''m not going to "punish" you greatly, just a little ;).....6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:32:35.000000', NULL, 1),
