(434615, 39543, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool clouds!  (Isn''t the plane a bit small and maybe a bit out of focus?)  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool clouds!  (Isn''t the plane a bit small and maybe a bit out of focus?)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
