(434620, 40035, 6668, '<td valign="top">I love the bird on the ground and the big one in flight but the other one seems a bit out of place as if he is just sitting in mid-air.  I also think that black and white really works well for this shot.</td>', 'I love the bird on the ground and the big one in flight but the other one seems a bit out of place as if he is just sitting in mid-air.  I also think that black and white really works well for this shot.', '2003-09-29 19:38:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(434621, 40071, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but far too manipulated for my "photo" tastes (sorry, my bad).  Did you add grain?  (see sky)  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting, but far too manipulated for my "photo" tastes (sorry, my bad).  Did you add grain?  (see sky)  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
