(434625, 39124, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''d have liked to see the eagle closer, but that''s asking a bit too much.  I think the framing is a bit backwards, the bird is soaring out of the frame instead of into it.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I''d have liked to see the eagle closer, but that''s asking a bit too much.  I think the framing is a bit backwards, the bird is soaring out of the frame instead of into it.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:42:52.000000', NULL, 1),
