(434635, 39941, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m guessing this may not do so well since a good number of people may not get this one... but I have to admit that''s pretty cool!  I watched the ISS fly overhead about an hour before a space shuttle launch I attended in FL once.  That was a memorable thing to see, especially in that context!</td>', 'I''m guessing this may not do so well since a good number of people may not get this one... but I have to admit that''s pretty cool!  I watched the ISS fly overhead about an hour before a space shuttle launch I attended in FL once.  That was a memorable thing to see, especially in that context!', '2003-09-29 19:47:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(434639, 39851, 6668, '<td valign="top">The electric pole in the middle of the shot is very distracting.</td>', 'The electric pole in the middle of the shot is very distracting.', '2003-09-29 19:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(434645, 39798, 1005, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of a shot from last week''s macro challenge.  Honestly, I liked the other version better.  Cool little fireworks thing going on with the upper seeds (were they really flying?).  Photo seems a tad overly manip''d (for my tastes).  <br/>(Very hard to score this one)  8 Rob the Swash (don''t argue, I was leaning towards a 7)</td>', 'This reminds me of a shot from last week''s macro challenge.  Honestly, I liked the other version better.  Cool little fireworks thing going on with the upper seeds (were they really flying?).  Photo seems a tad overly manip''d (for my tastes).  (Very hard to score this one)  8 Rob the Swash (don''t argue, I was leaning towards a 7)', '2003-09-29 19:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(434648, 39521, 6668, '<td valign="top">Adorable shot!! I love everything about this shot, the expression on the dogs face, the positioning of the dog, the background..The only minor that is the shadow on the lower bottom left but I''m sure that couldn''t be helped.  Hope to see this one at the top this week!</td>', 'Adorable shot!! I love everything about this shot, the expression on the dogs face, the positioning of the dog, the background..The only minor that is the shadow on the lower bottom left but I''m sure that couldn''t be helped.  Hope to see this one at the top this week!', '2003-09-29 19:51:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(434651, 39666, 1005, '<td valign="top">VERY good hummingbird shot!  It''s lovely.  The tongue is a GREAT touch!  That said, even though I love THIS shot more than most hummingbird shots, for this challenge, I''d have preferred it to be really flying.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'VERY good hummingbird shot!  It''s lovely.  The tongue is a GREAT touch!  That said, even though I love THIS shot more than most hummingbird shots, for this challenge, I''d have preferred it to be really flying.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 19:53:35.000000', NULL, 1),
