(434679, 39898, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very high contrast picture really makes the subject pop out of the picture. Love the dark shadows. Cool angle keeps interest in the shot. Good idea. Would work as a great advertisement for the goggles in a periodical.</td>', 'Very high contrast picture really makes the subject pop out of the picture. Love the dark shadows. Cool angle keeps interest in the shot. Good idea. Would work as a great advertisement for the goggles in a periodical.', '2003-09-29 20:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(434681, 39192, 1005, '<td valign="top">Intense shot!  Very good timing.  Very grainy and dark, white balance seems off.  That said, 8, Rob the Swash</td>', 'Intense shot!  Very good timing.  Very grainy and dark, white balance seems off.  That said, 8, Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 20:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(434683, 39941, 1005, '<td valign="top">It sort of looks like a scratch on a negative, but I''ll buy it.  Interesting idea, not very detailed, never would have guessed w/o the title.  8 Rob the Swash</td>', 'It sort of looks like a scratch on a negative, but I''ll buy it.  Interesting idea, not very detailed, never would have guessed w/o the title.  8 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 20:22:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(434684, 40047, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m sure I''m not the only one who is looking forward to learning more about this one -- namely how you were able to get this angle!  Very cool shot -- nice &amp; crisp with great colors.  If only the sky had cooperated with you to be a little more blue!  A 10 all the way.  And let me be the first to congratulate you on your ribbon!  :)</td>', 'I''m sure I''m not the only one who is looking forward to learning more about this one -- namely how you were able to get this angle!  Very cool shot -- nice & crisp with great colors.  If only the sky had cooperated with you to be a little more blue!  A 10 all the way.  And let me be the first to congratulate you on your ribbon!  :)', '2003-09-29 20:23:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(434685, 40057, 3102, '<td valign="top">Very cool -- I suppose you paid them to do this just for the challenge?  :)  It''s a great shot, and you captured it at just the right instant.  - 10</td>', 'Very cool -- I suppose you paid them to do this just for the challenge?  :)  It''s a great shot, and you captured it at just the right instant.  - 10', '2003-09-29 20:24:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(434686, 39580, 1005, '<td valign="top">Really had to stare at this one.  You''ve really pushed your camera to the limits.  I like it.  Too bad the sun flares (even got a bit of a rainbow).  Admire your attempt.  9 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Really had to stare at this one.  You''ve really pushed your camera to the limits.  I like it.  Too bad the sun flares (even got a bit of a rainbow).  Admire your attempt.  9 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-29 20:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(434687, 40086, 6900, '<td valign="top">Superb!  Absolutely love it.  Nice open space (crop).  9</td>', 'Superb!  Absolutely love it.  Nice open space (crop).  9', '2003-09-29 20:30:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434688, 39991, 6900, '<td valign="top">The building is a distraction - because of the tilt.</td>', 'The building is a distraction - because of the tilt.', '2003-09-29 20:31:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(434689, 40033, 6900, '<td valign="top">Talk about barely meeting the challenge. ;)  Good shot,. but I wish it was coming towards you.  (My guess is it was, and this was the best shot that came out - that happened to me!)</td>', 'Talk about barely meeting the challenge. ;)  Good shot,. but I wish it was coming towards you.  (My guess is it was, and this was the best shot that came out - that happened to me!)', '2003-09-29 20:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(434690, 40017, 6900, '<td valign="top">Nice wingspan.  I wish the bird''s face was showing though.</td>', 'Nice wingspan.  I wish the bird''s face was showing though.', '2003-09-29 20:32:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(434698, 39521, 11769, '<td valign="top">The happiest photo of the lot. Great feeling,and clearity.</td>', 'The happiest photo of the lot. Great feeling,and clearity.', '2003-09-29 20:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434701, 39580, 11769, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful feeling. I judge alot by the content, not just the quality. Both are needed to have a great photo. Good luck!</td>', 'What a wonderful feeling. I judge alot by the content, not just the quality. Both are needed to have a great photo. Good luck!', '2003-09-29 20:47:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(434702, 39964, 11769, '<td valign="top">Nice idea. Good composition.</td>', 'Nice idea. Good composition.', '2003-09-29 20:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(434704, 40026, 11769, '<td valign="top">Composition, clean, clear,controled shot. 10!</td>', 'Composition, clean, clear,controled shot. 10!', '2003-09-29 20:50:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(434722, 40039, 6624, '<td valign="top">for this viewer there are two problems - central image is just too small to carry the image and secondly there is a lot of pixilation</td>', 'for this viewer there are two problems - central image is just too small to carry the image and secondly there is a lot of pixilation', '2003-09-29 21:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434723, 39949, 4338, '<td valign="top">I like the sunlight on the wing tip and underside of the bird....nice shot</td>', 'I like the sunlight on the wing tip and underside of the bird....nice shot', '2003-09-29 21:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434724, 39883, 6624, '<td valign="top">the focus seems off and there is a lot of pixilation</td>', 'the focus seems off and there is a lot of pixilation', '2003-09-29 21:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(434725, 40069, 4338, '<td valign="top">looks a little overexposed for my taste, but still a great shot</td>', 'looks a little overexposed for my taste, but still a great shot', '2003-09-29 21:06:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434726, 40037, 6624, '<td valign="top">image feels cluttered although the concept is interesting</td>', 'image feels cluttered although the concept is interesting', '2003-09-29 21:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(434727, 39738, 6624, '<td valign="top">the horizon tilt really affects this image negatively</td>', 'the horizon tilt really affects this image negatively', '2003-09-29 21:07:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(434728, 39996, 6624, '<td valign="top">focus lacking</td>', 'focus lacking', '2003-09-29 21:08:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(434730, 39794, 6624, '<td valign="top">the angle is nice, filling the area is nice, but the focus is just not there</td>', 'the angle is nice, filling the area is nice, but the focus is just not there', '2003-09-29 21:09:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434731, 39994, 4338, '<td valign="top">I like the over all composition, but I feel cropping it off just to the left of the biker in red would have made the image look a little larger on the resizing</td>', 'I like the over all composition, but I feel cropping it off just to the left of the biker in red would have made the image look a little larger on the resizing', '2003-09-29 21:10:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434732, 39901, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice idea...the background is very distracting though</td>', 'nice idea...the background is very distracting though', '2003-09-29 21:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(434734, 39870, 4338, '<td valign="top">nice and sharp image</td>', 'nice and sharp image', '2003-09-29 21:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(434736, 40094, 4338, '<td valign="top">this image is not very appealing to me. It looks out of focus, the exposure is off and something about teh color does not grab me. Not sure if this was a result of resizing for the challenge or not, but its very hard to determin the main subject in this image.</td>', 'this image is not very appealing to me. It looks out of focus, the exposure is off and something about teh color does not grab me. Not sure if this was a result of resizing for the challenge or not, but its very hard to determin the main subject in this image.', '2003-09-29 21:15:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(434737, 39985, 4338, '<td valign="top">great colors</td>', 'great colors', '2003-09-29 21:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434739, 39797, 4338, '<td valign="top">the mail...the mail is here..... or "you got mail"....I like the composition and cropping, a nice amount of detial of the aircraft is visible.....</td>', 'the mail...the mail is here..... or "you got mail"....I like the composition and cropping, a nice amount of detial of the aircraft is visible.....', '2003-09-29 21:20:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(434741, 39849, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. Love that you were able to include the snow covered mountains and the sky. You were able to use the right speed on your shutter to not freeze the propellor thus showing motion in them. I think propellor driven airplanes are a lot more interesting to shot.</td>', 'Very good composition. Love that you were able to include the snow covered mountains and the sky. You were able to use the right speed on your shutter to not freeze the propellor thus showing motion in them. I think propellor driven airplanes are a lot more interesting to shot.', '2003-09-29 21:29:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(434742, 39133, 4338, '<td valign="top">very nice capture...real sharp and great focus and DOF</td>', 'very nice capture...real sharp and great focus and DOF', '2003-09-29 21:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434743, 39738, 10084, '<td valign="top">I kind of like the angle you chose for the shot. The diagonal horizon gives an interest to the composition. It gives you the direction that the kite is flying at. The bright colors in the kite really help to make it stand out of the shot.</td>', 'I kind of like the angle you chose for the shot. The diagonal horizon gives an interest to the composition. It gives you the direction that the kite is flying at. The bright colors in the kite really help to make it stand out of the shot.', '2003-09-29 21:32:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(434748, 39905, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very dynamic shot. The sparks are really beautiful. They almost look like lighting.  The blurring of the lighter and the darker background helps to make the sparks pop out. Can''t wait to find out your settings on your camera for this one.</td>', 'Very dynamic shot. The sparks are really beautiful. They almost look like lighting.  The blurring of the lighter and the darker background helps to make the sparks pop out. Can''t wait to find out your settings on your camera for this one.', '2003-09-29 21:35:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(434750, 39802, 10084, '<td valign="top">This is such a great photo. This would probably when in "Nostalgia". Love the hue that you choose. It gives a great sense of the "Past" and the feeling of childhood. The clothes he wearing really helps with the contrast and makes him pop out of the picture. Same for the plane. The depth of field also helps with this. <br/> <br/>This would make for a great postcard or greeting card. Absolutely beautiful.</td>', 'This is such a great photo. This would probably when in "Nostalgia". Love the hue that you choose. It gives a great sense of the "Past" and the feeling of childhood. The clothes he wearing really helps with the contrast and makes him pop out of the picture. Same for the plane. The depth of field also helps with this.  This would make for a great postcard or greeting card. Absolutely beautiful.', '2003-09-29 21:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(434751, 39990, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors in the parachute helps to make the subject pop out of the picture. It gives you a sense of the parachute coming at you. Focusing is really well done and give a great depth of field. Frame you chose works with the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful colors in the parachute helps to make the subject pop out of the picture. It gives you a sense of the parachute coming at you. Focusing is really well done and give a great depth of field. Frame you chose works with the picture.', '2003-09-29 21:42:55.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(434753, 39851, 10084, '<td valign="top">Same comments as everyone else - The vertical pole is distracting in the shot. If you were able to crop it out would make for a better and interesting image. Taking the picture vertical and getting the frisbee and person catching it would really give you a cool picture.<br/>Colors are good in the shot and the frisbee gives that feeling of flight and motion.</td>', 'Same comments as everyone else - The vertical pole is distracting in the shot. If you were able to crop it out would make for a better and interesting image. Taking the picture vertical and getting the frisbee and person catching it would really give you a cool picture.Colors are good in the shot and the frisbee gives that feeling of flight and motion.', '2003-09-29 21:46:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(434755, 40040, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field really helps to make the subject pop out. Even with the same type of colors in the background you were able to birng out the subject. I like the vibrant colors in the subject. Very whimsical.</td>', 'Good depth of field really helps to make the subject pop out. Even with the same type of colors in the background you were able to birng out the subject. I like the vibrant colors in the subject. Very whimsical.', '2003-09-29 21:50:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(434759, 39928, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good use of desaturation to bring the subject out. I think I would prefer a vertical crop. This would give the parachute a sense and feeling of height. The landscape seems to be busy and keep your eyes on the bottom of the picture. Vertical would help.<br/> <br/>The angle that the parchute is currently gives a sense of motion and flight, but changing the crop might give it even more impact.</td>', 'Good use of desaturation to bring the subject out. I think I would prefer a vertical crop. This would give the parachute a sense and feeling of height. The landscape seems to be busy and keep your eyes on the bottom of the picture. Vertical would help. The angle that the parchute is currently gives a sense of motion and flight, but changing the crop might give it even more impact.', '2003-09-29 21:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(434764, 39991, 10084, '<td valign="top">I guess this one works. The dark skies with the silhouette of the birds and the darken building gives a feeling of "omen". As a flight entry it gives some sense of it. The building unforturnately dominates about 1/3 of the picture and keeps the picture bottom heavy. Keeps your eyes on the bottom of the shot.<br/> <br/>The contrast of the sky really helps to make the birds pop out of the picture <br/> <br/>I think cropping about 1/2 the picture and only include the birds would help with the theme more. The current picture is really good, but  I can''t help but focus on the building.</td>', 'I guess this one works. The dark skies with the silhouette of the birds and the darken building gives a feeling of "omen". As a flight entry it gives some sense of it. The building unforturnately dominates about 1/3 of the picture and keeps the picture bottom heavy. Keeps your eyes on the bottom of the shot. The contrast of the sky really helps to make the birds pop out of the picture  I think cropping about 1/2 the picture and only include the birds would help with the theme more. The current picture is really good, but  I can''t help but focus on the building.', '2003-09-29 22:01:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(434765, 39985, 6624, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this - happy, joyous, and free...the patchwork dress, the abandonment--9</td>', 'I absolutely love this - happy, joyous, and free...the patchwork dress, the abandonment--9', '2003-09-29 22:03:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(434766, 39542, 6624, '<td valign="top">precarious, exciting, joyous..nice shot (I would say crop the left hand but I would be afraid she''d fall) 8</td>', 'precarious, exciting, joyous..nice shot (I would say crop the left hand but I would be afraid she''d fall) 8', '2003-09-29 22:04:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(434767, 39891, 6624, '<td valign="top">spectacular capture...I think it would be even more striking if the tree tops were cropped out</td>', 'spectacular capture...I think it would be even more striking if the tree tops were cropped out', '2003-09-29 22:05:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(434769, 39984, 6624, '<td valign="top">great capture, great title 8</td>', 'great capture, great title 8', '2003-09-29 22:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(434770, 39521, 11985, '<td valign="top">very good!<br/></td>', 'very good!', '2003-09-29 22:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(434771, 39933, 6624, '<td valign="top">great action - nice capture, the feathers and feet are particularly nice</td>', 'great action - nice capture, the feathers and feet are particularly nice', '2003-09-29 22:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(434772, 39936, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice capture - do you happen to know what kind of dragonfly it is?  I have caught the top half of one but never the whole thing and wondered about the kind</td>', 'nice capture - do you happen to know what kind of dragonfly it is?  I have caught the top half of one but never the whole thing and wondered about the kind', '2003-09-29 22:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(434775, 39521, 4388, '<td valign="top">my favorite! great shot!</td>', 'my favorite! great shot!', '2003-09-29 22:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(434777, 39563, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice capture..the sense of the dive and the tuck of the neck are very nice</td>', 'nice capture..the sense of the dive and the tuck of the neck are very nice', '2003-09-29 22:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(434779, 40047, 4388, '<td valign="top">the sky is a bit whitish, maybe a polarizing filter would have helped. great shot of the plane and acrobat!</td>', 'the sky is a bit whitish, maybe a polarizing filter would have helped. great shot of the plane and acrobat!', '2003-09-29 22:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(434780, 39959, 6624, '<td valign="top">the almost dreamlike quality of the feathers set off by the black feet, eyes, and wingtips are very nice--of course it would have been nice to see all of the other wing as well but you can''t have everything 8</td>', 'the almost dreamlike quality of the feathers set off by the black feet, eyes, and wingtips are very nice--of course it would have been nice to see all of the other wing as well but you can''t have everything 8', '2003-09-29 22:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(434783, 39962, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice crop and nice emphasis on the target landing</td>', 'nice crop and nice emphasis on the target landing', '2003-09-29 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(434784, 39133, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is beautiful and I would very much like to know what kind of hummingbird this is   9</td>', 'this is beautiful and I would very much like to know what kind of hummingbird this is   9', '2003-09-29 22:26:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(434785, 39602, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would like a bit more depth of field.  The haystacks almost blends in with the background. With the bird lined up it seems omenious. A seen from a horror movie. I like how some of the birds are in motion and some are just sitting there.<br/> <br/>Cropping some of the ground would help to give more attention to the birds. If you remove about half of the ground. You would frame the birds better.</td>', 'Would like a bit more depth of field.  The haystacks almost blends in with the background. With the bird lined up it seems omenious. A seen from a horror movie. I like how some of the birds are in motion and some are just sitting there. Cropping some of the ground would help to give more attention to the birds. If you remove about half of the ground. You would frame the birds better.', '2003-09-29 22:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434786, 39984, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very neat shot. I like that you were able to capture two of the birds. One gliding and another with the wings flapping. It gives a feeling that the birds are coming right at you. The reflections on the water of the birds are really great. Seems like they are really big birds yet they can still fly.</td>', 'Very neat shot. I like that you were able to capture two of the birds. One gliding and another with the wings flapping. It gives a feeling that the birds are coming right at you. The reflections on the water of the birds are really great. Seems like they are really big birds yet they can still fly.', '2003-09-29 22:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(434787, 39994, 10084, '<td valign="top">I like that you were able to capture the birds at different stages of flight. Wings up stroke, down stroke, and mid stroke. It gives a sense of the birds'' flight. Beautiful background, but it seems to distract from the birds.</td>', 'I like that you were able to capture the birds at different stages of flight. Wings up stroke, down stroke, and mid stroke. It gives a sense of the birds'' flight. Beautiful background, but it seems to distract from the birds.', '2003-09-29 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(434788, 39968, 6624, '<td valign="top">this is a wonderful shot - trampoline I suspect (?)  and there will probably be a lot of comments about the background but I can understand it...the small branch behind him is unfortunate but overall the image is a fine response to challenge</td>', 'this is a wonderful shot - trampoline I suspect (?)  and there will probably be a lot of comments about the background but I can understand it...the small branch behind him is unfortunate but overall the image is a fine response to challenge', '2003-09-29 22:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(434790, 39528, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well the top part of your sky is beautiful, but the birds are a little far away.</td>', 'Well the top part of your sky is beautiful, but the birds are a little far away.', '2003-09-29 22:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(434791, 39949, 6668, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, but I do not care much for the black border with this one, I think it would work better without one.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, but I do not care much for the black border with this one, I think it would work better without one.', '2003-09-29 22:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(434797, 40039, 7969, '<td valign="top">Well, the object in flight is not very sharp or clear, and well, it is not very interesting in its composition.</td>', 'Well, the object in flight is not very sharp or clear, and well, it is not very interesting in its composition.', '2003-09-29 22:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(434798, 39802, 6668, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot, I think the sepia tones work really well.  nice work.</td>', 'I really like this shot, I think the sepia tones work really well.  nice work.', '2003-09-29 22:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(434806, 39959, 6668, '<td valign="top">Great shot, It would be bett though it the wing was not cut off on top, even so, still a wonderful capture.</td>', 'Great shot, It would be bett though it the wing was not cut off on top, even so, still a wonderful capture.', '2003-09-29 22:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(434820, 39521, 11078, '<td valign="top">cute photo</td>', 'cute photo', '2003-09-29 23:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(434821, 40059, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Great expressions. Yet.  Would have liked to see more of their legs, with their feet off the ground like I imagine they are.  Hopelessly new, but could you have taken it in portrait mode?</td>', 'Good shot. Great expressions. Yet.  Would have liked to see more of their legs, with their feet off the ground like I imagine they are.  Hopelessly new, but could you have taken it in portrait mode?', '2003-09-29 23:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(434823, 39666, 11800, '<td valign="top">Hmm. Never got that close to a hummer, should his beak have been in the feeder if he was getting fuel?</td>', 'Hmm. Never got that close to a hummer, should his beak have been in the feeder if he was getting fuel?', '2003-09-29 23:27:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(434825, 39959, 11078, '<td valign="top">it looks stuffed</td>', 'it looks stuffed', '2003-09-29 23:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(434828, 40083, 10084, '<td valign="top">Absolutely beautiful pictue. The blue sky really frame the subject well and helps to make the bird pop out of the picture. The angle that you took the picture gives the composition great interest. The slight blur gives the bird a sense of motion.</td>', 'Absolutely beautiful pictue. The blue sky really frame the subject well and helps to make the bird pop out of the picture. The angle that you took the picture gives the composition great interest. The slight blur gives the bird a sense of motion.', '2003-09-29 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(434829, 40039, 11800, '<td valign="top">The clouds add an abstract look to this.  The ball looks a little soft and it''s too centered. You get creative points for doing something different. 6</td>', 'The clouds add an abstract look to this.  The ball looks a little soft and it''s too centered. You get creative points for doing something different. 6', '2003-09-29 23:37:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434830, 40019, 11078, '<td valign="top">I like your sense of humour nice shot</td>', 'I like your sense of humour nice shot', '2003-09-29 23:39:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(434831, 40047, 5792, '<td valign="top">Occasionally you see an image that, at first glance, is clearly the class of the challenge. This is one of those images. Perfect framing, composition and solid white background works well here. Classic flight subject perfectly captured.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-03-08 17:17:19.</i></td>', 'Occasionally you see an image that, at first glance, is clearly the class of the challenge. This is one of those images. Perfect framing, composition and solid white background works well here. Classic flight subject perfectly captured.', '2003-09-29 23:40:24.000000', '2005-03-08 17:17:19.000000', 1),
(434832, 39563, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wow swooping in for the kill. Slight in the head gives a good sense of motion and the diving of the bird. Beautiful sharp contrast helps the detailed bird pop out of the background. Great capture.</td>', 'Wow swooping in for the kill. Slight in the head gives a good sense of motion and the diving of the bird. Beautiful sharp contrast helps the detailed bird pop out of the background. Great capture.', '2003-09-29 23:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(434833, 40094, 11800, '<td valign="top">It''s everywhere, isn''t it?  The center stem is a little blown but I like the color palette. You get an extra point for creativity.  The great thing about the size is that you probably will not have a bunch of out of focus comments. hehe</td>', 'It''s everywhere, isn''t it?  The center stem is a little blown but I like the color palette. You get an extra point for creativity.  The great thing about the size is that you probably will not have a bunch of out of focus comments. hehe', '2003-09-29 23:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(434835, 40090, 7467, '<td valign="top">I know it is tough to take bird shots against a bright sky. Too bad the bird colors and textures don''t show show up better. These are great birds!  Not sure what the answer is, maybe work more with the sun at your back?</td>', 'I know it is tough to take bird shots against a bright sky. Too bad the bird colors and textures don''t show show up better. These are great birds!  Not sure what the answer is, maybe work more with the sun at your back?', '2003-09-29 23:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(434837, 39133, 9432, '<td valign="top">amazing that this is possible</td>', 'amazing that this is possible', '2003-09-29 23:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(434839, 40026, 11078, '<td valign="top">I love this photo How did you get the black background? nice focus but the bird looks unreal</td>', 'I love this photo How did you get the black background? nice focus but the bird looks unreal', '2003-09-29 23:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434840, 39851, 11800, '<td valign="top">Is this a self portrait? I don''t know much but I think it would have been better if it was shot in an area that didn''t have telephone poles and wires in the way, they are really distracting.  I feel really uneasy looking at the cut off guy.  Would have been better with his arms showing.</td>', 'Is this a self portrait? I don''t know much but I think it would have been better if it was shot in an area that didn''t have telephone poles and wires in the way, they are really distracting.  I feel really uneasy looking at the cut off guy.  Would have been better with his arms showing.', '2003-09-29 23:50:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(434841, 40092, 10084, '<td valign="top">Just like a scene from Hitchcock''s "The Birds". Run everybody. Love the different wing strokes in the birds. Help to give a great sense of motion and flight. The great sunset and the colors help to push the birds out of the pictue. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Just like a scene from Hitchcock''s "The Birds". Run everybody. Love the different wing strokes in the birds. Help to give a great sense of motion and flight. The great sunset and the colors help to push the birds out of the pictue. Beautiful shot.', '2003-09-29 23:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(434843, 40057, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. decent blue sky and captured the planes in flight nicely. One of the best of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice capture. decent blue sky and captured the planes in flight nicely. One of the best of the challenge.', '2003-09-29 23:58:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(434844, 39133, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great stop action capture, framing and bird color excellant. Background is a little distracting, but a decent soft focus. Should be a top finisher.</td>', 'Great stop action capture, framing and bird color excellant. Background is a little distracting, but a decent soft focus. Should be a top finisher.', '2003-09-29 23:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(434846, 39985, 5792, '<td valign="top">Great capture. You subject looks like she is having a lot of fun. Slightly over adjusted, but a very good image.</td>', 'Great capture. You subject looks like she is having a lot of fun. Slightly over adjusted, but a very good image.', '2003-09-30 00:00:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(434847, 39738, 6668, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I care for the slanted angle of this shot.</td>', 'I''m not sure I care for the slanted angle of this shot.', '2003-09-30 00:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(434848, 39867, 11800, '<td valign="top">In my mind, the foreground should be used to show depth and/or act as a frame to the subject.  I don''t think the lovely flowers fit this.  They obscure the mountains in the background and they don''t have the symetry to frame the balloon. The balloon itself, as well as the sky, is washed out.</td>', 'In my mind, the foreground should be used to show depth and/or act as a frame to the subject.  I don''t think the lovely flowers fit this.  They obscure the mountains in the background and they don''t have the symetry to frame the balloon. The balloon itself, as well as the sky, is washed out.', '2003-09-30 00:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434849, 39957, 5792, '<td valign="top">You captured the feathers of the gull in flight beautifully. The refelctive water makes a nice background.</td>', 'You captured the feathers of the gull in flight beautifully. The refelctive water makes a nice background.', '2003-09-30 00:01:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434850, 40032, 7467, '<td valign="top">Not as sharp as it could be. Maybe it was too much enlargement. I know how that can be with birds. Nice angle though.</td>', 'Not as sharp as it could be. Maybe it was too much enlargement. I know how that can be with birds. Nice angle though.', '2003-09-30 00:02:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(434851, 39184, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nicely captured helicopter.</td>', 'Nicely captured helicopter.', '2003-09-30 00:02:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(434853, 39959, 5792, '<td valign="top">A very beautiful shot. B &amp; W works well for this image. Great clarity, excellant capture ofthe subject.</td>', 'A very beautiful shot. B & W works well for this image. Great clarity, excellant capture ofthe subject.', '2003-09-30 00:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(434854, 40055, 11800, '<td valign="top">The fuzzy trees on the right are distracting. The colors are nice and crisp and it seems that the balloon is in focus.  I don''t think there is a way to crop this one to get a better composition since there are blurred objects all across the bottom.</td>', 'The fuzzy trees on the right are distracting. The colors are nice and crisp and it seems that the balloon is in focus.  I don''t think there is a way to crop this one to get a better composition since there are blurred objects all across the bottom.', '2003-09-30 00:06:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(434855, 39893, 5792, '<td valign="top">Certainly the most creative image of the challenge. Having the background in focus through the bubble and the bubble itself out of focus is a terrific idea. Almost looks like something out of the classic movie "Wizard of Oz".</td>', 'Certainly the most creative image of the challenge. Having the background in focus through the bubble and the bubble itself out of focus is a terrific idea. Almost looks like something out of the classic movie "Wizard of Oz".', '2003-09-30 00:07:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(434856, 40071, 6668, '<td valign="top">seems extremely grainy.</td>', 'seems extremely grainy.', '2003-09-30 00:07:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(434857, 39542, 10625, '<td valign="top">wooohoooooo!!!!!!!!!!!!!</td>', 'wooohoooooo!!!!!!!!!!!!!', '2003-09-30 00:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434858, 39942, 5792, '<td valign="top">Framing and perspective on the gull is beautiful. Great detail. Technically a well done image.</td>', 'Framing and perspective on the gull is beautiful. Great detail. Technically a well done image.', '2003-09-30 00:09:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(434859, 39554, 6668, '<td valign="top">cool shot! I would love to learn how this was done.</td>', 'cool shot! I would love to learn how this was done.', '2003-09-30 00:09:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(434861, 39563, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant framing, content and clarity. Very well done.</td>', 'Excellant framing, content and clarity. Very well done.', '2003-09-30 00:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(434862, 40080, 5792, '<td valign="top">A touch over post-processed but has excellant content framing and focus. Color and soft background works well in this image. Terrific job.</td>', 'A touch over post-processed but has excellant content framing and focus. Color and soft background works well in this image. Terrific job.', '2003-09-30 00:11:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(434863, 39542, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, excellant clarity. You have really captured the moment of tossing a child in the air exceptionally well.</td>', 'Nice perspective, excellant clarity. You have really captured the moment of tossing a child in the air exceptionally well.', '2003-09-30 00:13:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(434864, 39542, 11800, '<td valign="top">A cute snap.  I was really hoping someone would do one like this.  On the technique side, try running it thru neat image to tame the noise in the sky.  I know dad couldn''t be throwing her up really high, but would have loved to have seen either her alone in the air (sans dad''s hands) or more of the tosser of the child. Did you try using a fill flash? Bet she had a great time!</td>', 'A cute snap.  I was really hoping someone would do one like this.  On the technique side, try running it thru neat image to tame the noise in the sky.  I know dad couldn''t be throwing her up really high, but would have loved to have seen either her alone in the air (sans dad''s hands) or more of the tosser of the child. Did you try using a fill flash? Bet she had a great time!', '2003-09-30 00:14:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(434865, 40026, 5792, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a pigeon in flight. Good use of the ROT.</td>', 'Nice capture of a pigeon in flight. Good use of the ROT.', '2003-09-30 00:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(434866, 39812, 5792, '<td valign="top">Excellant background for this image. Clarity and flat angled view of the subject well done.</td>', 'Excellant background for this image. Clarity and flat angled view of the subject well done.', '2003-09-30 00:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434868, 39983, 5792, '<td valign="top">The car, of course, is a little distracting, but an nice motion landing capture.</td>', 'The car, of course, is a little distracting, but an nice motion landing capture.', '2003-09-30 00:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(434871, 40084, 11800, '<td valign="top">He''s in a pretty unique pattern.  Only thing I''d say is the building is a bit distracting.  Good catch.</td>', 'He''s in a pretty unique pattern.  Only thing I''d say is the building is a bit distracting.  Good catch.', '2003-09-30 00:20:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434874, 40045, 5792, '<td valign="top">Good lighting on the subject.</td>', 'Good lighting on the subject.', '2003-09-30 00:21:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(434875, 40021, 5792, '<td valign="top">Stop action capture of the bee''s wings is outstanding.</td>', 'Stop action capture of the bee''s wings is outstanding.', '2003-09-30 00:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(434877, 39986, 6668, '<td valign="top">cool shot...like the border.</td>', 'cool shot...like the border.', '2003-09-30 00:22:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(434880, 39580, 5792, '<td valign="top">Selection of color lighting and perspective on this image makes it one of the most interesting images in this challenge.</td>', 'Selection of color lighting and perspective on this image makes it one of the most interesting images in this challenge.', '2003-09-30 00:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(434881, 39512, 11800, '<td valign="top">Did you add the noise? It looks good for this image.  It also looks like this is maybe a crop from a much larger picture. Not enough detail to really rate this.</td>', 'Did you add the noise? It looks good for this image.  It also looks like this is maybe a crop from a much larger picture. Not enough detail to really rate this.', '2003-09-30 00:24:21.000000', NULL, 1),
