(434883, 40081, 6668, '<td valign="top">I like the capture of this shot but I really don''t care for the coloring, bird looks strange half one color and half black and white, doesn''t seem natural to me.</td>', 'I like the capture of this shot but I really don''t care for the coloring, bird looks strange half one color and half black and white, doesn''t seem natural to me.', '2003-09-30 00:25:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(434885, 40042, 11800, '<td valign="top">Funny. Like it. Happy Happy</td>', 'Funny. Like it. Happy Happy', '2003-09-30 00:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434890, 39867, 6668, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the brown border with this shot.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the brown border with this shot.', '2003-09-30 00:28:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434892, 39870, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wasn''t the macro last week? hehe  Nice take on the subject. Wish I had thought of it.</td>', 'Wasn''t the macro last week? hehe  Nice take on the subject. Wish I had thought of it.', '2003-09-30 00:30:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(434910, 39554, 11800, '<td valign="top">Like the idea. Lighting is off. The shadow behind the desk leg is distracting. The heavy wood desk doesn''t go with the delicate wire can.  I think I can see the holes created for the wire/string on the tossed paper. Would like to have seen a smoother transition with the tossed paper. More of a motion blur.</td>', 'Like the idea. Lighting is off. The shadow behind the desk leg is distracting. The heavy wood desk doesn''t go with the delicate wire can.  I think I can see the holes created for the wire/string on the tossed paper. Would like to have seen a smoother transition with the tossed paper. More of a motion blur.', '2003-09-30 00:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(434914, 40048, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors.  More like good bye than welcome.  It looks like a take off and it''s flying away from me.  That''s nort something I''d take points off for.  9 and I''ll come back after the finish to see what camera took this.</td>', 'Beautiful colors.  More like good bye than welcome.  It looks like a take off and it''s flying away from me.  That''s nort something I''d take points off for.  9 and I''ll come back after the finish to see what camera took this.', '2003-09-30 00:46:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434915, 40096, 6668, '<td valign="top">I personally don''t care for the blurriness and debree on the bottom of the photo, otherwise nice shot.</td>', 'I personally don''t care for the blurriness and debree on the bottom of the photo, otherwise nice shot.', '2003-09-30 00:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(434917, 40096, 11800, '<td valign="top">A little too much usm?  If it was that soft, you should have reshot it.</td>', 'A little too much usm?  If it was that soft, you should have reshot it.', '2003-09-30 00:51:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(434918, 40047, 6668, '<td valign="top">LOL...cute shot..very creative!</td>', 'LOL...cute shot..very creative!', '2003-09-30 00:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434919, 39901, 11800, '<td valign="top">Amusing. Whimiscal. Apt.  Points for creativity.</td>', 'Amusing. Whimiscal. Apt.  Points for creativity.', '2003-09-30 00:53:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(434926, 40040, 6668, '<td valign="top">The background is to busy</td>', 'The background is to busy', '2003-09-30 00:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(434927, 39511, 12204, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, I just wish the actual glider wasn''t as dark as I believe you caught a great pose.</td>', 'I really like this picture, I just wish the actual glider wasn''t as dark as I believe you caught a great pose.', '2003-09-30 00:59:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(434929, 39192, 6668, '<td valign="top">Creative and humorous idea, although a little grainy.</td>', 'Creative and humorous idea, although a little grainy.', '2003-09-30 01:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(434930, 39983, 12204, '<td valign="top">I like this picture alot, almost wish though that the shutter speed was a bit higher so the bird looked more suspended, but the challenge was called flight and he looks in flight..</td>', 'I like this picture alot, almost wish though that the shutter speed was a bit higher so the bird looked more suspended, but the challenge was called flight and he looks in flight..', '2003-09-30 01:01:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(434931, 39983, 6668, '<td valign="top">Although I realize it probably couldn''t be helped, the red car in the background is a bit distracting.</td>', 'Although I realize it probably couldn''t be helped, the red car in the background is a bit distracting.', '2003-09-30 01:02:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(434932, 39554, 12204, '<td valign="top">Technically interesting. I could do this with my film cameras, but never even thought about attempting something like this on a digital camera.</td>', 'Technically interesting. I could do this with my film cameras, but never even thought about attempting something like this on a digital camera.', '2003-09-30 01:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(434934, 39133, 12204, '<td valign="top">I keep looking for the string holding him in place expecting it to be a prop.</td>', 'I keep looking for the string holding him in place expecting it to be a prop.', '2003-09-30 01:06:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(434935, 39984, 3981, '<td valign="top">Wonderful color - wonderful stop-action - good cropping and composition - lucky you to be in the right place at the right time! 9.</td>', 'Wonderful color - wonderful stop-action - good cropping and composition - lucky you to be in the right place at the right time! 9.', '2003-09-30 01:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(434936, 39867, 12204, '<td valign="top">Well framed with the leaves.</td>', 'Well framed with the leaves.', '2003-09-30 01:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(434937, 39957, 12204, '<td valign="top">I really like the water''s color and texture on this one.</td>', 'I really like the water''s color and texture on this one.', '2003-09-30 01:09:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(434938, 39893, 3981, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite photo in the challenge!  Fantastic color,clarity, and composition.  Surely this will be a ribbon! 10.</td>', 'This is my favorite photo in the challenge!  Fantastic color,clarity, and composition.  Surely this will be a ribbon! 10.', '2003-09-30 01:09:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(434940, 39901, 12204, '<td valign="top">I keep wanting to experiment with bubble pictures...</td>', 'I keep wanting to experiment with bubble pictures...', '2003-09-30 01:11:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(434941, 39133, 3981, '<td valign="top">Unbelievably beautiful.  This is a one in a million shot. DOF is perfect, as is the focus and composition.  10.</td>', 'Unbelievably beautiful.  This is a one in a million shot. DOF is perfect, as is the focus and composition.  10.', '2003-09-30 01:11:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(434945, 39603, 3981, '<td valign="top">The color is excellent in this photo but the image is out of focus. However, I realize you had to catch it at just the right moment for stop action.  Good try</td>', 'The color is excellent in this photo but the image is out of focus. However, I realize you had to catch it at just the right moment for stop action.  Good try', '2003-09-30 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(434947, 40086, 12204, '<td valign="top">Great Picture, I personally wish the backgrounds clouds were not there that day as it would have made this picture perfect.</td>', 'Great Picture, I personally wish the backgrounds clouds were not there that day as it would have made this picture perfect.', '2003-09-30 01:15:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(434965, 39133, 10128, '<td valign="top">There you go. 10</td>', 'There you go. 10', '2003-09-30 01:55:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(434966, 39905, 4210, '<td valign="top">Nice capture. Very pretty. A little too much texture in the background though.</td>', 'Nice capture. Very pretty. A little too much texture in the background though.', '2003-09-30 01:58:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(434967, 39941, 4210, '<td valign="top">While diagonal lines do create tension in a photo, this image has way too much negative space.</td>', 'While diagonal lines do create tension in a photo, this image has way too much negative space.', '2003-09-30 01:59:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(434968, 39893, 4210, '<td valign="top">The background is very busy, and in addition, those plants are sharp and pointy, which would be a bad thing for a bubble. Your camera is focused on the plants, and not the bubble, which should have been the main focus. A narrow(er) dof would have helped to blur out the plantlife.</td>', 'The background is very busy, and in addition, those plants are sharp and pointy, which would be a bad thing for a bubble. Your camera is focused on the plants, and not the bubble, which should have been the main focus. A narrow(er) dof would have helped to blur out the plantlife.', '2003-09-30 02:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(434969, 40078, 4210, '<td valign="top">Pretty, good colour, but I wish it was sharper, and with a faster shutter speed. In addition, the quality doesn''t look that great, but it could just be the sun being so bright.</td>', 'Pretty, good colour, but I wish it was sharper, and with a faster shutter speed. In addition, the quality doesn''t look that great, but it could just be the sun being so bright.', '2003-09-30 02:02:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(434970, 39964, 4210, '<td valign="top">Good use of negative space, and extra props for grayscale. Creative, a great capture, and I''m always a fan of vertical space.</td>', 'Good use of negative space, and extra props for grayscale. Creative, a great capture, and I''m always a fan of vertical space.', '2003-09-30 02:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(434971, 39910, 4210, '<td valign="top">Idonno... just too much being reflected to make it an effective shot for me.</td>', 'Idonno... just too much being reflected to make it an effective shot for me.', '2003-09-30 02:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(434972, 40039, 10084, '<td valign="top">Wish that the there was more contrast in the ball. I could see a lot of different colors in it, but it tough to see. The blue sky with the fluffy clouds really help to add interest to the shot. The composition is good. I like that the ball seems far away. Gives more of a flying sensation.</td>', 'Wish that the there was more contrast in the ball. I could see a lot of different colors in it, but it tough to see. The blue sky with the fluffy clouds really help to add interest to the shot. The composition is good. I like that the ball seems far away. Gives more of a flying sensation.', '2003-09-30 02:09:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(434974, 40050, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot just doesn''t have a lot going for it IMHO.  The ball isn''t realy in that sharp of a focus.  The crowd is just sitting there.  There is no action with players.  Nothing to keep my attention.  Now if the crowd was going wild....  Best I can do (and I DO like the concept but it''s a tough one to pull off well) is a 5.<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot just doesn''t have a lot going for it IMHO.  The ball isn''t realy in that sharp of a focus.  The crowd is just sitting there.  There is no action with players.  Nothing to keep my attention.  Now if the crowd was going wild....  Best I can do (and I DO like the concept but it''s a tough one to pull off well) is a 5.TC', '2003-09-30 02:24:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(434975, 39992, 10084, '<td valign="top">More lighting on the bottom half of the picture would help make the subject pop out more. The top of the vehicle has some vivid colors. If there was more light it would help give it more interest. The crane in the background is a bit distracting. I like the dirt flying as the vehicle jumps. It gives a good sense of motion and speed.</td>', 'More lighting on the bottom half of the picture would help make the subject pop out more. The top of the vehicle has some vivid colors. If there was more light it would help give it more interest. The crane in the background is a bit distracting. I like the dirt flying as the vehicle jumps. It gives a good sense of motion and speed.', '2003-09-30 02:26:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(434976, 40042, 9906, '<td valign="top">Mr. Happy still appears to be tethered....  (maybe not the best title!)  But seriously.  I like the originality!!!  It is a little soft on focus and DOF should be a touch deeper (IMHO).  Also the blown out part on the lip is a little distractiong.  Was that flash or sun???  Work a little on focus and lighting and this could work nicely!!!<br/>TC</td>', 'Mr. Happy still appears to be tethered....  (maybe not the best title!)  But seriously.  I like the originality!!!  It is a little soft on focus and DOF should be a touch deeper (IMHO).  Also the blown out part on the lip is a little distractiong.  Was that flash or sun???  Work a little on focus and lighting and this could work nicely!!!TC', '2003-09-30 02:30:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(434977, 39794, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colors in the plane. Really helps to make it stand out. The propellor in motion really helps to give dynamic and sense of flight. The crop is a bit close. Showing more sky would give even more sense of flight. If you decide to keep the crop try sharpening it a bit. When you see a closeup like this your eyes tend to look for details.</td>', 'Very vivid colors in the plane. Really helps to make it stand out. The propellor in motion really helps to give dynamic and sense of flight. The crop is a bit close. Showing more sky would give even more sense of flight. If you decide to keep the crop try sharpening it a bit. When you see a closeup like this your eyes tend to look for details.', '2003-09-30 02:32:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(434978, 40035, 9906, '<td valign="top">This shot leaves me confused.  There is not enoough detail.  What is the top bird sitting on?  Is the landing bird landing or striking???  What kind of birds are they?  What is the habitat?  The birds by themselves don''t tell a story... There needs to be just a little more visual cues to give the shot some meaning...  Does any of this make sense?<br/>TC</td>', 'This shot leaves me confused.  There is not enoough detail.  What is the top bird sitting on?  Is the landing bird landing or striking???  What kind of birds are they?  What is the habitat?  The birds by themselves don''t tell a story... There needs to be just a little more visual cues to give the shot some meaning...  Does any of this make sense?TC', '2003-09-30 02:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(434980, 39603, 9906, '<td valign="top">It''s a damn shame this ain''t in focus cause it would be the bomb if it was...</td>', 'It''s a damn shame this ain''t in focus cause it would be the bomb if it was...', '2003-09-30 02:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(434981, 40095, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good sense of motion shown by the motion trail. The lighting on the paper airplane really makes it pop out of the picture. The black background also helps. Good trick. Did you paint the motion in the background and place the plane? Looks good to me.</td>', 'Good sense of motion shown by the motion trail. The lighting on the paper airplane really makes it pop out of the picture. The black background also helps. Good trick. Did you paint the motion in the background and place the plane? Looks good to me.', '2003-09-30 02:39:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(434988, 39935, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shades of blue in the sky. Nice fluffy clouds. I like that you were able to include the wings in the shot. It gives a feeling of flight and that you are in the air. It would have been nice to crop out the window a bit.</td>', 'Beautiful shades of blue in the sky. Nice fluffy clouds. I like that you were able to include the wings in the shot. It gives a feeling of flight and that you are in the air. It would have been nice to crop out the window a bit.', '2003-09-30 02:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(434992, 39972, 10084, '<td valign="top">The top is distracting. Cropping all but the green in the background would help the composition. The contrast of the subject vs. the background is great. The subject is clear and in view. Blurring in the wings gives a sense of motion.</td>', 'The top is distracting. Cropping all but the green in the background would help the composition. The contrast of the subject vs. the background is great. The subject is clear and in view. Blurring in the wings gives a sense of motion.', '2003-09-30 03:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(434996, 39893, 9906, '<td valign="top">This is (IMHO) probably the best almost shot of the challenge.  This is a nice picture.  The plants are in nice focus and you have a great DOF looking into the garden.  Oh and there\''s a bubble there.<br/> <br/>Now if the bubble was in focus this would be it.  Tough shot to get perfect and a great attempt.  Bonus for difficulty!<br/> <br/>7<br/> <br/>Oh and ya got the Pepsi logo backwards in the bubble...<br/></td>', 'This is (IMHO) probably the best almost shot of the challenge.  This is a nice picture.  The plants are in nice focus and you have a great DOF looking into the garden.  Oh and there\''s a bubble there. Now if the bubble was in focus this would be it.  Tough shot to get perfect and a great attempt.  Bonus for difficulty! 7 Oh and ya got the Pepsi logo backwards in the bubble...', '2003-09-30 03:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(434997, 39857, 10084, '<td valign="top">The tree distracts from the shot. Cropping out the tree would help. It seems to overwhelm the image of the bird. The blue of the sky helps to make the bird pop out of the picture.</td>', 'The tree distracts from the shot. Cropping out the tree would help. It seems to overwhelm the image of the bird. The blue of the sky helps to make the bird pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-30 03:05:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(435007, 40047, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very vivid colors of the subjects really help to make them pop out of the shot. You can still see some really nice shadow and reflections even with the blown out lighting. Kind of funny how the guy is hanging on to the plane. Don''t know how you got the shot, but it''s incredible. Looks like you flying right next to them.</td>', 'Very vivid colors of the subjects really help to make them pop out of the shot. You can still see some really nice shadow and reflections even with the blown out lighting. Kind of funny how the guy is hanging on to the plane. Don''t know how you got the shot, but it''s incredible. Looks like you flying right next to them.', '2003-09-30 03:14:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435011, 40019, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. The slight blurring of the airplane helps to give it a sense of motion. Yet it''s in focus enough to read the logos on it. I think if you tone down the frame it would work better. It takes away from the picture.</td>', 'Interesting shot. The slight blurring of the airplane helps to give it a sense of motion. Yet it''s in focus enough to read the logos on it. I think if you tone down the frame it would work better. It takes away from the picture.', '2003-09-30 03:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(435012, 39964, 12684, '<td valign="top">Wow!  What a spectacular capture.  Best of luck to this one</td>', 'Wow!  What a spectacular capture.  Best of luck to this one', '2003-09-30 03:19:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(435022, 39797, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great composition. Lighting is pretty good. The reflections and shadows of the plane helps to give it bulk. The blurring of the propellor helps to add the extra effect of flight. I like the angle you chose to show the plane helps .</td>', 'Great composition. Lighting is pretty good. The reflections and shadows of the plane helps to give it bulk. The blurring of the propellor helps to add the extra effect of flight. I like the angle you chose to show the plane helps .', '2003-09-30 03:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(435044, 39802, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image, it''s my favourite for the challenge and the only 10 I have given. I am very keen to know who did this, it''s wonderful, well done.</td>', 'This is an excellent image, it''s my favourite for the challenge and the only 10 I have given. I am very keen to know who did this, it''s wonderful, well done.', '2003-09-30 03:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(435045, 39521, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great capture, full in flight and very focused. I don''t think you''d be able to get this pic twice, well done.</td>', 'Great capture, full in flight and very focused. I don''t think you''d be able to get this pic twice, well done.', '2003-09-30 03:46:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435047, 39886, 5728, '<td valign="top">I love the serenity in this photo, kind of like calm before the storm with those dark clouds out the back. Wonderful image - 9.</td>', 'I love the serenity in this photo, kind of like calm before the storm with those dark clouds out the back. Wonderful image - 9.', '2003-09-30 03:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(435056, 40047, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the red/yellow color combinations against the white background. It works well. I am not quite sure how you got in so close at the same level, but I am guessing the plane was banking and you took it from the ground right?</td>', 'I like the red/yellow color combinations against the white background. It works well. I am not quite sure how you got in so close at the same level, but I am guessing the plane was banking and you took it from the ground right?', '2003-09-30 03:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435057, 40089, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. I hope this was only a trick and that guy is okay! The white smoke on the blue sky background is what gives this pic its boost - 9.</td>', 'Excellent capture. I hope this was only a trick and that guy is okay! The white smoke on the blue sky background is what gives this pic its boost - 9.', '2003-09-30 03:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(435060, 39891, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. I bet you had to wait around and take a lot of pics before you got this beauty right? The blurred tree in the lower right brings in an additional color to balance the photo - 9.</td>', 'Beautiful capture. I bet you had to wait around and take a lot of pics before you got this beauty right? The blurred tree in the lower right brings in an additional color to balance the photo - 9.', '2003-09-30 04:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(435063, 40081, 5728, '<td valign="top">Now just how did you manage to get the under wing of that seagull in such an amazing color? It is what really makes this photo. A near perfect capture - 9.</td>', 'Now just how did you manage to get the under wing of that seagull in such an amazing color? It is what really makes this photo. A near perfect capture - 9.', '2003-09-30 04:02:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(435064, 40086, 5728, '<td valign="top">Be proud of this photo, it is wonderful! It almost looks like a painting. The effect of the plane smoke going from a cleaner white on the right to a dirtier brown/black on the left works so well contrasted against the white background clouds.</td>', 'Be proud of this photo, it is wonderful! It almost looks like a painting. The effect of the plane smoke going from a cleaner white on the right to a dirtier brown/black on the left works so well contrasted against the white background clouds.', '2003-09-30 04:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435067, 39959, 5728, '<td valign="top">Why didn''t you give this a title? It is the only reason I''m not giving you a full 10 for it. A title does a lot for a photo. The photo itself is great, a very good capture and to present it in B &amp; W was a good choice - 9.</td>', 'Why didn''t you give this a title? It is the only reason I''m not giving you a full 10 for it. A title does a lot for a photo. The photo itself is great, a very good capture and to present it in B & W was a good choice - 9.', '2003-09-30 04:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(435069, 39957, 5728, '<td valign="top">The texture of the water in the background is good. The perspective of the gull flying is also interesting, it looks like it is just coming in to land right? - 8.</td>', 'The texture of the water in the background is good. The perspective of the gull flying is also interesting, it looks like it is just coming in to land right? - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:08:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(435071, 39990, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, nice perspective. I would have put the extra space in front of the parachutist instead of behind. I always learnt that there should be space in the direction of movement in a photo, kind of breathing space if you like - 8.</td>', 'Good idea, nice perspective. I would have put the extra space in front of the parachutist instead of behind. I always learnt that there should be space in the direction of movement in a photo, kind of breathing space if you like - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:10:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(435072, 39991, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow spooky! This kind of reminds me of "Hitchcock''s" The Birds. The graininess works well here, and that''s coming from someone who is not a big fan of grain.</td>', 'Wow spooky! This kind of reminds me of "Hitchcock''s" The Birds. The graininess works well here, and that''s coming from someone who is not a big fan of grain.', '2003-09-30 04:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(435073, 39956, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture although there is something about the composition that is bothering me. I think the crane out the back is distracting somewhat. There isn''t too much you could have done about it though I guess, a tighter crop would have cut out too many birds.</td>', 'Good capture although there is something about the composition that is bothering me. I think the crane out the back is distracting somewhat. There isn''t too much you could have done about it though I guess, a tighter crop would have cut out too many birds.', '2003-09-30 04:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(435074, 39869, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, I like the sepia tone you chose.</td>', 'Good capture, I like the sepia tone you chose.', '2003-09-30 04:14:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(435075, 39949, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice capture of a gull in full flight. I like the way the sun is gleaming off the front wings and the gull is looking directly towards the sun.</td>', 'Nice capture of a gull in full flight. I like the way the sun is gleaming off the front wings and the gull is looking directly towards the sun.', '2003-09-30 04:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(435076, 39602, 5728, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the film "The Birds". The motion blur on the wings intensifies this image in my opinion.</td>', 'This reminds me of the film "The Birds". The motion blur on the wings intensifies this image in my opinion.', '2003-09-30 04:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(435077, 40026, 5728, '<td valign="top">The dark background highlights your pigeon well. How did you get the background to be so dark and the pigeon so well lit?</td>', 'The dark background highlights your pigeon well. How did you get the background to be so dark and the pigeon so well lit?', '2003-09-30 04:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(435078, 39802, 10673, '<td valign="top">Spectacular...love the "feel" of this captured moment!  10</td>', 'Spectacular...love the "feel" of this captured moment!  10', '2003-09-30 04:18:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(435080, 39985, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea for the challenge. The colors are very vivid and don''t compete with each other at all, in fact they work well against that crisp blue sky out the back.</td>', 'Good idea for the challenge. The colors are very vivid and don''t compete with each other at all, in fact they work well against that crisp blue sky out the back.', '2003-09-30 04:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(435082, 39986, 5728, '<td valign="top">The crop is a little too tight for me. A moving object needs space in front of it, something I learnt from photo courses. Otherwise a good pic - 8.</td>', 'The crop is a little too tight for me. A moving object needs space in front of it, something I learnt from photo courses. Otherwise a good pic - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(435083, 39949, 10673, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!  10</td>', 'Magnificent!  10', '2003-09-30 04:21:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435084, 39942, 10673, '<td valign="top">Exquisite!  Beautifully captured!  10</td>', 'Exquisite!  Beautifully captured!  10', '2003-09-30 04:23:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(435085, 39580, 10673, '<td valign="top">Wonderfully intriguing!  Beautifully done!  10</td>', 'Wonderfully intriguing!  Beautifully done!  10', '2003-09-30 04:24:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(435086, 40021, 5728, '<td valign="top">The composition is good, especially with the bee coming in from the upper-left. The bee is sharp and focused, but the dark background seems to be competing too much and is taking a lot of the glamour away from it. The flowers are blurred somewhat, which is a little on the distracting side as my eyes keep wanting to look down in the lower-right corner.</td>', 'The composition is good, especially with the bee coming in from the upper-left. The bee is sharp and focused, but the dark background seems to be competing too much and is taking a lot of the glamour away from it. The flowers are blurred somewhat, which is a little on the distracting side as my eyes keep wanting to look down in the lower-right corner.', '2003-09-30 04:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(435087, 39933, 10673, '<td valign="top">Great capture!  10</td>', 'Great capture!  10', '2003-09-30 04:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(435088, 39554, 5728, '<td valign="top">Don''t know how you managed this one but the effect is very interesting. The table is kind of in an awkward position and is a little distracting. Maybe a different shooting position might have been more enhancing.</td>', 'Don''t know how you managed this one but the effect is very interesting. The table is kind of in an awkward position and is a little distracting. Maybe a different shooting position might have been more enhancing.', '2003-09-30 04:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(435090, 39133, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow, perfectly frozen in the air, and so sharp. How many shots did you need to get this beauty? The background is nicely blurred through the shallow DOF, although it competes with your main subject a little. Also I would have left a little bit more space around the bird, especially at the front in the direction it is looking. The crop is a little on the tight side.</td>', 'Wow, perfectly frozen in the air, and so sharp. How many shots did you need to get this beauty? The background is nicely blurred through the shallow DOF, although it competes with your main subject a little. Also I would have left a little bit more space around the bird, especially at the front in the direction it is looking. The crop is a little on the tight side.', '2003-09-30 04:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(435091, 39886, 10673, '<td valign="top">Well captured!</td>', 'Well captured!', '2003-09-30 04:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(435093, 39521, 10673, '<td valign="top">Terrific capture!  10</td>', 'Terrific capture!  10', '2003-09-30 04:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435094, 39883, 10673, '<td valign="top">Looks like he''s swinging!  Fantastic capture!  10</td>', 'Looks like he''s swinging!  Fantastic capture!  10', '2003-09-30 04:39:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(435095, 39901, 10673, '<td valign="top">Very cute!  10</td>', 'Very cute!  10', '2003-09-30 04:40:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(435097, 40048, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great perspective, color and lighting. I especially like the effect of the clouds and the sunlight on the fuselage - 8.</td>', 'Great perspective, color and lighting. I especially like the effect of the clouds and the sunlight on the fuselage - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:44:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435099, 40035, 5728, '<td valign="top">The blown out effect in the upper right doesn''t work negatively here, in fact I like it. I get the feeling these are three competely different birds who don''t want to have anything to do with each other, funny. Good - 8.</td>', 'The blown out effect in the upper right doesn''t work negatively here, in fact I like it. I get the feeling these are three competely different birds who don''t want to have anything to do with each other, funny. Good - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:46:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(435100, 40094, 5728, '<td valign="top">I can''t seem to make out any pollen flying around there, however the photo is rather small and makes it a little difficult to recognise anything. Try to get the longest length of the photo to be at 640 px, it will enhance it a lot more.</td>', 'I can''t seem to make out any pollen flying around there, however the photo is rather small and makes it a little difficult to recognise anything. Try to get the longest length of the photo to be at 640 px, it will enhance it a lot more.', '2003-09-30 04:48:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(435102, 39873, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo is quite good actually, although the challenge does state that the object must be in flight, so I guess you''ll be hit a lot lower because it doesn''t fully meet the challenge. Still worth a 6 from me though.</td>', 'This photo is quite good actually, although the challenge does state that the object must be in flight, so I guess you''ll be hit a lot lower because it doesn''t fully meet the challenge. Still worth a 6 from me though.', '2003-09-30 04:51:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435103, 40040, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yup, I guess this is also "In flight", an original idea, good one.</td>', 'Yup, I guess this is also "In flight", an original idea, good one.', '2003-09-30 04:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(435104, 39666, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, I love the color combinations here. I personally would have left the negative space in the direction your subject is facing tho rather than behind it. And as it isn''t actually "In flight" I think you''ll get marked lower for it.</td>', 'Nice photo, I love the color combinations here. I personally would have left the negative space in the direction your subject is facing tho rather than behind it. And as it isn''t actually "In flight" I think you''ll get marked lower for it.', '2003-09-30 04:54:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(435105, 39933, 5728, '<td valign="top">Great capture, the DOF does wonders to the background - 8.</td>', 'Great capture, the DOF does wonders to the background - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:55:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(435106, 39563, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one! The perspective is interesting, even tho the general rule is to leave more space in the direction an object is moving - 8.</td>', 'Good one! The perspective is interesting, even tho the general rule is to leave more space in the direction an object is moving - 8.', '2003-09-30 04:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(435107, 40096, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, the perspective is very good. It seems as if you are flying above the bird. I like the panning effect on the background too.</td>', 'Good capture, the perspective is very good. It seems as if you are flying above the bird. I like the panning effect on the background too.', '2003-09-30 05:07:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435108, 40083, 5728, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective, the crispy blue sky works in well with the gull. It is a tad on the grainy side tho.</td>', 'Simple but effective, the crispy blue sky works in well with the gull. It is a tad on the grainy side tho.', '2003-09-30 05:07:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(435109, 39517, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one, nice colors combinations there. I would have left some more room in front of the plane tho, otherwise a good pic!</td>', 'Good one, nice colors combinations there. I would have left some more room in front of the plane tho, otherwise a good pic!', '2003-09-30 05:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(435110, 39995, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one! The cloud formations are awesome and the blue of the sky is very deep and crisp. I personally wouldn''t have centered the plane though.</td>', 'Good one! The cloud formations are awesome and the blue of the sky is very deep and crisp. I personally wouldn''t have centered the plane though.', '2003-09-30 05:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(435111, 39876, 5728, '<td valign="top">The balloon appears a little on the dark side, I would have prefered seeing that blue shouting out at me, but looking at the postion of the sun you''ve photographed the shadow side.</td>', 'The balloon appears a little on the dark side, I would have prefered seeing that blue shouting out at me, but looking at the postion of the sun you''ve photographed the shadow side.', '2003-09-30 05:11:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435112, 39964, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good! Very original and well shot. The B &amp; W was a good choice.</td>', 'Good! Very original and well shot. The B & W was a good choice.', '2003-09-30 05:12:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(435113, 40059, 5728, '<td valign="top">An original take on the "Flight" challenge. Something different to seeing birds and planes all the time. Good capture, well frozen.</td>', 'An original take on the "Flight" challenge. Something different to seeing birds and planes all the time. Good capture, well frozen.', '2003-09-30 05:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(435114, 39984, 5728, '<td valign="top">Excellent capture. You were in the right place at the right time for this one right? The effect of the setting (or rising) sun really boosts this image, and your title is both funny and fitting.</td>', 'Excellent capture. You were in the right place at the right time for this one right? The effect of the setting (or rising) sun really boosts this image, and your title is both funny and fitting.', '2003-09-30 05:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(435115, 40057, 5728, '<td valign="top">Choice capture! This was split second timing to get that pic right huh? Good on ya!</td>', 'Choice capture! This was split second timing to get that pic right huh? Good on ya!', '2003-09-30 05:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(435116, 39797, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good composition, maybe a little too tightly cropped around the plane, but at least the negative space is in front of the plane in the direction it is flying. The is also some traces of artefacting around the edges of the plane itself.</td>', 'Good composition, maybe a little too tightly cropped around the plane, but at least the negative space is in front of the plane in the direction it is flying. The is also some traces of artefacting around the edges of the plane itself.', '2003-09-30 05:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(435117, 39543, 5728, '<td valign="top">The texture of the clouds is very intersting, like they are flowing water or something. The whole image appears slightly on the dark side tho, although it maybe because it is nearly evening time. I wish the plane were a little larger because after all it is supposed to be your main subject in the photo.</td>', 'The texture of the clouds is very intersting, like they are flowing water or something. The whole image appears slightly on the dark side tho, although it maybe because it is nearly evening time. I wish the plane were a little larger because after all it is supposed to be your main subject in the photo.', '2003-09-30 05:18:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435118, 39867, 5728, '<td valign="top">The border is not really my cup of tea, it competes too much with the photo itself. Otherwise a good pic which gives me a feeling of silence and serenity.</td>', 'The border is not really my cup of tea, it competes too much with the photo itself. Otherwise a good pic which gives me a feeling of silence and serenity.', '2003-09-30 05:19:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(435119, 40062, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks like its flying into the storm clouds. Is that a kite? I can''t quite make it out. Interesting photo, definitely meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Looks like its flying into the storm clouds. Is that a kite? I can''t quite make it out. Interesting photo, definitely meeting the challenge.', '2003-09-30 05:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435120, 40067, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very original. What is the glow around the top of the music paper? It gives it a blurry effect. I also would have cropped it a little differently, it seems too tight to me.</td>', 'Very original. What is the glow around the top of the music paper? It gives it a blurry effect. I also would have cropped it a little differently, it seems too tight to me.', '2003-09-30 05:23:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(435121, 40055, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, although it appears a little too tightly cropped to me. I''ve never flown in one of those things, it is surely on my list of things to do, must be great.</td>', 'Good capture, although it appears a little too tightly cropped to me. I''ve never flown in one of those things, it is surely on my list of things to do, must be great.', '2003-09-30 05:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(435122, 39884, 5728, '<td valign="top">Your main subject is too centered, I really would have prefered to seen you using the rule of thirds here. It would have enhanced your image so much.</td>', 'Your main subject is too centered, I really would have prefered to seen you using the rule of thirds here. It would have enhanced your image so much.', '2003-09-30 05:26:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435123, 40045, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice and sharp your main subject. The top left hand corner is kind of distracting but I see you couldn''t really have cropped it out efficiently. I especially like the many brown tones you used here.</td>', 'Nice and sharp your main subject. The top left hand corner is kind of distracting but I see you couldn''t really have cropped it out efficiently. I especially like the many brown tones you used here.', '2003-09-30 05:28:26.000000', NULL, 1),
