(435126, 39818, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the yellow and green tones in this image. The DOF gives it that soft feel to it. Your main focus is on the yellow flower and not on your main subject, the bee, which is flying off in the distance.</td>', 'Love the yellow and green tones in this image. The DOF gives it that soft feel to it. Your main focus is on the yellow flower and not on your main subject, the bee, which is flying off in the distance.', '2003-09-30 05:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435128, 39870, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well captured. A single fairy flying away, well done. Did you have many attempts at this - 7.</td>', 'Good idea and well captured. A single fairy flying away, well done. Did you have many attempts at this - 7.', '2003-09-30 05:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(435129, 39528, 5728, '<td valign="top">Man those clouds look they are on fire! The silohuettes of the two birds are so effective against that amazing sky. I personally wouldn''t have included so much whiteness at the bottom of the image tho, it is distracting.</td>', 'Man those clouds look they are on fire! The silohuettes of the two birds are so effective against that amazing sky. I personally wouldn''t have included so much whiteness at the bottom of the image tho, it is distracting.', '2003-09-30 05:35:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(435130, 39942, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, well timed.</td>', 'Good capture, well timed.', '2003-09-30 05:36:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(435131, 40017, 5728, '<td valign="top">The compostion is good. Wouldn''t it have been good had you gotten its wings in full span? But that''s just luck right, this is also very effective.</td>', 'The compostion is good. Wouldn''t it have been good had you gotten its wings in full span? But that''s just luck right, this is also very effective.', '2003-09-30 05:37:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(435132, 39968, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny and very original. Good one, however the background is competing against your main subject.</td>', 'Funny and very original. Good one, however the background is competing against your main subject.', '2003-09-30 05:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435134, 39471, 5728, '<td valign="top">A little too grainy and tightly cropped, but the perspective is amazing.</td>', 'A little too grainy and tightly cropped, but the perspective is amazing.', '2003-09-30 05:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(435136, 40080, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah well frozen. The light is very good there. A pity you didn''t get all the birds in focus, especially the one flying in the lower right corner.</td>', 'Ah well frozen. The light is very good there. A pity you didn''t get all the birds in focus, especially the one flying in the lower right corner.', '2003-09-30 05:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(435137, 39992, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, well timed. The crane sticking out the top left of the car is a little distracting, but I guess this is a photo you can only take once right :-)</td>', 'Good capture, well timed. The crane sticking out the top left of the car is a little distracting, but I guess this is a photo you can only take once right :-)', '2003-09-30 05:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(435138, 39542, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture and full in flight. The girl looks so happy! Although the hands of the person "tossing" are not too bad being in the photo as well, I think that without them the feeling of "flight" would have been enhanced.</td>', 'Wonderful capture and full in flight. The girl looks so happy! Although the hands of the person "tossing" are not too bad being in the photo as well, I think that without them the feeling of "flight" would have been enhanced.', '2003-09-30 05:46:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(435139, 39124, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good shot, that''s one wicked sky in the background. Perfect use of the rule of thirds here.</td>', 'Good shot, that''s one wicked sky in the background. Perfect use of the rule of thirds here.', '2003-09-30 05:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(435140, 39910, 5728, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo, amazing reflections there. Did you polish that up before you took the photo? Unfortunately the plane is not actually in flight, so I guess you might get marked down for that. Still worth a 7 from me tho.</td>', 'Beautiful photo, amazing reflections there. Did you polish that up before you took the photo? Unfortunately the plane is not actually in flight, so I guess you might get marked down for that. Still worth a 7 from me tho.', '2003-09-30 05:49:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435142, 39936, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good one, I love the olivey green tones in the background. A pity you couldn''t have frozen it completely and avoided the motion blur on the left wing, but I know how difficult it is to capture something like this in flight so I''m not complaining at all :-)</td>', 'Good one, I love the olivey green tones in the background. A pity you couldn''t have frozen it completely and avoided the motion blur on the left wing, but I know how difficult it is to capture something like this in flight so I''m not complaining at all :-)', '2003-09-30 05:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(435143, 39962, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture nice line up there. The composition is good, the gulls in the line up are a tad on the dark side tho, especially if you compare them to how lightened the bird in flight is. However because the topic this week is in flight, you''ve made it appear that your main subject is in the spotlight. Good one.</td>', 'Good capture nice line up there. The composition is good, the gulls in the line up are a tad on the dark side tho, especially if you compare them to how lightened the bird in flight is. However because the topic this week is in flight, you''ve made it appear that your main subject is in the spotlight. Good one.', '2003-09-30 06:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435145, 39898, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny pic, actually it is very interesting and different to what I''ve been seeing here so far. The crop and composition is good and the B &amp; W is also not negative. I think you will get marked down a lot tho as your main subject is not actually in flight.</td>', 'Funny pic, actually it is very interesting and different to what I''ve been seeing here so far. The crop and composition is good and the B & W is also not negative. I think you will get marked down a lot tho as your main subject is not actually in flight.', '2003-09-30 06:03:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(435146, 40095, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea and well composed. I especially like the effect of the "vapor trail" :-) Simple but effective.</td>', 'Good idea and well composed. I especially like the effect of the "vapor trail" :-) Simple but effective.', '2003-09-30 06:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(435147, 40043, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, it looks so close. The composition is interesting although I would have left more room in the front of the plane, the direction it is moving.</td>', 'Good capture, it looks so close. The composition is interesting although I would have left more room in the front of the plane, the direction it is moving.', '2003-09-30 06:05:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(435148, 40092, 5728, '<td valign="top">This photo also reminds me of Hitchcock''s film, The Birds. Nice lighting, it works well. I especially like the bird in the middle left, it looks like it is just hanging there. The white blotch between the birds on the right is a little distracting tho.</td>', 'This photo also reminds me of Hitchcock''s film, The Birds. Nice lighting, it works well. I especially like the bird in the middle left, it looks like it is just hanging there. The white blotch between the birds on the right is a little distracting tho.', '2003-09-30 06:07:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(435150, 39140, 5728, '<td valign="top">This picture is not bad, the colors are good, it is pretty much in focus and the cropping is even. The angle is also okay. But you know what is missing? The kick is missing. It is just a photo of a plane taking off and that''s all. I would have maybe composed it differently, maybe bringing in some negative space, placing the plane using the rule of thirds, something like that. I''m giving you a 7 for it tho because there still isn''t too much wrong with it other than that it is uninteresting.</td>', 'This picture is not bad, the colors are good, it is pretty much in focus and the cropping is even. The angle is also okay. But you know what is missing? The kick is missing. It is just a photo of a plane taking off and that''s all. I would have maybe composed it differently, maybe bringing in some negative space, placing the plane using the rule of thirds, something like that. I''m giving you a 7 for it tho because there still isn''t too much wrong with it other than that it is uninteresting.', '2003-09-30 06:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(435152, 39192, 5728, '<td valign="top">The capture is good, however it is a little too grainy and could use a saturation tweak.</td>', 'The capture is good, however it is a little too grainy and could use a saturation tweak.', '2003-09-30 06:16:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(435154, 39932, 5728, '<td valign="top">I really don''t want to sound to hard but a critique is a critique right and not meant to be offensive at all, rather helpful. First of all this bird is not really in flight which was the main requirement of the challenge. Secondly, I find the crop is a little too tight, I would have left some more breathing space around it. Thirdly, the photo appears a tad to flat, maybe pumping the contrast a little by adding a brightness/contrast adjustment layer might have enhanced it somewhat. I still gave this photo a 6 though, because I like the stance of the bird that you have captured, the way its wings are spanned out and also the way it is looking.</td>', 'I really don''t want to sound to hard but a critique is a critique right and not meant to be offensive at all, rather helpful. First of all this bird is not really in flight which was the main requirement of the challenge. Secondly, I find the crop is a little too tight, I would have left some more breathing space around it. Thirdly, the photo appears a tad to flat, maybe pumping the contrast a little by adding a brightness/contrast adjustment layer might have enhanced it somewhat. I still gave this photo a 6 though, because I like the stance of the bird that you have captured, the way its wings are spanned out and also the way it is looking.', '2003-09-30 06:24:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435155, 39905, 5728, '<td valign="top">Very good idea, the effect is good, even tho it is slightly oversharpened.</td>', 'Very good idea, the effect is good, even tho it is slightly oversharpened.', '2003-09-30 06:25:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(435156, 40084, 5728, '<td valign="top">This is a little too tightly cropped and the wall in the background is distracting. The position of the gull in flight that you''ve captured is good tho, pity the photo wasn''t a little bigger.</td>', 'This is a little too tightly cropped and the wall in the background is distracting. The position of the gull in flight that you''ve captured is good tho, pity the photo wasn''t a little bigger.', '2003-09-30 06:26:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(435158, 40078, 5728, '<td valign="top">Horses in flight right? I guess that is also in flight. A little unsharp overall.The sunset is very explosive.</td>', 'Horses in flight right? I guess that is also in flight. A little unsharp overall.The sunset is very explosive.', '2003-09-30 06:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(435159, 39901, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good idea, also original.</td>', 'Good idea, also original.', '2003-09-30 06:28:18.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(435160, 40093, 5728, '<td valign="top">Yup he''s flying! Original for sure. Couldn''t you have uploaded the photo a little larger?</td>', 'Yup he''s flying! Original for sure. Couldn''t you have uploaded the photo a little larger?', '2003-09-30 06:29:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(435162, 39018, 5728, '<td valign="top">You captured that well, was it moving fast? You''ve frozen it completely, although I see it is just coming into land right? Pity about the serrated edges on the lower fuselage.</td>', 'You captured that well, was it moving fast? You''ve frozen it completely, although I see it is just coming into land right? Pity about the serrated edges on the lower fuselage.', '2003-09-30 06:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(435163, 39580, 5728, '<td valign="top">Looks like a painting, I like it. Pity about the lens flare though.</td>', 'Looks like a painting, I like it. Pity about the lens flare though.', '2003-09-30 06:31:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(435164, 39644, 5728, '<td valign="top">Super Mat, funny! Wish you''d cropped out your shadow down the bottom left hand corner tho.</td>', 'Super Mat, funny! Wish you''d cropped out your shadow down the bottom left hand corner tho.', '2003-09-30 06:33:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(435165, 40041, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Pretty firey red and yellow tones there.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Pretty firey red and yellow tones there.', '2003-09-30 06:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(435167, 39928, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting for sure and met the challenge spot on. The composition is good although he is flying out of your image instead of into it. I''m not too sure I like the color desaturation here much, I''d love to see the color version of it. All in all a good photo which is lacking that extra "wow".</td>', 'Interesting for sure and met the challenge spot on. The composition is good although he is flying out of your image instead of into it. I''m not too sure I like the color desaturation here much, I''d love to see the color version of it. All in all a good photo which is lacking that extra "wow".', '2003-09-30 06:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(435168, 39966, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well it is not really in flight is it! I see what you are getting at tho and good on you for originality.</td>', 'Well it is not really in flight is it! I see what you are getting at tho and good on you for originality.', '2003-09-30 06:39:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(435169, 40071, 5728, '<td valign="top">Woah, scarey! Looks like a scene from some horror film.... interesting concept.</td>', 'Woah, scarey! Looks like a scene from some horror film.... interesting concept.', '2003-09-30 06:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(435170, 39996, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo, certainly original. I''m not sure the motion blur really comes through tho. It would have been good had you got the seed part sharp and the wing part in motion blur. But I guess something like that would be quite difficult.</td>', 'Interesting photo, certainly original. I''m not sure the motion blur really comes through tho. It would have been good had you got the seed part sharp and the wing part in motion blur. But I guess something like that would be quite difficult.', '2003-09-30 06:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(435171, 40037, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah you didn''t get her in flight, but I suppose literally she is. The people in the background are a little distracting here.</td>', 'Ah you didn''t get her in flight, but I suppose literally she is. The people in the background are a little distracting here.', '2003-09-30 06:44:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(435172, 40039, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original, however the ball is out of focus and too centered. The sky and clouds make for an awesome background texture.</td>', 'Original, however the ball is out of focus and too centered. The sky and clouds make for an awesome background texture.', '2003-09-30 06:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435173, 40069, 5728, '<td valign="top">Your main focus appears to be on the left part of the plant and not on your main subject.</td>', 'Your main focus appears to be on the left part of the plant and not on your main subject.', '2003-09-30 06:46:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435174, 39511, 5728, '<td valign="top">It looks like a sunny day, but your image seems to be overall too dark. I like your idea tho.</td>', 'It looks like a sunny day, but your image seems to be overall too dark. I like your idea tho.', '2003-09-30 06:47:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(435176, 39184, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well congratulations you have the only helicopter in the challenge. Interesting composition, especially leaving room in front of the chopper.</td>', 'Well congratulations you have the only helicopter in the challenge. Interesting composition, especially leaving room in front of the chopper.', '2003-09-30 06:56:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435177, 40042, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good composition. This is so simple but very well done.</td>', 'Good composition. This is so simple but very well done.', '2003-09-30 06:57:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(435178, 39893, 5728, '<td valign="top">Simple but effective.</td>', 'Simple but effective.', '2003-09-30 06:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435179, 39972, 5728, '<td valign="top">The mist has an interesting effect here, especially the way it is blurring out the two birds at the back.</td>', 'The mist has an interesting effect here, especially the way it is blurring out the two birds at the back.', '2003-09-30 06:58:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435180, 40019, 5728, '<td valign="top">He he funny! You have a good eye.</td>', 'He he funny! You have a good eye.', '2003-09-30 06:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(435181, 39883, 5728, '<td valign="top">I like the tone of blue in the background. Pity your spider isn''t fully sharp though.</td>', 'I like the tone of blue in the background. Pity your spider isn''t fully sharp though.', '2003-09-30 06:59:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435182, 39935, 5728, '<td valign="top">I was on a plane on Saturday, so why didn''t I think of doing something like this? Good one, I love the deep intense color of the blue sky especially the higher up you look.</td>', 'I was on a plane on Saturday, so why didn''t I think of doing something like this? Good one, I love the deep intense color of the blue sky especially the higher up you look.', '2003-09-30 07:00:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(435183, 39863, 5728, '<td valign="top">That''s a strange looking basket on that balloon! Never seen on like that before. Good capture, the cropping is okay, nearly a little too tight but only borderline. I would have liked to have seen that sky a deep crispy blue.</td>', 'That''s a strange looking basket on that balloon! Never seen on like that before. Good capture, the cropping is okay, nearly a little too tight but only borderline. I would have liked to have seen that sky a deep crispy blue.', '2003-09-30 07:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435184, 40079, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, I didn''t know people still flew those kinds of planes! What a pity you couldn''t have brought out the greens in those trees a little more.</td>', 'Good capture, I didn''t know people still flew those kinds of planes! What a pity you couldn''t have brought out the greens in those trees a little more.', '2003-09-30 07:05:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(435185, 39812, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well it really isn''t actually in flight is it! I think you will get marked down for that in this challenge. Otherwise a good photo. I like the gradient of the background.</td>', 'Well it really isn''t actually in flight is it! I think you will get marked down for that in this challenge. Otherwise a good photo. I like the gradient of the background.', '2003-09-30 07:10:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(435186, 39994, 5728, '<td valign="top">The horizon is not only slanted but you have placed it exactly in the middle which is not really a photographic plus point. There is something white and distracting on the right edge of your image about quarter of the way down, which you could have easily cropped out without cropping any of the lower gull out as well. I see you positioned yourself to include the lighthouse in your shot, which was a good idea. The red cyclist also brings in some effect. I wish the lamp post wasn''t there though, but I guess you couldn''t have changed that at all. The stormy sky and rough sea give this photo a real autumn feel.</td>', 'The horizon is not only slanted but you have placed it exactly in the middle which is not really a photographic plus point. There is something white and distracting on the right edge of your image about quarter of the way down, which you could have easily cropped out without cropping any of the lower gull out as well. I see you positioned yourself to include the lighthouse in your shot, which was a good idea. The red cyclist also brings in some effect. I wish the lamp post wasn''t there though, but I guess you couldn''t have changed that at all. The stormy sky and rough sea give this photo a real autumn feel.', '2003-09-30 07:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(435187, 39954, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good composition. I don''t particularly like the magenta tinges in the sky though, youcould have removed those in Photoshop.</td>', 'Good composition. I don''t particularly like the magenta tinges in the sky though, youcould have removed those in Photoshop.', '2003-09-30 07:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435188, 39649, 5728, '<td valign="top">Wow stormy skies, they look good. What a contrast huh? The cropping is good, I like how you gave the plane some breathing room in the direction it is flying.</td>', 'Wow stormy skies, they look good. What a contrast huh? The cropping is good, I like how you gave the plane some breathing room in the direction it is flying.', '2003-09-30 07:20:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(435189, 39640, 5728, '<td valign="top">Nice composition even if the birds are a little too far away. The contrast between the ground and clouds and blue sky is great. There is a slight magenta tinge in the clouds in the lower right corner.</td>', 'Nice composition even if the birds are a little too far away. The contrast between the ground and clouds and blue sky is great. There is a slight magenta tinge in the clouds in the lower right corner.', '2003-09-30 07:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435190, 40091, 5728, '<td valign="top">I don''t really see any flight here so I think you haven''t really met the challenge and you''ll probably get marked lower for it. The composition is interesting as is your choice of sepia toning. Somehow this photo gives me a stormy autumny kind of feeling.</td>', 'I don''t really see any flight here so I think you haven''t really met the challenge and you''ll probably get marked lower for it. The composition is interesting as is your choice of sepia toning. Somehow this photo gives me a stormy autumny kind of feeling.', '2003-09-30 07:24:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(435191, 39794, 5728, '<td valign="top">The yellow and blue work well together. The quality of the photo has been degraded excessively, most probably through saving for the web.</td>', 'The yellow and blue work well together. The quality of the photo has been degraded excessively, most probably through saving for the web.', '2003-09-30 07:26:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(435192, 39798, 5728, '<td valign="top">Interesting photo. The black background really highlights those flying fairys there.</td>', 'Interesting photo. The black background really highlights those flying fairys there.', '2003-09-30 07:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(435193, 39044, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the gradients in the background. Lucky you getting a clean window to photograph through. I always seem to get stuck with dirty ones whenever I fly.</td>', 'Love the gradients in the background. Lucky you getting a clean window to photograph through. I always seem to get stuck with dirty ones whenever I fly.', '2003-09-30 07:27:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(435194, 39941, 5728, '<td valign="top">Love the cloud structure there.</td>', 'Love the cloud structure there.', '2003-09-30 07:28:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(435195, 40090, 5728, '<td valign="top">I always like seeing birds flying at full wing span. Good capture, maybe a little on the dark side though.</td>', 'I always like seeing birds flying at full wing span. Good capture, maybe a little on the dark side though.', '2003-09-30 07:29:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(435196, 39851, 5728, '<td valign="top">Ah that post is distracting! Maybe a different shooting position might have been better. This would have been great with just frisbee, sky, boy and trees.</td>', 'Ah that post is distracting! Maybe a different shooting position might have been better. This would have been great with just frisbee, sky, boy and trees.', '2003-09-30 07:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(435197, 40050, 5728, '<td valign="top">Original idea. This was my favourite game for years. At school we had to play it. This isn''t South Africa is it? Good composition you chose.</td>', 'Original idea. This was my favourite game for years. At school we had to play it. This isn''t South Africa is it? Good composition you chose.', '2003-09-30 07:31:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(435198, 39857, 5728, '<td valign="top">I wish you had gotten your main subject to be larger or closer. The composition of your picture is good. The tree, the bird and the sky work well together. Just that the bird is so far away is a pity.</td>', 'I wish you had gotten your main subject to be larger or closer. The composition of your picture is good. The tree, the bird and the sky work well together. Just that the bird is so far away is a pity.', '2003-09-30 07:33:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435200, 39849, 5728, '<td valign="top">Well this has just got to be Iceland right? Great capture! Did you have to climb up a mountain for this one? I like the way you nearly froze those propellers.</td>', 'Well this has just got to be Iceland right? Great capture! Did you have to climb up a mountain for this one? I like the way you nearly froze those propellers.', '2003-09-30 07:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435201, 39512, 5728, '<td valign="top">The graininess works well here, I like it. I''m not sure I like that shadow in the middle though, it''s kind of distracting.</td>', 'The graininess works well here, I like it. I''m not sure I like that shadow in the middle though, it''s kind of distracting.', '2003-09-30 07:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(435202, 40032, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture. I wish the skies could have been a nice deep crispy blue, that would have looked amazing, but this is still good too. There is a slight magenta tinge in the top right hand corner.</td>', 'Good capture. I wish the skies could have been a nice deep crispy blue, that would have looked amazing, but this is still good too. There is a slight magenta tinge in the top right hand corner.', '2003-09-30 07:36:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(435203, 39738, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, certainly different.</td>', 'Good perspective, certainly different.', '2003-09-30 07:37:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(435204, 40033, 5728, '<td valign="top">Funny title, it kind of fits the image so well. It seems as if it is landing tho and not taking off.</td>', 'Funny title, it kind of fits the image so well. It seems as if it is landing tho and not taking off.', '2003-09-30 07:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(435205, 39314, 5728, '<td valign="top">Birds in full flight with their wings fully spanned look so awesome. Good capture.</td>', 'Birds in full flight with their wings fully spanned look so awesome. Good capture.', '2003-09-30 07:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435206, 39983, 5728, '<td valign="top">Landing? Nice capture. The red car in the background is a little distracting tho.</td>', 'Landing? Nice capture. The red car in the background is a little distracting tho.', '2003-09-30 07:40:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435207, 40085, 5728, '<td valign="top">It''s difficult to see if it is flying or not. The colors are good, blue and white are always a good combination. The feather does appear slightly on the blurry side however.</td>', 'It''s difficult to see if it is flying or not. The colors are good, blue and white are always a good combination. The feather does appear slightly on the blurry side however.', '2003-09-30 07:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(435222, 39603, 5728, '<td valign="top">Good capture, you really got in close there, or were able to zoom in close. The composition is good, not too tightly cropped and you''ve left ample room in front of the gull. However the gull is a little on the blurry side, maybe from camera shake at the long zoom range perhaps.</td>', 'Good capture, you really got in close there, or were able to zoom in close. The composition is good, not too tightly cropped and you''ve left ample room in front of the gull. However the gull is a little on the blurry side, maybe from camera shake at the long zoom range perhaps.', '2003-09-30 09:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(435229, 39602, 11800, '<td valign="top">Nice job on getting the motion. Funny title. I know there is a lot of detatil in there but the colors(?) hide them.</td>', 'Nice job on getting the motion. Funny title. I know there is a lot of detatil in there but the colors(?) hide them.', '2003-09-30 09:28:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(435232, 39873, 11800, '<td valign="top">Technically good. Sharp. On theme also. Compared to the other entries, it shows a lack of action and/or lack of excitement.  If this was not in such a well captured challenge, I would have given it a higher score. 6</td>', 'Technically good. Sharp. On theme also. Compared to the other entries, it shows a lack of action and/or lack of excitement.  If this was not in such a well captured challenge, I would have given it a higher score. 6', '2003-09-30 09:36:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(435234, 39985, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wheeeee! Bright.  The shadow on her legs are the only technical nit pick.</td>', 'Wheeeee! Bright.  The shadow on her legs are the only technical nit pick.', '2003-09-30 09:40:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(435236, 40092, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice capture of the end of the day and the birds coming in to land</td>', 'nice capture of the end of the day and the birds coming in to land', '2003-09-30 09:46:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(435237, 39884, 12492, '<td valign="top">I really like the content and the coloring and the photo discribes flight to me.</td>', 'I really like the content and the coloring and the photo discribes flight to me.', '2003-09-30 09:47:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(435238, 39802, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice feel to this - the boy''s dark clothes, the textures of the field, and the angle up from his arm</td>', 'nice feel to this - the boy''s dark clothes, the textures of the field, and the angle up from his arm', '2003-09-30 09:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(435239, 39666, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice ruby-throated the feather texture on the breast is very nice</td>', 'nice ruby-throated the feather texture on the breast is very nice', '2003-09-30 09:49:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(435243, 39471, 12492, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  VERY NICE!</td>', 'Interesting shot.  VERY NICE!', '2003-09-30 09:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(435244, 39580, 11800, '<td valign="top">The blue is the right color for this.  Like how the bird(?) is upright like an angel.  The darker blue on the right side gives the image a messy feel. Did you use a flash thru a dirty window? Seems to have a few white spots.</td>', 'The blue is the right color for this.  Like how the bird(?) is upright like an angel.  The darker blue on the right side gives the image a messy feel. Did you use a flash thru a dirty window? Seems to have a few white spots.', '2003-09-30 09:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
