(435509, 39884, 8860, '<td valign="top">Focus is a little soft and the composition could be improved by off-centering the bird (to the right) to give more feeling of space, and the imminent arrival of the bird.</td>', 'Focus is a little soft and the composition could be improved by off-centering the bird (to the right) to give more feeling of space, and the imminent arrival of the bird.', '2003-09-30 16:32:57.000000', NULL, 1),
