(435512, 39867, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great viewpoint which really adds to the feeling of ballooning, giving a relationship with the ground. There''s a bit too much intrusive foliage though. <br/> <br/>Lose the dirty border though - it traps your otherwise free-spirited image.</td>', 'Great viewpoint which really adds to the feeling of ballooning, giving a relationship with the ground. There''s a bit too much intrusive foliage though.  Lose the dirty border though - it traps your otherwise free-spirited image.', '2003-09-30 16:38:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(435513, 39968, 8860, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture and a great idea. Background is too busy which spoils the dynamism of this concept.</td>', 'Very nice capture and a great idea. Background is too busy which spoils the dynamism of this concept.', '2003-09-30 16:40:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(435514, 39886, 8860, '<td valign="top">Lovely composition. Very atmospheric lighting and weather.</td>', 'Lovely composition. Very atmospheric lighting and weather.', '2003-09-30 16:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(435516, 39602, 7758, '<td valign="top">really like this shot, it has a definite mood. the slight motion blur adds to that feeling. Compostionally, I would have perhaps taken a shot from down lower so the top of the hay was above the horizon line. I think that would have improved the image quite a bit, currently the hay almst gets lost by being level with the top of the trees. Overall though I like it, the doutone effect works well here and, again, adds to the mood of the shot. Good Luck, Todd. 7</td>', 'really like this shot, it has a definite mood. the slight motion blur adds to that feeling. Compostionally, I would have perhaps taken a shot from down lower so the top of the hay was above the horizon line. I think that would have improved the image quite a bit, currently the hay almst gets lost by being level with the top of the trees. Overall though I like it, the doutone effect works well here and, again, adds to the mood of the shot. Good Luck, Todd. 7', '2003-09-30 16:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(435517, 39988, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not a bumble bee!  [yawn]  Focus is alittle off the subject. Nice capture otherwise.</td>', 'Not a bumble bee!  [yawn]  Focus is alittle off the subject. Nice capture otherwise.', '2003-09-30 16:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(435519, 39941, 8860, '<td valign="top">Well that''s unique!</td>', 'Well that''s unique!', '2003-09-30 17:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435523, 39802, 4411, '<td valign="top">I can find only one ''fault'' with this photo, and that is that I don''t like the dead space behind the ''pilot''. But that''s just me. Awesome shot.</td>', 'I can find only one ''fault'' with this photo, and that is that I don''t like the dead space behind the ''pilot''. But that''s just me. Awesome shot.', '2003-09-30 17:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(435524, 39802, 12388, '<td valign="top">I love it.</td>', 'I love it.', '2003-09-30 17:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(435538, 39988, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed bee shot. Love the way you were able to capture the motion in the bees'' wings. The slight blurring of the bee give dynamic and a sense of flight. The beautiful colors of the flower also help to add to the composition. Focusing is good and the depth of field help to make the bee pop out of the picture.</td>', 'Nicely composed bee shot. Love the way you were able to capture the motion in the bees'' wings. The slight blurring of the bee give dynamic and a sense of flight. The beautiful colors of the flower also help to add to the composition. Focusing is good and the depth of field help to make the bee pop out of the picture.', '2003-09-30 17:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435540, 39972, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice capture and the hint of the other birds give a depth</td>', 'nice capture and the hint of the other birds give a depth', '2003-09-30 17:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435542, 40035, 6624, '<td valign="top">The feet like landing gear are very nice</td>', 'The feet like landing gear are very nice', '2003-09-30 17:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(435583, 39018, 10084, '<td valign="top">The blue in the sky really frames the plane well. It helps to pop it out of the image. Looks like the plane is reflections the light of the sunset/sunrise giving it a warm color. Great shadows help to give it depth. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'The blue in the sky really frames the plane well. It helps to pop it out of the image. Looks like the plane is reflections the light of the sunset/sunrise giving it a warm color. Great shadows help to give it depth. Beautiful shot.', '2003-09-30 18:33:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(435587, 40093, 10084, '<td valign="top">Would like a bigger picture. Details are difficult to see. The lighting off the guys back and white shoe help to bring him out of the shot. The darker background helps too, but the black pants blends in with the background a bit. Maybe if he was wearing all white he would stand out even more.</td>', 'Would like a bigger picture. Details are difficult to see. The lighting off the guys back and white shoe help to bring him out of the shot. The darker background helps too, but the black pants blends in with the background a bit. Maybe if he was wearing all white he would stand out even more.', '2003-09-30 18:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435590, 40062, 10084, '<td valign="top">Vibrant color in the handglider helps it stand out from the background. The fluffy skies also help. The blue in the sky gives an extra touch of interest in the shot.</td>', 'Vibrant color in the handglider helps it stand out from the background. The fluffy skies also help. The blue in the sky gives an extra touch of interest in the shot.', '2003-09-30 18:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(435595, 39867, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field. The foreground with the foliage, the balloon, the mountain, and the sky. Great division of depth. The balloons'' color helps to bring your attention to it and the focus. Only thing I don''t like is the color of your frame. Color is a bit distracting. Seems a bit dark to frame the sky.</td>', 'Good depth of field. The foreground with the foliage, the balloon, the mountain, and the sky. Great division of depth. The balloons'' color helps to bring your attention to it and the focus. Only thing I don''t like is the color of your frame. Color is a bit distracting. Seems a bit dark to frame the sky.', '2003-09-30 18:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(435597, 39869, 7758, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, I like the contrast between the slightly overexposed back of the gull and the high contrast part of the image as opposed to the *fairly* dull low contrast water.... it works well, I think that the duotone effect makes the image feel perhaps hotter (temperate-wise) than perhaps it would have looked it colour. I have changed my mind, I actually gave this a 6 to start with but after looking at it more closely I think it deserves an 8 as much for the post processing as for the image itself. Good Luck, Todd. 8</td>', 'interesting shot, I like the contrast between the slightly overexposed back of the gull and the high contrast part of the image as opposed to the *fairly* dull low contrast water.... it works well, I think that the duotone effect makes the image feel perhaps hotter (temperate-wise) than perhaps it would have looked it colour. I have changed my mind, I actually gave this a 6 to start with but after looking at it more closely I think it deserves an 8 as much for the post processing as for the image itself. Good Luck, Todd. 8', '2003-09-30 18:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(435598, 39521, 7647, '<td valign="top">This is great :) Made me smile</td>', 'This is great :) Made me smile', '2003-09-30 18:45:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(435599, 39893, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice irridescence and nice concept</td>', 'nice irridescence and nice concept', '2003-09-30 18:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(435600, 40055, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice balloon and basket - hope they were coming down...</td>', 'nice balloon and basket - hope they were coming down...', '2003-09-30 18:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(435601, 39959, 7758, '<td valign="top">nice capture, it''s just a little dull in my opinion. I would like to see this perhaps lighter and more contrasty. I''m also not sure that being purely black and white really helps this image any. Shame you didn''t get his other wing in too.<br/>Good Luck, Todd. 6</td>', 'nice capture, it''s just a little dull in my opinion. I would like to see this perhaps lighter and more contrasty. I''m also not sure that being purely black and white really helps this image any. Shame you didn''t get his other wing in too.Good Luck, Todd. 6', '2003-09-30 18:48:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(435602, 39849, 6624, '<td valign="top">very nice, like the propellers...flew from Zurich to Salzburg in one of these through the mountains</td>', 'very nice, like the propellers...flew from Zurich to Salzburg in one of these through the mountains', '2003-09-30 18:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(435605, 40091, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice response and good use of another meaning of the word</td>', 'nice response and good use of another meaning of the word', '2003-09-30 18:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(435606, 40084, 7758, '<td valign="top">The capture of the seagull is good but the shot is let down by a number of things. It seems to be quite grainy and not overly sharp, it looks like perhaps it is a small part of the original picture. IT is a bit too dark also, the body and head of the gull are almost hidden in the shadows. Finally, the corner of the building or whatever it is in the bottom right corner is also distracting. If you would like to discuss this shot in more detail after the challenge let me know.<br/>I have given you a 5 because I like the composition of the pic (withthe exceptrion of the roof in the corner) and I think that the shot shows potential. <br/>Good Luck, Todd. 5</td>', 'The capture of the seagull is good but the shot is let down by a number of things. It seems to be quite grainy and not overly sharp, it looks like perhaps it is a small part of the original picture. IT is a bit too dark also, the body and head of the gull are almost hidden in the shadows. Finally, the corner of the building or whatever it is in the bottom right corner is also distracting. If you would like to discuss this shot in more detail after the challenge let me know.I have given you a 5 because I like the composition of the pic (withthe exceptrion of the roof in the corner) and I think that the shot shows potential. Good Luck, Todd. 5', '2003-09-30 18:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(435607, 40057, 7758, '<td valign="top">well balanced image, perfect symmetry.  Good Luck, Todd. 7</td>', 'well balanced image, perfect symmetry.  Good Luck, Todd. 7', '2003-09-30 18:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435608, 40019, 4414, '<td valign="top">Amusing.  The plane looks like a toy.  Unfortunately the sky and lighting are rather flat and boring</td>', 'Amusing.  The plane looks like a toy.  Unfortunately the sky and lighting are rather flat and boring', '2003-09-30 18:58:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(435610, 39802, 4414, '<td valign="top">Very evocative.  I just love this picture and the sepia treatment is just right.</td>', 'Very evocative.  I just love this picture and the sepia treatment is just right.', '2003-09-30 19:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(435613, 40096, 7758, '<td valign="top">Nice capture though perhaps a little oversharpened. As with a number of shots in this challenge, I think it is always preferable to see the bird''s face if possible. I know it''s to always easy to capture a bird flying towards you but I think this one of the things that could be improved. The clumps of seaweed detract as well. I have given you a five because, despite some compostional problems, I think that you are not far off a good shot here. If you would like to discuss this shot further after the challenge let me know.<br/>Good Luck, Todd. 5</td>', 'Nice capture though perhaps a little oversharpened. As with a number of shots in this challenge, I think it is always preferable to see the bird''s face if possible. I know it''s to always easy to capture a bird flying towards you but I think this one of the things that could be improved. The clumps of seaweed detract as well. I have given you a five because, despite some compostional problems, I think that you are not far off a good shot here. If you would like to discuss this shot further after the challenge let me know.Good Luck, Todd. 5', '2003-09-30 19:03:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435615, 40096, 4414, '<td valign="top">I like the colours. Oversharpened I think.</td>', 'I like the colours. Oversharpened I think.', '2003-09-30 19:04:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(435616, 40041, 10084, '<td valign="top">I could almost hear the roaring of the engine. Great closeup maybe too close. Beautiful lighting from the sunset/sunrise. Colors are very vibrant. Love the great contrast of the dark, bold shadows. Helps gives great depth to the plane. The skys'' various blue hues also help to make the plane pop out of the shot.</td>', 'I could almost hear the roaring of the engine. Great closeup maybe too close. Beautiful lighting from the sunset/sunrise. Colors are very vibrant. Love the great contrast of the dark, bold shadows. Helps gives great depth to the plane. The skys'' various blue hues also help to make the plane pop out of the shot.', '2003-09-30 19:04:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435618, 39851, 4414, '<td valign="top">Photographically this does nothing for me.</td>', 'Photographically this does nothing for me.', '2003-09-30 19:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(435619, 39986, 10084, '<td valign="top">Nice clear sharp lines in the subject. Focusing is really good. You can read the call sign of the glider and the see the pilot clearly. The angle that you capture helps to give a sense of being in the air. The blue of the sky makes the glider pop out of the picture. The frame takes away and makes the glider seem confining. A panaorama crop would be incredible.</td>', 'Nice clear sharp lines in the subject. Focusing is really good. You can read the call sign of the glider and the see the pilot clearly. The angle that you capture helps to give a sense of being in the air. The blue of the sky makes the glider pop out of the picture. The frame takes away and makes the glider seem confining. A panaorama crop would be incredible.', '2003-09-30 19:08:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435620, 39985, 4414, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, nice dress, nice colours, but I find it annoying that I cannot see the girl''s face properly.  Also I''m not enirely sure about the cropping</td>', 'Nice idea, nice dress, nice colours, but I find it annoying that I cannot see the girl''s face properly.  Also I''m not enirely sure about the cropping', '2003-09-30 19:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(435625, 39983, 7758, '<td valign="top">The placement of the gull in this shot is quite good. Ther are some things that let you down badly though. The image is really quite soft and ther is alot of halo-ing around the wings and the objects in the shot. This may be due to the camera you are using, I''m not sure, it''s hard to tell.<br/>The grass and shoreline in the background cut through your image and, as a result, detract from the main subject, perhaps with a higher elevation this could have been avoided. The red car in the background (bad timing for that car to there huh?) also detracts from the image. Finally, the bird partly hidden by the main subject also detracts from the main subject. It sort of looks like a wierd third wing. I know this all sounds quite critical, but I think that by being aware of these things surrounding your main subject you will improve your photography in no time. I have given you a 4 for this image but I think that you have the potential of a good image here. Hopefully you find these comments helpful, if you would like to discuss the shot further afer the challenge is over let me know.<br/>Good Lick, Todd. 4</td>', 'The placement of the gull in this shot is quite good. Ther are some things that let you down badly though. The image is really quite soft and ther is alot of halo-ing around the wings and the objects in the shot. This may be due to the camera you are using, I''m not sure, it''s hard to tell.The grass and shoreline in the background cut through your image and, as a result, detract from the main subject, perhaps with a higher elevation this could have been avoided. The red car in the background (bad timing for that car to there huh?) also detracts from the image. Finally, the bird partly hidden by the main subject also detracts from the main subject. It sort of looks like a wierd third wing. I know this all sounds quite critical, but I think that by being aware of these things surrounding your main subject you will improve your photography in no time. I have given you a 4 for this image but I think that you have the potential of a good image here. Hopefully you find these comments helpful, if you would like to discuss the shot further afer the challenge is over let me know.Good Lick, Todd. 4', '2003-09-30 19:12:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(435626, 39964, 4414, '<td valign="top">I love the shape of the tie</td>', 'I love the shape of the tie', '2003-09-30 19:13:25.000000', NULL, 1),
