(435716, 39984, 554, '<td valign="top">Perfect</td>', 'Perfect', '2003-09-30 20:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(435722, 39511, 11693, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, but the pilot is too dark for my taste.  Good shot.</td>', 'I like this shot, but the pilot is too dark for my taste.  Good shot.', '2003-09-30 20:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435725, 40083, 11693, '<td valign="top">I have taken a million seagull shot in my time and never got one this good.  The translucent wings and the blue sky are great.  Good Shot!</td>', 'I have taken a million seagull shot in my time and never got one this good.  The translucent wings and the blue sky are great.  Good Shot!', '2003-09-30 20:21:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(435731, 39512, 1005, '<td valign="top">May I assume the high degree of grain was purposeful?  Focus seems indeterminate (can''t find the focused area).  Framing is good (positioning the subject in the frame).  I''d like to see more detail with the subject.  5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'May I assume the high degree of grain was purposeful?  Focus seems indeterminate (can''t find the focused area).  Framing is good (positioning the subject in the frame).  I''d like to see more detail with the subject.  5 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:26:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(435734, 39964, 554, '<td valign="top">I like your take on this topic....don''t really fit to me but refreshing after so many less interesting shots.  Did the color just not look right?  I think I would have liked a bright color better.   My vote won''t count but it is a 9 to me...good job.</td>', 'I like your take on this topic....don''t really fit to me but refreshing after so many less interesting shots.  Did the color just not look right?  I think I would have liked a bright color better.   My vote won''t count but it is a 9 to me...good job.', '2003-09-30 20:28:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(435736, 40085, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very powerful contrast and nice framing.  With the "washed out" background, it''s really difficult to say "this is off the ground" or not.  In a different type of contrast, hard vs. soft...the background is very hard, the subject is soft, that''s nice, but the extreme processing gives the soft feather a "hard" feel.  (Does that make sense?)<br/>6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very powerful contrast and nice framing.  With the "washed out" background, it''s really difficult to say "this is off the ground" or not.  In a different type of contrast, hard vs. soft...the background is very hard, the subject is soft, that''s nice, but the extreme processing gives the soft feather a "hard" feel.  (Does that make sense?)6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(435739, 39883, 1005, '<td valign="top">No flight?  I''ve seen spider babies "fly" a streamer of web, but this is an adult (too heavy for that kind of flight).  I see a lot of web.....It''s a pretty picture with a reasonable amount of detail.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'No flight?  I''ve seen spider babies "fly" a streamer of web, but this is an adult (too heavy for that kind of flight).  I see a lot of web.....It''s a pretty picture with a reasonable amount of detail.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:32:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(435742, 39995, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, pretty sky.  I see your airplane clearly enough and get the sense of flight, but interest level (wow factor) is low.  Nice silhouette, leaving little detail of the subject.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice colors, pretty sky.  I see your airplane clearly enough and get the sense of flight, but interest level (wow factor) is low.  Nice silhouette, leaving little detail of the subject.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(435745, 39640, 1005, '<td valign="top">Difficult to critique this one.  Artistically, this has some interest, but on a detail level... (well, there''s very little detail of the birds).  The clouds seem a bit over-exposed.  I like showing the horizon and the sky is a nice pretty blue, but those are the "good" points.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Difficult to critique this one.  Artistically, this has some interest, but on a detail level... (well, there''s very little detail of the birds).  The clouds seem a bit over-exposed.  I like showing the horizon and the sky is a nice pretty blue, but those are the "good" points.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435748, 39511, 1005, '<td valign="top">Great concept and a very sharp photo.  You''ve got a terrible confict going, the leading edge of the wing is soooo white (re: over-exposed), while the person is too dark to see any detail of.  The wing going out of the frame is not good.   Maybe try a different attack angle (maybe from in front and below) and definately try different white balance.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Great concept and a very sharp photo.  You''ve got a terrible confict going, the leading edge of the wing is soooo white (re: over-exposed), while the person is too dark to see any detail of.  The wing going out of the frame is not good.   Maybe try a different attack angle (maybe from in front and below) and definately try different white balance.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:46:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(435749, 40039, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but the photo is a bit grainy (varing color in the blue sky) and the ball is not very sharp.  Nice idea, but maybe a lot more tries.....5 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice color, but the photo is a bit grainy (varing color in the blue sky) and the ball is not very sharp.  Nice idea, but maybe a lot more tries.....5 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:47:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(435750, 40091, 1005, '<td valign="top">Alternate definations....in need of a subject (maybe?).  Nice view of San Fran.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Alternate definations....in need of a subject (maybe?).  Nice view of San Fran.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(435754, 39954, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp picture, but the cloud colors seem odd.  I''m seeing rosy hues, but it doesn''t look like sunset timing.  The tail of the plane gets lost in the clouds.  6 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp picture, but the cloud colors seem odd.  I''m seeing rosy hues, but it doesn''t look like sunset timing.  The tail of the plane gets lost in the clouds.  6 Rob the Swash', '2003-09-30 20:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(435771, 39959, 3981, '<td valign="top">Your focus on this shot is near perfect, but I am not sure I agree with the black and white.  The gray skies make the scene look drab in my opinion.  Of course I realize it could have just been a gray day and not necessarily intended for black and white.  7 for artistry.</td>', 'Your focus on this shot is near perfect, but I am not sure I agree with the black and white.  The gray skies make the scene look drab in my opinion.  Of course I realize it could have just been a gray day and not necessarily intended for black and white.  7 for artistry.', '2003-09-30 21:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435772, 39886, 3981, '<td valign="top">Love the light on this bird. Clarity and use of negative space are also very good.  8.</td>', 'Love the light on this bird. Clarity and use of negative space are also very good.  8.', '2003-09-30 21:38:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435773, 40042, 3981, '<td valign="top">Very creative approach to the challenge. Clarity and composition are also exceptionally good.  8.</td>', 'Very creative approach to the challenge. Clarity and composition are also exceptionally good.  8.', '2003-09-30 21:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(435774, 40069, 3981, '<td valign="top">This could have been an outstanding photo if the focus were better and the colors not washed out. You certainly were at the right place at the right time to catch this butterfly in motion!</td>', 'This could have been an outstanding photo if the focus were better and the colors not washed out. You certainly were at the right place at the right time to catch this butterfly in motion!', '2003-09-30 21:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(435777, 40085, 3981, '<td valign="top">I like your idea very much, and I even like the blue on white.  My only constructive criticism is that the feather is out of focus.</td>', 'I like your idea very much, and I even like the blue on white.  My only constructive criticism is that the feather is out of focus.', '2003-09-30 21:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(435865, 39957, 11800, '<td valign="top">It looks unreal.  Not that it isn''t a beautiful photo. I''d think with him being in the water, he''d have some reflection showing, all I can see is the sky. 7 and I resisted hitting the dq because it is beautiful.</td>', 'It looks unreal.  Not that it isn''t a beautiful photo. I''d think with him being in the water, he''d have some reflection showing, all I can see is the sky. 7 and I resisted hitting the dq because it is beautiful.', '2003-09-30 23:32:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(435867, 40041, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wow. Bright colors.  Maybe it''s my perversness, but I''d like to see it upright.  I really think it would have even more impact.  Perhaps too obvious, but what the hey.</td>', 'Wow. Bright colors.  Maybe it''s my perversness, but I''d like to see it upright.  I really think it would have even more impact.  Perhaps too obvious, but what the hey.', '2003-09-30 23:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(435871, 39563, 11800, '<td valign="top">I think the cropping works well for this one. Usually you''d want more space in front of the subject, but this emphasizes the action you mention in the title, as if he is rushing forward to catch a fish. 8</td>', 'I think the cropping works well for this one. Usually you''d want more space in front of the subject, but this emphasizes the action you mention in the title, as if he is rushing forward to catch a fish. 8', '2003-09-30 23:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(435881, 39603, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good try. At least you did go out and shoot.  Could have been a little more focused.</td>', 'Good try. At least you did go out and shoot.  Could have been a little more focused.', '2003-09-30 23:53:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(435885, 39521, 4494, '<td valign="top">Hahaha, I have almost the same shot of my dog (same breed I think) when he was a puppy at the beach!  Great one!   Not only that, this IS an excellent picture... the lighting is perfect, and focus (action shot) is even better.  8.</td>', 'Hahaha, I have almost the same shot of my dog (same breed I think) when he was a puppy at the beach!  Great one!   Not only that, this IS an excellent picture... the lighting is perfect, and focus (action shot) is even better.  8.', '2003-10-01 00:03:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(435886, 39968, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool shot.  just as a thought, I think that i''d like to see some more negative space on the right.</td>', 'cool shot.  just as a thought, I think that i''d like to see some more negative space on the right.', '2003-10-01 00:04:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(435889, 39968, 11800, '<td valign="top">The execution is good. Only the corner of the building distracts from  the concept. I even like the trees. 9<br/>This might be more outstanding with a bluer sky.  I know, you have no control of the sky, but you could shoot it over on a nicer day. It might be more mystical if there are no leaves on the trees.  And throw in some fog if you can.  I''m only saying all this because it is such a wonderful idea and deserves more exploration.</td>', 'The execution is good. Only the corner of the building distracts from  the concept. I even like the trees. 9This might be more outstanding with a bluer sky.  I know, you have no control of the sky, but you could shoot it over on a nicer day. It might be more mystical if there are no leaves on the trees.  And throw in some fog if you can.  I''m only saying all this because it is such a wonderful idea and deserves more exploration.', '2003-10-01 00:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(435890, 39794, 11073, '<td valign="top">good contrasting colors.  i think that i would like to see some more negative space on the left to "lead" the object, a little too centered IMO.  Also it looks a little on the grainy side, did you resize or use digital zoom?</td>', 'good contrasting colors.  i think that i would like to see some more negative space on the left to "lead" the object, a little too centered IMO.  Also it looks a little on the grainy side, did you resize or use digital zoom?', '2003-10-01 00:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(435891, 39802, 4494, '<td valign="top">Great subject and surroundings.  The B&amp;W is nice, but there is little much green in it in my opinion.   I''d have tweaked it to make the tone a little "browner".</td>', 'Great subject and surroundings.  The B&W is nice, but there is little much green in it in my opinion.   I''d have tweaked it to make the tone a little "browner".', '2003-10-01 00:09:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(435893, 40078, 4494, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t fit the topic.  Maybe if the horse was jumping over a "gate" at a horse jumping contest, but not when they''re just running.</td>', 'Doesn''t fit the topic.  Maybe if the horse was jumping over a "gate" at a horse jumping contest, but not when they''re just running.', '2003-10-01 00:10:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(435894, 39521, 11073, '<td valign="top">nice timing and good framing of the subject.  cool shot.</td>', 'nice timing and good framing of the subject.  cool shot.', '2003-10-01 00:11:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(435895, 40032, 11800, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more details in the wings.  Good framing of the subject though.</td>', 'Would like to see more details in the wings.  Good framing of the subject though.', '2003-10-01 00:11:58.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(435896, 40092, 4494, '<td valign="top">What is that big white hole from on the right?  That''s really strange.</td>', 'What is that big white hole from on the right?  That''s really strange.', '2003-10-01 00:13:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435897, 40067, 11073, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the category.</td>', 'good interpretation of the category.', '2003-10-01 00:13:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(435898, 39996, 4494, '<td valign="top">You can''t tell what it is, because it''s so blurry.</td>', 'You can''t tell what it is, because it''s so blurry.', '2003-10-01 00:13:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(435899, 39898, 11073, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the category.</td>', 'good interpretation of the category.', '2003-10-01 00:14:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(435900, 40093, 11073, '<td valign="top">good idea...wish it was bigger...</td>', 'good idea...wish it was bigger...', '2003-10-01 00:14:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(435901, 39959, 11800, '<td valign="top">Sharpest gull so far.</td>', 'Sharpest gull so far.', '2003-10-01 00:17:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(435902, 39133, 4494, '<td valign="top">OMG, this is spectacular!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  I''ve never seen a hummingbird shot like this, it''s amazing.  The background is awesome as well.  9.   If the bird was turned toward the camera slightly so you could see the wings a little more it would be a SOLID 10.  Good job!<br/></td>', 'OMG, this is spectacular!!!!!!!!!!!!!!  I''ve never seen a hummingbird shot like this, it''s amazing.  The background is awesome as well.  9.   If the bird was turned toward the camera slightly so you could see the wings a little more it would be a SOLID 10.  Good job!', '2003-10-01 00:17:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(435903, 39996, 11800, '<td valign="top">Too bad you didn''t get one a little sharper.  Good idea.</td>', 'Too bad you didn''t get one a little sharper.  Good idea.', '2003-10-01 00:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(435904, 40081, 4494, '<td valign="top">So far the best of the seagull pics... great job, I love the colors.  Your eye just zeros in on the bird because of the background and great contrast with the bird.  You can tell it''s a great pic without much post processing because the detail is still there.  8.</td>', 'So far the best of the seagull pics... great job, I love the colors.  Your eye just zeros in on the bird because of the background and great contrast with the bird.  You can tell it''s a great pic without much post processing because the detail is still there.  8.', '2003-10-01 00:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(435906, 39869, 11800, '<td valign="top">The wings are all blob-y.  Think the contrast is pumped just a bit too much.</td>', 'The wings are all blob-y.  Think the contrast is pumped just a bit too much.', '2003-10-01 00:21:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(435907, 39044, 811, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors in this, and I like how the wing seems isolated from the rest of the plane.  I see some "jaggies" BUT it looks like the same thing my camera does when I have diagonal lines, adn I haven''t found an effective fix yet.  10</td>', 'I really like the colors in this, and I like how the wing seems isolated from the rest of the plane.  I see some "jaggies" BUT it looks like the same thing my camera does when I have diagonal lines, adn I haven''t found an effective fix yet.  10', '2003-10-01 00:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(435908, 39893, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool...  I would have cropped about 1 inch off of the left side, about 1/4 off the top, and maybe 1/2 inch off the bottom.  Great shot!!</td>', 'Very cool...  I would have cropped about 1 inch off of the left side, about 1/4 off the top, and maybe 1/2 inch off the bottom.  Great shot!!', '2003-10-01 00:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(435909, 40057, 4494, '<td valign="top">Haaahahaa, great title.  Good pic as well.</td>', 'Haaahahaa, great title.  Good pic as well.', '2003-10-01 00:23:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(435911, 39133, 11800, '<td valign="top">Wow. He''s sharp. The background confuses me. How did you do it?</td>', 'Wow. He''s sharp. The background confuses me. How did you do it?', '2003-10-01 00:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(435912, 39511, 4494, '<td valign="top">The exposure seems off in this shot.  Not sure how I''d fix it however.  Unique subject however and nice surroundings.</td>', 'The exposure seems off in this shot.  Not sure how I''d fix it however.  Unique subject however and nice surroundings.', '2003-10-01 00:25:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(435913, 39798, 4494, '<td valign="top">One of the few shots were I can''t tell what it is but I like it. :)  Hope your description explains it and how you did it.</td>', 'One of the few shots were I can''t tell what it is but I like it. :)  Hope your description explains it and how you did it.', '2003-10-01 00:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(435914, 39883, 11800, '<td valign="top">He looks like humpty dumpty!  Otherwise there is a lot of noise and it is soft.</td>', 'He looks like humpty dumpty!  Otherwise there is a lot of noise and it is soft.', '2003-10-01 00:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(435915, 39905, 11073, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the category...and a very interesting and good pic. nice work.</td>', 'good interpretation of the category...and a very interesting and good pic. nice work.', '2003-10-01 00:27:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(435918, 40037, 11073, '<td valign="top">good pic that could be stronger with a tighter zoom on the main subject.</td>', 'good pic that could be stronger with a tighter zoom on the main subject.', '2003-10-01 00:28:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(435919, 39959, 4494, '<td valign="top">Must have been a problem deciding how to crop this.  I really like the white to black in this.</td>', 'Must have been a problem deciding how to crop this.  I really like the white to black in this.', '2003-10-01 00:28:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(435920, 39932, 11800, '<td valign="top">He just looks weird down on the ground.  Is he stuffed?</td>', 'He just looks weird down on the ground.  Is he stuffed?', '2003-10-01 00:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(435921, 39603, 11073, '<td valign="top">good picture that could be stronger with a little better focus, (or less motion blur)</td>', 'good picture that could be stronger with a little better focus, (or less motion blur)', '2003-10-01 00:29:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(435923, 40080, 11800, '<td valign="top">CUte.  Sometimes the best shots are right in our own backyard. The only thing that''s distracting is the lines(?) in the upper right. Maybe selectivly soften that area after to challenge.</td>', 'CUte.  Sometimes the best shots are right in our own backyard. The only thing that''s distracting is the lines(?) in the upper right. Maybe selectivly soften that area after to challenge.', '2003-10-01 00:32:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(435924, 39991, 4494, '<td valign="top">Really grainy...  try using NeatImage on this one.  Also I would have cropped out the right side to get rid of the building edge.  It''s kind of distracting.  I like the pure black building.</td>', 'Really grainy...  try using NeatImage on this one.  Also I would have cropped out the right side to get rid of the building edge.  It''s kind of distracting.  I like the pure black building.', '2003-10-01 00:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(435925, 40033, 11073, '<td valign="top">good pic, maybe a little too much over exposed imo</td>', 'good pic, maybe a little too much over exposed imo', '2003-10-01 00:34:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(435926, 40035, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cool effect I really like it but, you should have cropped to remove 2 1/2 inches off the right making it portrait.  You might lose some detail but the appearance would be MUCH better.</td>', 'Cool effect I really like it but, you should have cropped to remove 2 1/2 inches off the right making it portrait.  You might lose some detail but the appearance would be MUCH better.', '2003-10-01 00:37:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(435928, 39991, 11073, '<td valign="top">i like the mood set forth from the lighting</td>', 'i like the mood set forth from the lighting', '2003-10-01 00:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(435929, 39580, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very, very cool.  I love this!!!  Did you invert it and then tone it blue?  I think that''s basically it.  This is one of the rare times when that WORKS and makes a great artistic image.  Excellent!!  9.</td>', 'Very, very cool.  I love this!!!  Did you invert it and then tone it blue?  I think that''s basically it.  This is one of the rare times when that WORKS and makes a great artistic image.  Excellent!!  9.', '2003-10-01 00:42:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(435932, 39886, 4494, '<td valign="top">2nd best seagull picture... I really like the dark body with the white outline around the bird.  Background is also good.</td>', '2nd best seagull picture... I really like the dark body with the white outline around the bird.  Background is also good.', '2003-10-01 00:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(435935, 39542, 4494, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.  The sky is a little pixelated.  Try using NeatImage on this.  The exposure looks really good.</td>', 'Nice shot.  The sky is a little pixelated.  Try using NeatImage on this.  The exposure looks really good.', '2003-10-01 00:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(435942, 40080, 4494, '<td valign="top">Yeah baby, bingo... This shot is great.  I love the lighting, and love the many subjects in this.  The birds at the bottom looking up, the birds flying in, and the birds on the feeder all together almost tell a story here.  9.</td>', 'Yeah baby, bingo... This shot is great.  I love the lighting, and love the many subjects in this.  The birds at the bottom looking up, the birds flying in, and the birds on the feeder all together almost tell a story here.  9.', '2003-10-01 00:52:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(435944, 39972, 4494, '<td valign="top">Mystical looking, great job.  Maybe crop a little off of the top and the right.</td>', 'Mystical looking, great job.  Maybe crop a little off of the top and the right.', '2003-10-01 00:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435950, 39990, 4494, '<td valign="top">You may have saturated the colors too much (see the magenta lines?).  Good shot anyway.  I like the border also.</td>', 'You may have saturated the colors too much (see the magenta lines?).  Good shot anyway.  I like the border also.', '2003-10-01 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(435956, 39563, 4494, '<td valign="top">Cropping isn''t right... The extreme motion of the bird''s direction makes it feel like the cropping should be opposite (with the bird in the upper right corner).</td>', 'Cropping isn''t right... The extreme motion of the bird''s direction makes it feel like the cropping should be opposite (with the bird in the upper right corner).', '2003-10-01 00:56:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(435960, 40093, 4494, '<td valign="top">LOL looks like he''s 5 feet off the ground!</td>', 'LOL looks like he''s 5 feet off the ground!', '2003-10-01 00:57:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(435962, 39901, 4494, '<td valign="top">Another good bubble shot.  Nothing I can think of to improve this.</td>', 'Another good bubble shot.  Nothing I can think of to improve this.', '2003-10-01 00:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(435963, 39936, 4494, '<td valign="top">Best "bug" picture.</td>', 'Best "bug" picture.', '2003-10-01 00:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(435982, 40094, 811, '<td valign="top">I am assuming you are saying that pollen flies (an my allergies would agree), but I don''t get that from this picture.  Perhaps if it were closer or more in focus or something.</td>', 'I am assuming you are saying that pollen flies (an my allergies would agree), but I don''t get that from this picture.  Perhaps if it were closer or more in focus or something.', '2003-10-01 01:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(435984, 39883, 811, '<td valign="top">I like the blues, but I think more of a sense of "flight" would have been felt if you could have adjusted the contrast or something so that web wasn''t showing.</td>', 'I like the blues, but I think more of a sense of "flight" would have been felt if you could have adjusted the contrast or something so that web wasn''t showing.', '2003-10-01 01:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(435989, 40091, 811, '<td valign="top">The yellowish tone gives this an ominous feeling, and I like the skyline you have shown.  While I can appreciate the "stretch" of the challenge, even with the title, I don''t get a feeling of flight from just the picture.</td>', 'The yellowish tone gives this an ominous feeling, and I like the skyline you have shown.  While I can appreciate the "stretch" of the challenge, even with the title, I don''t get a feeling of flight from just the picture.', '2003-10-01 01:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(435996, 40050, 4494, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Love it that the laces are perfectly level, that was pretty lucky.  Nice capture.   [revised addition]... I''m making a bet that you are "alansfreed" after seeing your great Steelers sports shots in the forum. :)  Am I right?</td>', 'Very cool.  Love it that the laces are perfectly level, that was pretty lucky.  Nice capture.   [revised addition]... I''m making a bet that you are "alansfreed" after seeing your great Steelers sports shots in the forum. :)  Am I right?', '2003-10-01 01:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(436008, 39802, 10260, '<td valign="top">This is wonderful. Composition strong, removing color makes this picture even more attractive to me.  10</td>', 'This is wonderful. Composition strong, removing color makes this picture even more attractive to me.  10', '2003-10-01 01:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(436014, 39812, 10260, '<td valign="top">Only my opinion, but I''d like to have seen this a little darker.  Great shot though.<br/></td>', 'Only my opinion, but I''d like to have seen this a little darker.  Great shot though.', '2003-10-01 01:45:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(436018, 40043, 10260, '<td valign="top">Nice bold color and lots of sky for this plane shot.  Photo is nice and clear. Great job, in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice bold color and lots of sky for this plane shot.  Photo is nice and clear. Great job, in my opinion.', '2003-10-01 01:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(436020, 39649, 10260, '<td valign="top">In my opinion.....and it''s just that.....the border gives this a closed in feel.  While the plane and sky should have a sense of expanse.  Still a great shot.</td>', 'In my opinion.....and it''s just that.....the border gives this a closed in feel.  While the plane and sky should have a sense of expanse.  Still a great shot.', '2003-10-01 01:50:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(436022, 40059, 10260, '<td valign="top">A perfect photo! I''ll have to take your word for it about this being a "flying header" but the clarity of color and expression is absolutely wonderful. 10</td>', 'A perfect photo! I''ll have to take your word for it about this being a "flying header" but the clarity of color and expression is absolutely wonderful. 10', '2003-10-01 01:53:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(436026, 39949, 10260, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot.  The golden of the sun shining on the wings makes this really attractive also.  I usually don''t like a border on sky shots,  but it works here.</td>', 'This is a great shot.  The golden of the sun shining on the wings makes this really attractive also.  I usually don''t like a border on sky shots,  but it works here.', '2003-10-01 01:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(436028, 39957, 10260, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.  This is almost too perfect. :)</td>', 'Beautiful.  This is almost too perfect. :)', '2003-10-01 01:57:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(436029, 40067, 10260, '<td valign="top">Cleverly creative. :)</td>', 'Cleverly creative. :)', '2003-10-01 01:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(436032, 40071, 10260, '<td valign="top">This might have been better darkened and sharpened some.  Certainly interesting with all those birds.</td>', 'This might have been better darkened and sharpened some.  Certainly interesting with all those birds.', '2003-10-01 01:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(436037, 39985, 10260, '<td valign="top">I love this.  You''ve presented the colors boldly and captured your subject (cute as can be, I might add) in mid"flight". 10</td>', 'I love this.  You''ve presented the colors boldly and captured your subject (cute as can be, I might add) in mid"flight". 10', '2003-10-01 02:01:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(436043, 39867, 10260, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, but I''m finding the blurred foliage too distracting.  It seems too heavy for the sky and balloon.  I wonder if you could have cropped some more.</td>', 'A nice shot, but I''m finding the blurred foliage too distracting.  It seems too heavy for the sky and balloon.  I wonder if you could have cropped some more.', '2003-10-01 02:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(436052, 40080, 10260, '<td valign="top">A great shot. This has such a country, peaceful feel to it.  Clarity is good, subjects are focused and happy. :)   You must be pleased with this photo.</td>', 'A great shot. This has such a country, peaceful feel to it.  Clarity is good, subjects are focused and happy. :)   You must be pleased with this photo.', '2003-10-01 02:09:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(436196, 39886, 9758, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture. 10</td>', 'Beautiful capture. 10', '2003-10-01 05:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(436234, 39849, 9300, '<td valign="top">A very cool angle, but the airplane is a little bit out of focus<br/></td>', 'A very cool angle, but the airplane is a little bit out of focus', '2003-10-01 07:24:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(436272, 40045, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice sentiment. It''s a little dark - suggest playing with levels - and the bright bits in top left are a distraction. Shame the bird''s facing away too. But it is a bird in flight and it''s well framed and in focus.</td>', 'Nice sentiment. It''s a little dark - suggest playing with levels - and the bright bits in top left are a distraction. Shame the bird''s facing away too. But it is a bird in flight and it''s well framed and in focus.', '2003-10-01 08:25:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(436277, 40084, 3342, '<td valign="top">There is a lot of noice in the sky and the focus is soft. I like the position of the bird but would like to see it placed a little more to the left.</td>', 'There is a lot of noice in the sky and the focus is soft. I like the position of the bird but would like to see it placed a little more to the left.', '2003-10-01 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(436399, 39802, 11800, '<td valign="top">You got a 10. Feeling magical with this one. I like the suggestion of motion, the color treatment and the composition.  <br/></td>', 'You got a 10. Feeling magical with this one. I like the suggestion of motion, the color treatment and the composition.  ', '2003-10-01 09:34:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(436405, 40078, 11800, '<td valign="top">Beautiful capture of a moment. 9</td>', 'Beautiful capture of a moment. 9', '2003-10-01 09:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(436421, 40091, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good cityscape.  Perhaps the feeling would have been enhanced if shot thru a window?  It''s a little dark which is ok  because of the title, but I would still lighten it a bit.</td>', 'Good cityscape.  Perhaps the feeling would have been enhanced if shot thru a window?  It''s a little dark which is ok  because of the title, but I would still lighten it a bit.', '2003-10-01 09:41:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(436429, 40026, 11800, '<td valign="top">Would like to see more of the water.</td>', 'Would like to see more of the water.', '2003-10-01 09:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(436436, 39964, 11800, '<td valign="top">That''s what I was thinking. Just too lazy to do it.  Glad someone did. 8</td>', 'That''s what I was thinking. Just too lazy to do it.  Glad someone did. 8', '2003-10-01 09:46:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(436457, 39905, 11800, '<td valign="top">Interesting.  Would be nicer with more control of the exposure and dof. As it is, overexposed on the sparks and under on the lighter.</td>', 'Interesting.  Would be nicer with more control of the exposure and dof. As it is, overexposed on the sparks and under on the lighter.', '2003-10-01 09:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(436465, 40089, 11800, '<td valign="top">He didn''t get hurt, did he?  Oh, disturbing.</td>', 'He didn''t get hurt, did he?  Oh, disturbing.', '2003-10-01 09:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(436581, 39964, 1368, '<td valign="top">Great! Finally something creative! This picture is great mabey a little to grey Would like to see it in ciolor Good job :)</td>', 'Great! Finally something creative! This picture is great mabey a little to grey Would like to see it in ciolor Good job :)', '2003-10-01 10:46:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(436591, 40089, 3599, '<td valign="top">I hope this individual didn''t panic and saved him or herself from demise.  I think you have captured an extraordinary event, whether it shows flight or not is up to the voter.  I personally don''t think it does however this photo may make people  wonder why anyone would jump out of a perfectly good plane.  I think you made a great effort here.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I hope this individual didn''t panic and saved him or herself from demise.  I think you have captured an extraordinary event, whether it shows flight or not is up to the voter.  I personally don''t think it does however this photo may make people  wonder why anyone would jump out of a perfectly good plane.  I think you made a great effort here.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-01 10:49:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(436598, 39986, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think the lighting for this shot couldn''t have been better.  Maybe too tight of a crop maybe not.  Still a great photo that meets the challenge.</td>', 'I think the lighting for this shot couldn''t have been better.  Maybe too tight of a crop maybe not.  Still a great photo that meets the challenge.', '2003-10-01 10:53:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(436607, 40079, 3599, '<td valign="top">Did you try this in b/w or sepia?  There is very little detail in the trees or the plane itself.  While I''m sure you weren''t controlling the situation taking this photo at a different time during the day may have brought out that detail.</td>', 'Did you try this in b/w or sepia?  There is very little detail in the trees or the plane itself.  While I''m sure you weren''t controlling the situation taking this photo at a different time during the day may have brought out that detail.', '2003-10-01 10:57:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(436615, 39018, 3599, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful aircraft!  I think this is a great shot.  You took this photo at a good time in the day as well.  I don''t think there is much you can do about the noise or pixelation unless you use a lower ISO.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'What a beautiful aircraft!  I think this is a great shot.  You took this photo at a good time in the day as well.  I don''t think there is much you can do about the noise or pixelation unless you use a lower ISO.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-01 11:00:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(436763, 40057, 3087, '<td valign="top">Very professional - I imagine some will decide you don''t deserve a high score just because you were "lucky" enough to capture art created by someone else. I disagree. Composition within the frame, scale and exposure all combine to make this a postcard perfect entry.</td>', 'Very professional - I imagine some will decide you don''t deserve a high score just because you were "lucky" enough to capture art created by someone else. I disagree. Composition within the frame, scale and exposure all combine to make this a postcard perfect entry.', '2003-10-01 12:18:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(436765, 39521, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice capture - full of action,  vitality, character. Conveys freedom, summer holidays, fun.<br/>Although we use "flight" quite loosely, hence this does fit, I think it''s not an image people would look at and be able to guess the theme. That''s not a bad thing, just a comment.</td>', 'Nice capture - full of action,  vitality, character. Conveys freedom, summer holidays, fun.Although we use "flight" quite loosely, hence this does fit, I think it''s not an image people would look at and be able to guess the theme. That''s not a bad thing, just a comment.', '2003-10-01 12:22:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(436766, 39802, 3087, '<td valign="top">What a great shot - very emotionally charged and full of childhood memories. Carries such a strong nostalgic sense of meaning.</td>', 'What a great shot - very emotionally charged and full of childhood memories. Carries such a strong nostalgic sense of meaning.', '2003-10-01 12:23:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(436769, 39886, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting detail - like a cloud with silver lining except it''s a bird! Nice contrast against the neutral grey of the cloud. Also like the cloud detail at lower right.</td>', 'Lovely lighting detail - like a cloud with silver lining except it''s a bird! Nice contrast against the neutral grey of the cloud. Also like the cloud detail at lower right.', '2003-10-01 12:29:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(436770, 39580, 3087, '<td valign="top">Mmm. Interesting. I do kind of like the way the lighting and exposure makes the plants look like they are made of clear glass. Not keen on your choice of exposure in terms of background, bird or sky.</td>', 'Mmm. Interesting. I do kind of like the way the lighting and exposure makes the plants look like they are made of clear glass. Not keen on your choice of exposure in terms of background, bird or sky.', '2003-10-01 12:30:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(436772, 39949, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and sky is interesting without being distracting.</td>', 'Nice composition and sky is interesting without being distracting.', '2003-10-01 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(436773, 39964, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love it! Wonderfully quirky and inventive idea. Excellent composition - how cool that the curves of the tie edge the shape of the shirt. A little too much white cloud but overall one of my very favourites in this challenge.</td>', 'Love it! Wonderfully quirky and inventive idea. Excellent composition - how cool that the curves of the tie edge the shape of the shirt. A little too much white cloud but overall one of my very favourites in this challenge.', '2003-10-01 12:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(436781, 40089, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cloud is lovely against the rich blue and creates a nice leading line to the object.</td>', 'Cloud is lovely against the rich blue and creates a nice leading line to the object.', '2003-10-01 12:36:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(436787, 39873, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty and interesting contrast of colours and textures.</td>', 'Pretty and interesting contrast of colours and textures.', '2003-10-01 12:38:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(436793, 39985, 3087, '<td valign="top">Fun shot. I think an entry with her face a little more clearly angled towards camera would be preferable but I love position of her limbs.</td>', 'Fun shot. I think an entry with her face a little more clearly angled towards camera would be preferable but I love position of her limbs.', '2003-10-01 12:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(436799, 39901, 3087, '<td valign="top">Pretty and I like the balance provided by second smaller bubble.</td>', 'Pretty and I like the balance provided by second smaller bubble.', '2003-10-01 12:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(436802, 39984, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice balance between the two positions and I like the late golden sun reflected on their feathers.</td>', 'Nice balance between the two positions and I like the late golden sun reflected on their feathers.', '2003-10-01 12:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(436805, 40078, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset silhouettes.</td>', 'Beautiful sunset silhouettes.', '2003-10-01 12:46:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(436808, 39818, 3087, '<td valign="top">The subject is small so takes a moment so spot but I quite like how it blends in with the colours of foreground and background. Nice use of DOF.</td>', 'The subject is small so takes a moment so spot but I quite like how it blends in with the colours of foreground and background. Nice use of DOF.', '2003-10-01 12:48:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(436811, 40086, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lovely cloud and smoke trails and interesting composition.</td>', 'Lovely cloud and smoke trails and interesting composition.', '2003-10-01 12:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(436929, 39133, 8913, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, wonderfully captured and very difficult to get with such a high amount of detail. I''ve tried shooting these myself and gave up immediately as they were so darned fast! Anyway, because of the difficulty, you have done a sterling job in getting a decent composition, great DOF, and exposure. Well done!</td>', 'Excellent shot, wonderfully captured and very difficult to get with such a high amount of detail. I''ve tried shooting these myself and gave up immediately as they were so darned fast! Anyway, because of the difficulty, you have done a sterling job in getting a decent composition, great DOF, and exposure. Well done!', '2003-10-01 13:49:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(436943, 39849, 11337, '<td valign="top">Blessaður Biggi minn.. (Biggi is a child pervert) just so you know.. Nono, just joking :D</td>', 'Blessaður Biggi minn.. (Biggi is a child pervert) just so you know.. Nono, just joking :D', '2003-10-01 13:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(437007, 39124, 12061, '<td valign="top">Magnificent!!! A+++++</td>', 'Magnificent!!! A+++++', '2003-10-01 14:18:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(437195, 39521, 7524, '<td valign="top">Love it. Right at eye level with the dog, and nice composition.</td>', 'Love it. Right at eye level with the dog, and nice composition.', '2003-10-01 17:41:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(437287, 39528, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think the way you have captured the birds with this awesome sky in the background is great!  You should crop out the bottom area.  I don''t think it adds to the photo it takes attention away from the birds I think.  Still nice work, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think the way you have captured the birds with this awesome sky in the background is great!  You should crop out the bottom area.  I don''t think it adds to the photo it takes attention away from the birds I think.  Still nice work, good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-01 18:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(437289, 40080, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice composition and lighting.  Good focus as well.  Best of luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice composition and lighting.  Good focus as well.  Best of luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-01 18:33:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(437294, 39851, 3599, '<td valign="top">I think this photo has a lot of potential to be much better.  I don''t know if you knew the guys throwing the frisbee but I would moved them away from the pole.  Also why didn''t you frame this vertically?  You have too much sky and pole for me.  If you can''t change the location ok, but frame this vertically tilt the camera down and show more of the receiver.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I think this photo has a lot of potential to be much better.  I don''t know if you knew the guys throwing the frisbee but I would moved them away from the pole.  Also why didn''t you frame this vertically?  You have too much sky and pole for me.  If you can''t change the location ok, but frame this vertically tilt the camera down and show more of the receiver.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-01 18:36:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(437296, 40067, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very creative interpretation of the challenge.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Very creative interpretation of the challenge.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-01 18:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(437298, 40048, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice photo here, I could see this in a magazine for air travel or something.</td>', 'Nice photo here, I could see this in a magazine for air travel or something.', '2003-10-01 18:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(437318, 40078, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very pretty picture, this is an alternate definition of Flight, IMO not really the definition the site was asking for, but I did think that motion was a big part of that spirit of definition.  I think the sun is just a bit strong, darker would have lessened it''s impact on the photo and made the horses more silhouetted.  If you had caught either horse with all four off the ground, you could have made a very good case for hitting the challenge full on.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very pretty picture, this is an alternate definition of Flight, IMO not really the definition the site was asking for, but I did think that motion was a big part of that spirit of definition.  I think the sun is just a bit strong, darker would have lessened it''s impact on the photo and made the horses more silhouetted.  If you had caught either horse with all four off the ground, you could have made a very good case for hitting the challenge full on.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 18:54:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(437323, 39869, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good clarity on the seagull''s face while getting a strong sense of motion, too.  The framing is questionable, it''s usually more favorable to include more of what the subject is looking at.  I always question monotone...so I''ll ask why?  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good clarity on the seagull''s face while getting a strong sense of motion, too.  The framing is questionable, it''s usually more favorable to include more of what the subject is looking at.  I always question monotone...so I''ll ask why?  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 18:57:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(437332, 39649, 1005, '<td valign="top">Good focus and framing (although a little more open space to the right might be good).  Low on the drama/interest side (flames coming out of the engine, now we''re talking!).  Stronger saturation might have made the jet stand out more from the clouds (and given them more drama, too).  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Good focus and framing (although a little more open space to the right might be good).  Low on the drama/interest side (flames coming out of the engine, now we''re talking!).  Stronger saturation might have made the jet stand out more from the clouds (and given them more drama, too).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(437339, 39966, 1005, '<td valign="top">Sharp, colorful picture!  Hiding the strings might have given this a bit more into the flavor of this challenge (which I partly interpretted as getting motion, too, this has none).  Good framing, though a bit too far off the right 1/3 mark.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Sharp, colorful picture!  Hiding the strings might have given this a bit more into the flavor of this challenge (which I partly interpretted as getting motion, too, this has none).  Good framing, though a bit too far off the right 1/3 mark.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:03:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(437345, 39928, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting, but the subject is a bit miniscule.  Highlighting the parachute was a very good idea, but I''d also like some detail of the person, too.  Framing is O.K., but I get the sense the heading is towards the edge of the frame, instead of into the middle of it.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting, but the subject is a bit miniscule.  Highlighting the parachute was a very good idea, but I''d also like some detail of the person, too.  Framing is O.K., but I get the sense the heading is towards the edge of the frame, instead of into the middle of it.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(437349, 39996, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool, I thought about trying this, too (but didn''t).  Good sense of motion, but maybe a little faster exposure would have left the viewer a little detail to see.  Sky seems slightly grainy, I only use ISO 100, to me, grain is bad.  Framing is very nice.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool, I thought about trying this, too (but didn''t).  Good sense of motion, but maybe a little faster exposure would have left the viewer a little detail to see.  Sky seems slightly grainy, I only use ISO 100, to me, grain is bad.  Framing is very nice.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(437354, 40084, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice motion shot!  Seagull is pretty solid, but it seems slightly out of focus.  Too bad about the building in the lower right corner, it distracts a bit.  I like the wing position, but it shadows the body more than I''d like.  Seems just a bit grainy, too.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice motion shot!  Seagull is pretty solid, but it seems slightly out of focus.  Too bad about the building in the lower right corner, it distracts a bit.  I like the wing position, but it shadows the body more than I''d like.  Seems just a bit grainy, too.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(437372, 39133, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very detailed, sharp as heck shot!  (Envyous!!!)  Must be a very fast camera, I''ve never gotten the wings to come so close to being stopped.  Great pose.  Lovely color!  I hope you win, you''re MY choice!  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very detailed, sharp as heck shot!  (Envyous!!!)  Must be a very fast camera, I''ve never gotten the wings to come so close to being stopped.  Great pose.  Lovely color!  I hope you win, you''re MY choice!  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:16:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(437377, 39563, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool, detailed photo!  Love everything about this, except the framing.  You might lose some points for it.  If possible, you should have the bird in the opposite corner, so the viewer has the feel of seeing what the bird is seeing (or at least in that same direction).  I''m not going to "nick" you any points for it, as I realize this would have been an extremely difficult shot.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very cool, detailed photo!  Love everything about this, except the framing.  You might lose some points for it.  If possible, you should have the bird in the opposite corner, so the viewer has the feel of seeing what the bird is seeing (or at least in that same direction).  I''m not going to "nick" you any points for it, as I realize this would have been an extremely difficult shot.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:19:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(437381, 40047, 1005, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Very detailed!!!  (Love the title, he''s braver than I''d ever be!)  Too bad about the drab weather, but I''ll not nick you any points for it.  Very strong contender.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Cool shot!  Very detailed!!!  (Love the title, he''s braver than I''d ever be!)  Too bad about the drab weather, but I''ll not nick you any points for it.  Very strong contender.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(437385, 40081, 1005, '<td valign="top">Love the color of this shot.  Very good focus on the seagull''s face, the rest is nice, but the face comes through exceptionally well.  Nice framing, but a bit more space to the right wouldn''t have hurt either (closer to that infamous 1/3 rule).  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Love the color of this shot.  Very good focus on the seagull''s face, the rest is nice, but the face comes through exceptionally well.  Nice framing, but a bit more space to the right wouldn''t have hurt either (closer to that infamous 1/3 rule).  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:23:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(437386, 40096, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very good capture.  Focus on the crow is VERY good.  Framing seems O.K., but a landscape view with a tad more space to the left might have been a touch better.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very good capture.  Focus on the crow is VERY good.  Framing seems O.K., but a landscape view with a tad more space to the left might have been a touch better.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(437388, 40055, 1005, '<td valign="top">Simply grand!  Great color!!!  Balloon is well focused and framed.  I like the foreground bushes, it works for me.  10 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Simply grand!  Great color!!!  Balloon is well focused and framed.  I like the foreground bushes, it works for me.  10 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(437392, 39812, 1005, '<td valign="top">I wanted to really, really love this shot.  The forewings and front of the head are very nice.  The white back seems overexposed to me and the shadows in that area add to the confusion.  I''m liking the blue area at the top...may I ask how you did that?  (just curious)  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I wanted to really, really love this shot.  The forewings and front of the head are very nice.  The white back seems overexposed to me and the shadows in that area add to the confusion.  I''m liking the blue area at the top...may I ask how you did that?  (just curious)  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(437396, 39991, 1005, '<td valign="top">With this title, the darkness and grain work very well.  That said, I''m not really a fan of grain...(sorry, my bad).  The birds show flight well, so challenge met, but I really like some detail.  (Not for DPC) - Spot edit the building into full silhouette, seems like a good idea.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'With this title, the darkness and grain work very well.  That said, I''m not really a fan of grain...(sorry, my bad).  The birds show flight well, so challenge met, but I really like some detail.  (Not for DPC) - Spot edit the building into full silhouette, seems like a good idea.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:30:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(437402, 40033, 1005, '<td valign="top">Fun title.  Motion is good, but in this case, a bit too much.  (I know I''m asking for the Sun and the Moon here, but any direction but flying away....)  Shooting from shadows into bright sunny is difficult at best, might want to avoid that, too.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Fun title.  Motion is good, but in this case, a bit too much.  (I know I''m asking for the Sun and the Moon here, but any direction but flying away....)  Shooting from shadows into bright sunny is difficult at best, might want to avoid that, too.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:32:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(437411, 39994, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, pretty, but not much detail on the seagulls.  I like the lighthouse, but the red rider is just plain distracting, wait for it....Framing, color all O.K, but the birds look a bit over-exposed, maybe a different white balance setting (if possible).  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice, pretty, but not much detail on the seagulls.  I like the lighthouse, but the red rider is just plain distracting, wait for it....Framing, color all O.K, but the birds look a bit over-exposed, maybe a different white balance setting (if possible).  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:34:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(437414, 40040, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, good detail and color.  Too bad the strings (and eyehooks) show up so strongly.  The background looks like fun, but seems to pull the eye away from the subject.  Framing has the subject well placed.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice shot, good detail and color.  Too bad the strings (and eyehooks) show up so strongly.  The background looks like fun, but seems to pull the eye away from the subject.  Framing has the subject well placed.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 19:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(437458, 39910, 5313, '<td valign="top">What amazing reflection!  Are you in there?  Great shot!</td>', 'What amazing reflection!  Are you in there?  Great shot!', '2003-10-01 19:56:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(437464, 39886, 6624, '<td valign="top">the backlit outlining is nice but the rest of the image is a bit dull...a tighter crop?</td>', 'the backlit outlining is nice but the rest of the image is a bit dull...a tighter crop?', '2003-10-01 19:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(437469, 40083, 6624, '<td valign="top">the backlit effect is nice</td>', 'the backlit effect is nice', '2003-10-01 20:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(437471, 40095, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice response to the challenge and I believe it''s the only one - I expected more</td>', 'nice response to the challenge and I believe it''s the only one - I expected more', '2003-10-01 20:01:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(437473, 39554, 6624, '<td valign="top">I can feel the frustration - nicely laid out</td>', 'I can feel the frustration - nicely laid out', '2003-10-01 20:02:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(437478, 40086, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice response to challenge - nice capture for the scope of their flight</td>', 'nice response to challenge - nice capture for the scope of their flight', '2003-10-01 20:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(437482, 39511, 6624, '<td valign="top">interesting light and color - too bad the ''rider'' isn''t a bit more evident</td>', 'interesting light and color - too bad the ''rider'' isn''t a bit more evident', '2003-10-01 20:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(437483, 40080, 5313, '<td valign="top">Wonderful!  I really enjoy the birds and you''ve captured them for sure!  I like this photo!</td>', 'Wonderful!  I really enjoy the birds and you''ve captured them for sure!  I like this photo!', '2003-10-01 20:05:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(437486, 40032, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice capture except for the blown out tail</td>', 'nice capture except for the blown out tail', '2003-10-01 20:05:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(437491, 40017, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice light on the bird and detail of feathers</td>', 'nice light on the bird and detail of feathers', '2003-10-01 20:06:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(437495, 39983, 6624, '<td valign="top">too much motion and loss of focus for me and the blurred red car is a real distraction</td>', 'too much motion and loss of focus for me and the blurred red car is a real distraction', '2003-10-01 20:07:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(437537, 40017, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful details in the feathers of the bird. The blurring of the bird gives a good sense of motion. The focusing in on the water is a change from focusing in on the bird helps to give a graphic dynamic to the shot. Good contrast and depth of field help to separate the bird from the water.</td>', 'Beautiful details in the feathers of the bird. The blurring of the bird gives a good sense of motion. The focusing in on the water is a change from focusing in on the bird helps to give a graphic dynamic to the shot. Good contrast and depth of field help to separate the bird from the water.', '2003-10-01 20:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(437592, 40079, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice, but it seems on the dark side.  (Is the airplane upside down, or am I just looking at this wrong?)  Framing is good.  Color - well, it''s dark.  Almost silhouetted, but I do see some yellow in the wing, so not really.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice, but it seems on the dark side.  (Is the airplane upside down, or am I just looking at this wrong?)  Framing is good.  Color - well, it''s dark.  Almost silhouetted, but I do see some yellow in the wing, so not really.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 20:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(437595, 39884, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice color, but the seagull doesn''t seem super sharp (or is it just a bit too far away and not very detailed).  In between silhouetted and not.  Is it me, or is the ocean slanted?  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Nice color, but the seagull doesn''t seem super sharp (or is it just a bit too far away and not very detailed).  In between silhouetted and not.  Is it me, or is the ocean slanted?  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 20:51:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(437598, 39602, 1005, '<td valign="top">I''ve tried to comment this one twice.  I like it and I don''t.  The sepia tone doesn''t seem to "add" to this image (IMO).  I sort of like the motion of the wings, but it seems like it''s too strong of motion.  The birds on the hay seem less than sharp, and blur into each other.  (Were you drinking, too? {joke})  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I''ve tried to comment this one twice.  I like it and I don''t.  The sepia tone doesn''t seem to "add" to this image (IMO).  I sort of like the motion of the wings, but it seems like it''s too strong of motion.  The birds on the hay seem less than sharp, and blur into each other.  (Were you drinking, too? {joke})  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 20:55:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(437599, 39818, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very nice flower shot...the bee seems to be getting away.  Love the color of this shot, vibrant yellow.  Nice framing.  The bee is just not very sharp.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Very nice flower shot...the bee seems to be getting away.  Love the color of this shot, vibrant yellow.  Nice framing.  The bee is just not very sharp.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 20:57:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(437600, 39471, 1005, '<td valign="top">Interesting view.  I like the spread of the tail feathers.  I''m seeing some "odd" darkness on the right side and lower left...was this due to some viginetting?<br/>7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'Interesting view.  I like the spread of the tail feathers.  I''m seeing some "odd" darkness on the right side and lower left...was this due to some viginetting?7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 20:59:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(437602, 40035, 1005, '<td valign="top">I really like the crow in flight.  The others...not so much.  The pebbling at the bottom of the frame is somewhere between interesting and distracting.  7 Rob the Swash</td>', 'I really like the crow in flight.  The others...not so much.  The pebbling at the bottom of the frame is somewhere between interesting and distracting.  7 Rob the Swash', '2003-10-01 21:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(437620, 40057, 10084, '<td valign="top">Very good composition. Nice clearity in the smoke that the planes are producing. Great angle shows off the heart perfectly. The smoke definitely is set forward with the blue hue of the sky. Excellent greeting card or postcard depleting "love".</td>', 'Very good composition. Nice clearity in the smoke that the planes are producing. Great angle shows off the heart perfectly. The smoke definitely is set forward with the blue hue of the sky. Excellent greeting card or postcard depleting "love".', '2003-10-01 21:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(437625, 40050, 10084, '<td valign="top">Pretty good focus on the football. Good shutter control . You were able to get the shot near the concrete where the football and the depth of field helps launch it forward. Love that you blurred the crowd yet you can still make out their expressions. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Pretty good focus on the football. Good shutter control . You were able to get the shot near the concrete where the football and the depth of field helps launch it forward. Love that you blurred the crowd yet you can still make out their expressions. Beautiful shot.', '2003-10-01 21:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(437629, 39966, 10084, '<td valign="top">The beautiful colors in the stainglass really helps to set it away from the blue hue of the sky, but the trees distract from the overall composition. Even if it was blurred even more the darkness of the trees would overwhelm the main subject.<br/> <br/>Otherwise I like the shadows and reflections on the butterfly gives the frame a great metallic feeling.</td>', 'The beautiful colors in the stainglass really helps to set it away from the blue hue of the sky, but the trees distract from the overall composition. Even if it was blurred even more the darkness of the trees would overwhelm the main subject. Otherwise I like the shadows and reflections on the butterfly gives the frame a great metallic feeling.', '2003-10-01 21:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(437637, 39936, 10084, '<td valign="top">You were able to capture some really beautiful colors in the dragonfly. The blurring of the wings help to give a dynamic motion feeling. The depth of field really help to bring out the dragonfly.</td>', 'You were able to capture some really beautiful colors in the dragonfly. The blurring of the wings help to give a dynamic motion feeling. The depth of field really help to bring out the dragonfly.', '2003-10-01 21:34:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(437640, 39184, 10084, '<td valign="top">Good depth of field in the photo helps to bring out the helicopter. The subject has great contrast which helps it set apart from the background. Love the slight blurring in the copter it gives it a sense of flight. <br/> <br/>Would like to see the photo straighten a bit. It would help with the composition and give even more interest to the shot.</td>', 'Good depth of field in the photo helps to bring out the helicopter. The subject has great contrast which helps it set apart from the background. Love the slight blurring in the copter it gives it a sense of flight.  Would like to see the photo straighten a bit. It would help with the composition and give even more interest to the shot.', '2003-10-01 21:41:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(437644, 40085, 10084, '<td valign="top">The angle that the feather is shot at makes it seem like it falling or floating. I''m think you are using negative on your camera. It gives the feather a beautiful color. Beautiful blue hues in the feather. The frame works perfectly with the shot.</td>', 'The angle that the feather is shot at makes it seem like it falling or floating. I''m think you are using negative on your camera. It gives the feather a beautiful color. Beautiful blue hues in the feather. The frame works perfectly with the shot.', '2003-10-01 21:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(437646, 40021, 10084, '<td valign="top">The slighting blurring of the bees'' wings and the body really help to give it a dynamic feeling of motion and flight. I can''t believe the great focus you were able to achieve on the bee. The great depth of field helps make the bee pop out even more from the shot.Nice colors in the flowers. Great details there also.</td>', 'The slighting blurring of the bees'' wings and the body really help to give it a dynamic feeling of motion and flight. I can''t believe the great focus you were able to achieve on the bee. The great depth of field helps make the bee pop out even more from the shot.Nice colors in the flowers. Great details there also.', '2003-10-01 21:49:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(437647, 39884, 10084, '<td valign="top">The beautiful blue hues in the water really up make the subject pop out of the picture. The shadows and reflections in the water are absolutely beautiful. I like the high contrast of the bird. It makes the bird very graphic and dynamic. The direction and angle of the water helps give a sense of motion to the bird.</td>', 'The beautiful blue hues in the water really up make the subject pop out of the picture. The shadows and reflections in the water are absolutely beautiful. I like the high contrast of the bird. It makes the bird very graphic and dynamic. The direction and angle of the water helps give a sense of motion to the bird.', '2003-10-01 21:52:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(437653, 39964, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great contrast really helps the tie and shirt set itself apart from the sky. Love the fluffy clouds that you were able to capture. The way the tie/shirt seem to be flopping around in the air really give a great dynamic and sense of flight. <br/> <br/>This is the most original entry in the  "flight" challenge. Absolutely the best photo in the bunch. Great work.</td>', 'Great contrast really helps the tie and shirt set itself apart from the sky. Love the fluffy clouds that you were able to capture. The way the tie/shirt seem to be flopping around in the air really give a great dynamic and sense of flight.  This is the most original entry in the  "flight" challenge. Absolutely the best photo in the bunch. Great work.', '2003-10-01 21:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(437669, 39802, 4493, '<td valign="top">Perfection! The plane being in the hottest part of the sky, to the outfit of the young boy... this images has everything it takes to be a ribbon winner. Nicely done! 10 -danny</td>', 'Perfection! The plane being in the hottest part of the sky, to the outfit of the young boy... this images has everything it takes to be a ribbon winner. Nicely done! 10 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(437670, 40081, 4493, '<td valign="top">Beautiful sunset capture. The lighting makes this image stand above the rest. 10 -danny</td>', 'Beautiful sunset capture. The lighting makes this image stand above the rest. 10 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:27:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(437672, 39133, 4493, '<td valign="top">I am impressed by your ability to stop the wings on this hummingbird. This is an image that should be in the collection of any hummingbird watcher. Great colors and tonal quality throughout. 10 -danny</td>', 'I am impressed by your ability to stop the wings on this hummingbird. This is an image that should be in the collection of any hummingbird watcher. Great colors and tonal quality throughout. 10 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(437673, 40037, 258, '<td valign="top">The gutter on the left is distracting.</td>', 'The gutter on the left is distracting.', '2003-10-01 22:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(437674, 39959, 4493, '<td valign="top">Wow! Even with the wing clipped off at the top, you have captured an image that is powerful. The grey of the bird with the grey of the sky make a great pairing. 10 -danny</td>', 'Wow! Even with the wing clipped off at the top, you have captured an image that is powerful. The grey of the bird with the grey of the sky make a great pairing. 10 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(437675, 40017, 4493, '<td valign="top">The wing formation and sharpness of the focus are spectacular. The only thing missing is more of the head being visible. 9 -danny</td>', 'The wing formation and sharpness of the focus are spectacular. The only thing missing is more of the head being visible. 9 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(437677, 39936, 258, '<td valign="top">The wing is covering the head,</td>', 'The wing is covering the head,', '2003-10-01 22:34:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(437678, 40026, 258, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2003-10-01 22:34:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(437679, 39602, 4493, '<td valign="top">Great sense of mood in this shot. I like the activity of the birds and the tonal conversion you used to make this have a more autumn almost erie feel to it. My only suggestion is to try and crop some of the hay bails out in the background by cropping just to the right of the foreground hay. Still a great capture and wonderful piece of art. 9 -danny</td>', 'Great sense of mood in this shot. I like the activity of the birds and the tonal conversion you used to make this have a more autumn almost erie feel to it. My only suggestion is to try and crop some of the hay bails out in the background by cropping just to the right of the foreground hay. Still a great capture and wonderful piece of art. 9 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(437680, 40086, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very nice. The color of the sky and the tones in the smoke work together nicely. Your composition with the plans hooking on the left make this outstanding. 9 -danny</td>', 'Very nice. The color of the sky and the tones in the smoke work together nicely. Your composition with the plans hooking on the left make this outstanding. 9 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:35:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(437682, 40048, 4493, '<td valign="top">Very appealing image. Somewhat cliche but you managed a beautiful sunset and clouds for your shot. 8 -danny</td>', 'Very appealing image. Somewhat cliche but you managed a beautiful sunset and clouds for your shot. 8 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(437685, 39849, 4493, '<td valign="top">The background of your shot really makes this. I can see this being a scene in a movie! I like it. 8 -danny</td>', 'The background of your shot really makes this. I can see this being a scene in a movie! I like it. 8 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(437686, 40095, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nicely done. I was thinking of doing a similar shot, yours turned out nicely. Good use of 3rds and lighting. 8 -danny</td>', 'Nicely done. I was thinking of doing a similar shot, yours turned out nicely. Good use of 3rds and lighting. 8 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:39:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(437687, 40032, 4493, '<td valign="top">Nice close up with good detail. The tail is a little hot, but the overall composition is nice. 8 -danny</td>', 'Nice close up with good detail. The tail is a little hot, but the overall composition is nice. 8 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(437690, 40045, 4493, '<td valign="top">The natural vignette on this shot, with the lighting the bird coupled with your aperature and DOF, create a stunning shot. 9 -danny</td>', 'The natural vignette on this shot, with the lighting the bird coupled with your aperature and DOF, create a stunning shot. 9 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(437692, 40047, 4493, '<td valign="top">:-) Fun shot to look at. Good exposure and pan. 8 -danny</td>', ':-) Fun shot to look at. Good exposure and pan. 8 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:42:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(437698, 39984, 4493, '<td valign="top">I cracked up when I saw this. The 2 of them are perfect. I would like a little more space around them, but otherwise a nice capture. 8 -danny</td>', 'I cracked up when I saw this. The 2 of them are perfect. I would like a little more space around them, but otherwise a nice capture. 8 -danny', '2003-10-01 22:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(437726, 40017, 258, '<td valign="top">One of many bird butt shots.</td>', 'One of many bird butt shots.', '2003-10-01 23:27:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(437781, 40039, 11073, '<td valign="top">i think that i would like it better if the beach ball was not centered - what i mean by that is off to one side would imply that it had to be moving within the frame to get to that point, centered as it is it kind of has a motionless feel to it.  that said, its a good take on the category and a good subject to use. <br/> <br/>the subject does look a little on the dark side - maybe a lighting effect overall might bring out the subject a little more - or possibly next time waiting for the sun to be on it more.<br/> <br/>good, original effort. 6</td>', 'i think that i would like it better if the beach ball was not centered - what i mean by that is off to one side would imply that it had to be moving within the frame to get to that point, centered as it is it kind of has a motionless feel to it.  that said, its a good take on the category and a good subject to use.  the subject does look a little on the dark side - maybe a lighting effect overall might bring out the subject a little more - or possibly next time waiting for the sun to be on it more. good, original effort. 6', '2003-10-01 23:59:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(437783, 39893, 11073, '<td valign="top">great original idea, and good execution.</td>', 'great original idea, and good execution.', '2003-10-02 00:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(437785, 39511, 11073, '<td valign="top">GREAT subject to use, and compositionaly a good shot - but that said i think that the main subject (I''m using the person as the main subject) is a little too dark.  I know that it probably couldn''t be helped, but if you redo this in the future, I think that a morning or evening sun could illuminate the subject a little better.</td>', 'GREAT subject to use, and compositionaly a good shot - but that said i think that the main subject (I''m using the person as the main subject) is a little too dark.  I know that it probably couldn''t be helped, but if you redo this in the future, I think that a morning or evening sun could illuminate the subject a little better.', '2003-10-02 00:05:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(437788, 39996, 11073, '<td valign="top">good subject, i like the composition as well.</td>', 'good subject, i like the composition as well.', '2003-10-02 00:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(437790, 40045, 11073, '<td valign="top">very good subject framing.</td>', 'very good subject framing.', '2003-10-02 00:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(437791, 39602, 11073, '<td valign="top">i like how you framed this pic. nice.  dropping the color levels creates a good look and feel as well, nice work.</td>', 'i like how you framed this pic. nice.  dropping the color levels creates a good look and feel as well, nice work.', '2003-10-02 00:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(437817, 39870, 7151, '<td valign="top">Lighting, focus, etc. are good, as is the idea.  Composition would have been better with a wider view, the main dandylion off to one side, and a single spore (?), or even a few spores (but a single would have fit the title), floating off to the other side.</td>', 'Lighting, focus, etc. are good, as is the idea.  Composition would have been better with a wider view, the main dandylion off to one side, and a single spore (?), or even a few spores (but a single would have fit the title), floating off to the other side.', '2003-10-02 01:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(437822, 39986, 7151, '<td valign="top">Ah, I wanted to do this, but couldn''t get to our glider port (and the sky was overcast all week).  Nice capture.  The only thing I don''t like is the cropping/composition.  Not sure what would have been best, but doing something a little less centered could have helped give it a feeling of movement.</td>', 'Ah, I wanted to do this, but couldn''t get to our glider port (and the sky was overcast all week).  Nice capture.  The only thing I don''t like is the cropping/composition.  Not sure what would have been best, but doing something a little less centered could have helped give it a feeling of movement.', '2003-10-02 01:09:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(437826, 40090, 7151, '<td valign="top">So Cal coastline?  I had a few very similar shots - including the grey clouds.  :(  I like the composition, but the pelican\''s a bit dark and lacking detail.  I realize the limitations you faced, but the result is just OK.</td>', 'So Cal coastline?  I had a few very similar shots - including the grey clouds.  :(  I like the composition, but the pelican\''s a bit dark and lacking detail.  I realize the limitations you faced, but the result is just OK.', '2003-10-02 01:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(437828, 39542, 7151, '<td valign="top">Nice.  And bonus points for a kid picture!  (Since I''m sure you''ll get dinged for it.)  Great stopped motion.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten her face better - would have really made this shot sparkle.  Also, try using Neat Image (if you didn''t already) to try cleaning up the noise in the sky.  It usually does a really good job with this kind of shot.</td>', 'Nice.  And bonus points for a kid picture!  (Since I''m sure you''ll get dinged for it.)  Great stopped motion.  Too bad you couldn''t have gotten her face better - would have really made this shot sparkle.  Also, try using Neat Image (if you didn''t already) to try cleaning up the noise in the sky.  It usually does a really good job with this kind of shot.', '2003-10-02 01:17:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(437829, 40093, 7151, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Wish it had been bigger.  Action was captured very well.</td>', 'Great idea.  Wish it had been bigger.  Action was captured very well.', '2003-10-02 01:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(437831, 40059, 7151, '<td valign="top">Good sports shot, but would have worked better for flight if you could have shown their feet off the ground.  Nice color, focus and stopped motion.</td>', 'Good sports shot, but would have worked better for flight if you could have shown their feet off the ground.  Nice color, focus and stopped motion.', '2003-10-02 01:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(437838, 40042, 12737, '<td valign="top">This one made me laugh!  Great primary colors and I like the way the ribbon makes a leading line to the subject.</td>', 'This one made me laugh!  Great primary colors and I like the way the ribbon makes a leading line to the subject.', '2003-10-02 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(437839, 40040, 12737, '<td valign="top">Great concept but the background is too distracting, even with the shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Great concept but the background is too distracting, even with the shallow depth of field.', '2003-10-02 01:33:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(437849, 40086, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great contrast on the planes help to make them pop out of the picture. The dark color of the smoke helps to set them apart from the fluffy clouds. Beautiful skies, nice hues in the blue. Great composition.</td>', 'Great contrast on the planes help to make them pop out of the picture. The dark color of the smoke helps to set them apart from the fluffy clouds. Beautiful skies, nice hues in the blue. Great composition.', '2003-10-02 01:54:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(437862, 40048, 12736, '<td valign="top">very nice photo, one would think twas manipulated its so dreamy and has such nice color and contrast, and I mean that in a complimentary way being it carries such vivid and amazing contrast, perfect but I can not go giving a ten on what in my opinion is a perfect photo, hence I will simply give it a wonderfully perfect 8 ibeing I haven''t looked at all it compares to yet, but I can say this certainly sets my standard for a quality photo, wonderfully done</td>', 'very nice photo, one would think twas manipulated its so dreamy and has such nice color and contrast, and I mean that in a complimentary way being it carries such vivid and amazing contrast, perfect but I can not go giving a ten on what in my opinion is a perfect photo, hence I will simply give it a wonderfully perfect 8 ibeing I haven''t looked at all it compares to yet, but I can say this certainly sets my standard for a quality photo, wonderfully done', '2003-10-02 02:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(437866, 39983, 12736, '<td valign="top">well I am a newbie here but if it were me,  I could see that blighjt of a red beast in the background being ixnayed out or recolored through manipulation, I dunno if thats within rules, but if it was for perfection in the artistic contentthis photo has no place, otherwise this is stunning, I love the motion in the wings the form of the creature, thats a stunning photo worth much time to make into a wonderful pievce of art worthy of hanging on a wall, and I am not one for wall hanging much, wonderfully done, jeeze I don''t even know how to compare half these photos now I am seeing some elegant and amazing stuff ranging from classic beauty such as this to stunning modern contrast like the one I just came from, simply an amazing photo yo have here though, nothing short of spectacular in every essence of atmosphere and the contrasty exposure from over to slightly under on the subject, that darn blight of a car though it has to go  :P LOL, be damned with the rules whatever they may be LOL</td>', 'well I am a newbie here but if it were me,  I could see that blighjt of a red beast in the background being ixnayed out or recolored through manipulation, I dunno if thats within rules, but if it was for perfection in the artistic contentthis photo has no place, otherwise this is stunning, I love the motion in the wings the form of the creature, thats a stunning photo worth much time to make into a wonderful pievce of art worthy of hanging on a wall, and I am not one for wall hanging much, wonderfully done, jeeze I don''t even know how to compare half these photos now I am seeing some elegant and amazing stuff ranging from classic beauty such as this to stunning modern contrast like the one I just came from, simply an amazing photo yo have here though, nothing short of spectacular in every essence of atmosphere and the contrasty exposure from over to slightly under on the subject, that darn blight of a car though it has to go  :P LOL, be damned with the rules whatever they may be LOL', '2003-10-02 02:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(437870, 39812, 12736, '<td valign="top">oohhh very artistic creative and superbly interesting, perfect creative licence for the challenge, not sure if proper exposure would benefit it or not, as it stands I love it, simplicity yet immensely captivating, draws me in and makes me want to really see every aspect of the intrigueing creature, lovely photo indeed</td>', 'oohhh very artistic creative and superbly interesting, perfect creative licence for the challenge, not sure if proper exposure would benefit it or not, as it stands I love it, simplicity yet immensely captivating, draws me in and makes me want to really see every aspect of the intrigueing creature, lovely photo indeed', '2003-10-02 02:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(437872, 39542, 12736, '<td valign="top">Ohhh NOOOO who is taking that picture :O:O:O LOL this is great, I am not one for kid or people pictures a whole lot but this one is spectacular, wonderful exposure contrast smiles and flight, this is a wonderful entry, best of luck, and tis certainly ribbon material in my book  LOL but then the competition is really impressive in this contest so don''t be disgruntled, just be pleased with this amazing fine piece of work you captured, lovely take you have here<br/>joe</td>', 'Ohhh NOOOO who is taking that picture :O:O:O LOL this is great, I am not one for kid or people pictures a whole lot but this one is spectacular, wonderful exposure contrast smiles and flight, this is a wonderful entry, best of luck, and tis certainly ribbon material in my book  LOL but then the competition is really impressive in this contest so don''t be disgruntled, just be pleased with this amazing fine piece of work you captured, lovely take you have herejoe', '2003-10-02 02:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
