(437964, 40095, 8682, '<td valign="top">Yeah... It´s one of the best pictures of the week... And one of the most original picture... It´s great... Congrats of a good work... 10<br/></td>', 'Yeah... It´s one of the best pictures of the week... And one of the most original picture... It´s great... Congrats of a good work... 10', '2003-10-02 06:15:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(437966, 39554, 8682, '<td valign="top">Yeah..... Great interpretation of the challenge.... 10<br/></td>', 'Yeah..... Great interpretation of the challenge.... 10', '2003-10-02 06:16:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(438008, 39542, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good sense of motion. Nice bright, colourful shot with a happy feel to it. The hair across the face is a double-edged sword - it portrays motion but it might be nice to see her face more clearly as well.</td>', 'Good sense of motion. Nice bright, colourful shot with a happy feel to it. The hair across the face is a double-edged sword - it portrays motion but it might be nice to see her face more clearly as well.', '2003-10-02 08:19:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(438009, 39962, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the patterns in the water and the reflections. Lighting on the flying bird''s wing is good too. Perhaps crop it slightly less tightly to give the subjects a little more breathing space.</td>', 'I like the patterns in the water and the reflections. Lighting on the flying bird''s wing is good too. Perhaps crop it slightly less tightly to give the subjects a little more breathing space.', '2003-10-02 08:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(438011, 39528, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice colours and great sense of space. I really think I would crop out the light area of sky at the bottom, which distracts attention from the birdsand spoils the tone. Nice catch.</td>', 'Nice colours and great sense of space. I really think I would crop out the light area of sky at the bottom, which distracts attention from the birdsand spoils the tone. Nice catch.', '2003-10-02 08:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(438014, 39983, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good catch of motion, although a faster shutter speed might have frozen the action a little better. The car in the background is a big distraction - shame you can''t clone it out. There''s also quite a lot of CA generally.</td>', 'Good catch of motion, although a faster shutter speed might have frozen the action a little better. The car in the background is a big distraction - shame you can''t clone it out. There''s also quite a lot of CA generally.', '2003-10-02 08:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(438018, 40059, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice sporting shot, expressions are good. Don''t get a particularly good impression of flight from it though. If we could see the feet of the guy heading the ball, that might emphasise that he''s off the ground.</td>', 'Nice sporting shot, expressions are good. Don''t get a particularly good impression of flight from it though. If we could see the feet of the guy heading the ball, that might emphasise that he''s off the ground.', '2003-10-02 08:26:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(438019, 40019, 3290, '<td valign="top">Amusing juxtaposition of subjects. Nicely sharp and clear.</td>', 'Amusing juxtaposition of subjects. Nicely sharp and clear.', '2003-10-02 08:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(438020, 39644, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-) Photographer''s shadow is a distraction. It''s nice and clear and I like the lighting too. I''d like to see something similar with the photographer closer to and below the subject - would give a greater sense of height (and flight).</td>', ':-) Photographer''s shadow is a distraction. It''s nice and clear and I like the lighting too. I''d like to see something similar with the photographer closer to and below the subject - would give a greater sense of height (and flight).', '2003-10-02 08:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(438021, 39932, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice subject, but it looks more like it''s sitting on the ground than flying, despite its spread wings. Highlights on the tail look a bit blown out.</td>', 'Nice subject, but it looks more like it''s sitting on the ground than flying, despite its spread wings. Highlights on the tail look a bit blown out.', '2003-10-02 08:29:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(438022, 40026, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Good use of flash and nice motion freeze. Could perhaps do with a tighter crop vertically and more space in front of the bird (if you have it). Good sharpness and clarity.</td>', 'Nice catch. Good use of flash and nice motion freeze. Could perhaps do with a tighter crop vertically and more space in front of the bird (if you have it). Good sharpness and clarity.', '2003-10-02 08:32:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(438023, 40085, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice, although I find the blue a little strong. Might have been good to position the feather slightly less centrally, which may give it more of a sense of movement.</td>', 'Nice, although I find the blue a little strong. Might have been good to position the feather slightly less centrally, which may give it more of a sense of movement.', '2003-10-02 08:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(438024, 39968, 3290, '<td valign="top">Good catch, but would be much better against a blue sky or some other plain background. Alternatively, a wider aperture would blur the background for a similar effect.</td>', 'Good catch, but would be much better against a blue sky or some other plain background. Alternatively, a wider aperture would blur the background for a similar effect.', '2003-10-02 08:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(438025, 40057, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good timing and nice crop! - 8</td>', 'Good timing and nice crop! - 8', '2003-10-02 08:36:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(438026, 40096, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice focus on the raven, the tip of the right wing looks a bit oversharpened though. It would also have been cool to see the head of the raven.</td>', 'Nice focus on the raven, the tip of the right wing looks a bit oversharpened though. It would also have been cool to see the head of the raven.', '2003-10-02 08:37:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(438027, 40055, 3290, '<td valign="top">One of the nicer shots of the challenge. Framing around the balloon is a little tight, but this is sharp and clear and the balloon colours are bright.</td>', 'One of the nicer shots of the challenge. Framing around the balloon is a little tight, but this is sharp and clear and the balloon colours are bright.', '2003-10-02 08:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(438028, 39603, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice timing, but my problem with this pic that it is not in focus, not a single part of the image is in focus.  That detracts alot from the quality of the picture.</td>', 'Nice timing, but my problem with this pic that it is not in focus, not a single part of the image is in focus.  That detracts alot from the quality of the picture.', '2003-10-02 08:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(438029, 40026, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good timing and nice use of negative space.</td>', 'Good timing and nice use of negative space.', '2003-10-02 08:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(438030, 40041, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting colours and an unusual take on a familiar subject. I''d like to see the same shot rotated through 45 degrees which would give it a much greater sense of dynamism.</td>', 'Interesting colours and an unusual take on a familiar subject. I''d like to see the same shot rotated through 45 degrees which would give it a much greater sense of dynamism.', '2003-10-02 08:39:40.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(438031, 39870, 10883, '<td valign="top">Original concept!  Nice choice to have the background completely black.  It would be interesting to so this pic if the flower would not have been so centered.</td>', 'Original concept!  Nice choice to have the background completely black.  It would be interesting to so this pic if the flower would not have been so centered.', '2003-10-02 08:40:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(438034, 39935, 10883, '<td valign="top">While technically this picture does meet the challenge, this picture does not interest me as much as it could.  Pherhaps if a pic would have been taken while the airplane was doing a turn or in takeoff/landing.</td>', 'While technically this picture does meet the challenge, this picture does not interest me as much as it could.  Pherhaps if a pic would have been taken while the airplane was doing a turn or in takeoff/landing.', '2003-10-02 08:43:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(438035, 40096, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch and has a good sense of motion. Looks oversharpened, though, since there''s quite a strong light halo around the bird.</td>', 'Nice catch and has a good sense of motion. Looks oversharpened, though, since there''s quite a strong light halo around the bird.', '2003-10-02 08:43:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(438036, 39471, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and viewpoint. It''s a little noisy, although this may add to the atmosphere.</td>', 'I like the composition and viewpoint. It''s a little noisy, although this may add to the atmosphere.', '2003-10-02 08:44:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(438037, 39314, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice pic of this bird.  The pic is a bit on the small side and there is some noise or distortion in the sky which detracts a bit from the picture.</td>', 'Nice pic of this bird.  The pic is a bit on the small side and there is some noise or distortion in the sky which detracts a bit from the picture.', '2003-10-02 08:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(438038, 39891, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. I''d play around with levels a bit to see if you could lighten it. Shame they weren''t flying towards you, but if you ask them, they don''t seem to take any notice :-)</td>', 'Nice catch. I''d play around with levels a bit to see if you could lighten it. Shame they weren''t flying towards you, but if you ask them, they don''t seem to take any notice :-)', '2003-10-02 08:45:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(438039, 39898, 3290, '<td valign="top">I think this is a really nice picture, but the brief for the challenge is to photograph something which is actually in flight, which this isn''t (as far as I can tell).<br/> <br/>Good use of B&amp;W and I like the lighting and framing. Highlights on the forehead have blown out a bit.</td>', 'I think this is a really nice picture, but the brief for the challenge is to photograph something which is actually in flight, which this isn''t (as far as I can tell). Good use of B&W and I like the lighting and framing. Highlights on the forehead have blown out a bit.', '2003-10-02 08:47:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(438040, 40069, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice timing!  The focus could have been better, the flower on the left is in focus but nearly nothing else.  I would like to have seen sharper focus on the butterfly.</td>', 'Nice timing!  The focus could have been better, the flower on the left is in focus but nearly nothing else.  I would like to have seen sharper focus on the butterfly.', '2003-10-02 08:48:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(438041, 39133, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice clear, sharp shot. Good catch. Beautiful colours and clarity. Shame the background is a little busy, but you have to take what you can get.</td>', 'Nice clear, sharp shot. Good catch. Beautiful colours and clarity. Shame the background is a little busy, but you have to take what you can get.', '2003-10-02 08:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(438042, 39941, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice concept.  You must have had to use quite long exposure to capture the flight of the space station.  Remarkable little noise considering the length of the exposure.</td>', 'Nice concept.  You must have had to use quite long exposure to capture the flight of the space station.  Remarkable little noise considering the length of the exposure.', '2003-10-02 08:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(438044, 39942, 3290, '<td valign="top">At last, a head-on bird instead of its bottom! I like the framing and focus. Wings look a bit overexposed, though.</td>', 'At last, a head-on bird instead of its bottom! I like the framing and focus. Wings look a bit overexposed, though.', '2003-10-02 08:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(438045, 40062, 3290, '<td valign="top">This is nice. Good use of negative space, although I might prefer that space in front of the glider rather than behind it.</td>', 'This is nice. Good use of negative space, although I might prefer that space in front of the glider rather than behind it.', '2003-10-02 08:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(438046, 39580, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect. I like the backlit plants, althought it''s less effective on the bird. A lens hood might help with the flare.</td>', 'Interesting effect. I like the backlit plants, althought it''s less effective on the bird. A lens hood might help with the flare.', '2003-10-02 08:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(438047, 40017, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice sharpness, exposure and colour. Just a shame we can''t see the bird''s head. I like the framing too.</td>', 'Nice sharpness, exposure and colour. Just a shame we can''t see the bird''s head. I like the framing too.', '2003-10-02 08:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(438048, 40081, 3290, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting on the bird''s underside. Nice focus. Good blurred background. I think this one will do well. I think I''d crop a bit less tightly to emphasise the space around the bird and that it is in flight. Nice shot.</td>', 'Lovely lighting on the bird''s underside. Nice focus. Good blurred background. I think this one will do well. I think I''d crop a bit less tightly to emphasise the space around the bird and that it is in flight. Nice shot.', '2003-10-02 08:55:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(438049, 39802, 11073, '<td valign="top">cool shot - i like the lack of color here. nice.</td>', 'cool shot - i like the lack of color here. nice.', '2003-10-02 08:55:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(438050, 40089, 3290, '<td valign="top">Arrggh! Hope he/she was alright.</td>', 'Arrggh! Hope he/she was alright.', '2003-10-02 08:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(438051, 39886, 11073, '<td valign="top">good capture. framed well, and i like the lighting.</td>', 'good capture. framed well, and i like the lighting.', '2003-10-02 08:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(438052, 39543, 11073, '<td valign="top">GREAT atmospheric element, great catch! is this in canada by any chance?</td>', 'GREAT atmospheric element, great catch! is this in canada by any chance?', '2003-10-02 08:56:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(438053, 40080, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch. Busy background is a distraction. I think I''d crop out quite a bit top and bottom to focus on the in-flight birds. Right now, it''s quite a busy shot without a real focal point.</td>', 'Nice catch. Busy background is a distraction. I think I''d crop out quite a bit top and bottom to focus on the in-flight birds. Right now, it''s quite a busy shot without a real focal point.', '2003-10-02 08:56:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(438054, 39133, 11073, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot - i don''t think i''ve ever seen a hummers wings so still before. nice capture.</td>', 'beautiful shot - i don''t think i''ve ever seen a hummers wings so still before. nice capture.', '2003-10-02 08:57:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(438056, 39192, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-) Could be a great shot of the bird if you could have got closer up. Exposure looks off too. Looks like a great subject - is it carrying something?</td>', ':-) Could be a great shot of the bird if you could have got closer up. Exposure looks off too. Looks like a great subject - is it carrying something?', '2003-10-02 08:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(438058, 40043, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the use of negative space and the angle of the plane adds a sense of dynamism. Best plane shot I''ve seen so far this challenge.</td>', 'I like the use of negative space and the angle of the plane adds a sense of dynamism. Best plane shot I''ve seen so far this challenge.', '2003-10-02 08:59:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(438059, 39964, 11073, '<td valign="top">good take on the category - kudos for originality. good composition too - the b/w works well here. nice work.</td>', 'good take on the category - kudos for originality. good composition too - the b/w works well here. nice work.', '2003-10-02 08:59:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(438060, 40093, 3290, '<td valign="top">It''s too small and it''s very hard to see what''s going on. Your pictures can be up to 640 pixels on the longest side. A larger version would be much better. Looks like you''ve stopped the motion well. Get him to wear lighter trousers next time.</td>', 'It''s too small and it''s very hard to see what''s going on. Your pictures can be up to 640 pixels on the longest side. A larger version would be much better. Looks like you''ve stopped the motion well. Get him to wear lighter trousers next time.', '2003-10-02 09:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(438061, 39893, 3290, '<td valign="top">Shame the bubble''s not in focus, althought the background is.</td>', 'Shame the bubble''s not in focus, althought the background is.', '2003-10-02 09:01:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(438063, 40067, 3290, '<td valign="top">This is where you need rear-curtain sync on the flash (no, my camera doesn''t have it either). Because the flash has fired at the beginning of the exposure, the trail is ''in front'' of th plane and that''s made it look like it''s flying backwards. Nice try, though.</td>', 'This is where you need rear-curtain sync on the flash (no, my camera doesn''t have it either). Because the flash has fired at the beginning of the exposure, the trail is ''in front'' of th plane and that''s made it look like it''s flying backwards. Nice try, though.', '2003-10-02 09:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(438065, 40035, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice use of high-key. The bird in the background looks as though it''s standing in mid-air though. Shame you couldn''t crop or clone it out :-(</td>', 'Nice use of high-key. The bird in the background looks as though it''s standing in mid-air though. Shame you couldn''t crop or clone it out :-(', '2003-10-02 09:04:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(438066, 39818, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice pic!  It would have been better if the bee, not the flower, had been in focus.</td>', 'Nice pic!  It would have been better if the bee, not the flower, had been in focus.', '2003-10-02 09:04:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(438068, 39886, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good timing!  The pic is a bit dark though, the bird loses a bit of detail as a result, but a good pic! - 7</td>', 'Good timing!  The pic is a bit dark though, the bird loses a bit of detail as a result, but a good pic! - 7', '2003-10-02 09:05:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(438069, 40042, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-) Tautness of the string would suggest that Mr Happy''s freedon is imaginary, though. Go, Mr Happy, go! I like the colours and composition.</td>', ':-) Tautness of the string would suggest that Mr Happy''s freedon is imaginary, though. Go, Mr Happy, go! I like the colours and composition.', '2003-10-02 09:06:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(438070, 39886, 3290, '<td valign="top">Would be very nice if lighter. As it is, it''s a little too dark for my taste - you can''t really make out any detail on the bird.</td>', 'Would be very nice if lighter. As it is, it''s a little too dark for my taste - you can''t really make out any detail on the bird.', '2003-10-02 09:07:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(438071, 39124, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice use of negative space. Lovely texture in the sky. I like this one.</td>', 'Nice use of negative space. Lovely texture in the sky. I like this one.', '2003-10-02 09:08:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(438072, 39802, 3290, '<td valign="top">I think this will do well. Nice tones - gives it a wistful quality. I think I might crop some of the space behind the ''pilot'' out.</td>', 'I think this will do well. Nice tones - gives it a wistful quality. I think I might crop some of the space behind the ''pilot'' out.', '2003-10-02 09:09:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(438073, 40021, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch, I know from experience it isn''t easy. Could be sharper, though.</td>', 'Nice catch, I know from experience it isn''t easy. Could be sharper, though.', '2003-10-02 09:10:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(438074, 40048, 3290, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Lighting on the plane''s underside is nice.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Lighting on the plane''s underside is nice.', '2003-10-02 09:10:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(438075, 40047, 3290, '<td valign="top">:-) You''ve got to be a bit mad to do that. A less tight crop would work better, IMHO. As it is we''ve no idea how far off the ground it is.</td>', ':-) You''ve got to be a bit mad to do that. A less tight crop would work better, IMHO. As it is we''ve no idea how far off the ground it is.', '2003-10-02 09:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(438076, 39972, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice wistful shot which would work better with the subject placed less centrally, IMHO. I''d crop out the light area at the top of the background too.</td>', 'Nice wistful shot which would work better with the subject placed less centrally, IMHO. I''d crop out the light area at the top of the background too.', '2003-10-02 09:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(438077, 39941, 3290, '<td valign="top">Cool.</td>', 'Cool.', '2003-10-02 09:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(438078, 39949, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice light on the wings. Have they been clipped? They look a strange shape.</td>', 'Nice light on the wings. Have they been clipped? They look a strange shape.', '2003-10-02 09:13:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(438080, 39991, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the grittiness in the sky. Shame the building''s there, though.</td>', 'I like the grittiness in the sky. Shame the building''s there, though.', '2003-10-02 09:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(438081, 39044, 3290, '<td valign="top">I like the richness of the colours in this. Looks like you got a fairly clean window (for a change). Simple, but effective, shot.</td>', 'I like the richness of the colours in this. Looks like you got a fairly clean window (for a change). Simple, but effective, shot.', '2003-10-02 09:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(438082, 39959, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice greys. Would prefer it if we could see all of that other wing though.</td>', 'Nice greys. Would prefer it if we could see all of that other wing though.', '2003-10-02 09:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(438083, 39936, 3290, '<td valign="top">Nice catch of an in-flight dragon. This must be hard! Real shame we can''t see its head though.</td>', 'Nice catch of an in-flight dragon. This must be hard! Real shame we can''t see its head though.', '2003-10-02 09:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(438087, 39863, 6624, '<td valign="top">nice balloon shot with an interesting ''basket'' -  not the usual shape for hot air balloon</td>', 'nice balloon shot with an interesting ''basket'' -  not the usual shape for hot air balloon', '2003-10-02 09:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(438093, 39869, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice timing!  Sepia does not improve this picture in my opinion.</td>', 'Nice timing!  Sepia does not improve this picture in my opinion.', '2003-10-02 09:39:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(438107, 39986, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp picture!  Good focus and crop. - 8</td>', 'Nice crisp picture!  Good focus and crop. - 8', '2003-10-02 10:27:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(438108, 40050, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice timing!  There is too much noise/jpeg artifacts visible in the faces of the audience though..</td>', 'Nice timing!  There is too much noise/jpeg artifacts visible in the faces of the audience though..', '2003-10-02 10:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(438110, 40081, 10883, '<td valign="top">Good timing, focus and light!  nice crop also!  - 9</td>', 'Good timing, focus and light!  nice crop also!  - 9', '2003-10-02 10:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(438112, 40089, 10883, '<td valign="top">I can´t imagine how this pic came to be, but I like it very much!  Cool pic and cool timing!</td>', 'I can´t imagine how this pic came to be, but I like it very much!  Cool pic and cool timing!', '2003-10-02 10:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(438118, 39994, 10883, '<td valign="top">While it does meet the challenge, the birds are not very clear, it would have been nicer if it would have been zoomed a bit more in (or would have been closer)</td>', 'While it does meet the challenge, the birds are not very clear, it would have been nicer if it would have been zoomed a bit more in (or would have been closer)', '2003-10-02 11:00:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(438120, 40089, 12319, '<td valign="top">Isn''t that officially ''Falling''</td>', 'Isn''t that officially ''Falling''', '2003-10-02 11:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(438121, 39812, 12319, '<td valign="top">I like the shot, but cannot grade high for lack of ''Flight''</td>', 'I like the shot, but cannot grade high for lack of ''Flight''', '2003-10-02 11:05:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(438124, 39554, 12319, '<td valign="top">How did you do this with one image?</td>', 'How did you do this with one image?', '2003-10-02 11:08:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(438192, 40071, 10167, '<td valign="top">I like the idea...  That''s a LOT of birds!  It is a little too overexposed for me though and a little too noisy/grainy where the clouds have parted and revealed the sky.</td>', 'I like the idea...  That''s a LOT of birds!  It is a little too overexposed for me though and a little too noisy/grainy where the clouds have parted and revealed the sky.', '2003-10-02 13:04:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(438194, 40084, 10167, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and framing, with the possible exception of the building in the lower right corner.  It is just a touch too dark for me on the underside of the bird though, and detail is lost as a result.  That said, I know how tough it is to get proper exposure on something against a bright sky like that!</td>', 'I like the composition and framing, with the possible exception of the building in the lower right corner.  It is just a touch too dark for me on the underside of the bird though, and detail is lost as a result.  That said, I know how tough it is to get proper exposure on something against a bright sky like that!', '2003-10-02 13:08:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(438202, 40094, 10167, '<td valign="top">This was a good idea, but if a person were to look at the pic alone without your title, I don''t think "flight" would come to mind...  Perhaps more of a macro/closeup shot of a flower and catching it in a breeze (or cheat and get someone to blow on it!) to stir up the polen and capture some of it airborn would work a little better here.</td>', 'This was a good idea, but if a person were to look at the pic alone without your title, I don''t think "flight" would come to mind...  Perhaps more of a macro/closeup shot of a flower and catching it in a breeze (or cheat and get someone to blow on it!) to stir up the polen and capture some of it airborn would work a little better here.', '2003-10-02 13:13:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(438207, 40094, 10883, '<td valign="top">I can not see how this picture meets the challenge.  It is also way too small.</td>', 'I can not see how this picture meets the challenge.  It is also way too small.', '2003-10-02 13:23:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(438209, 39962, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good focus.</td>', 'Nice capture and good focus.', '2003-10-02 13:25:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(438213, 39563, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice capture and good focus! - 8</td>', 'Nice capture and good focus! - 8', '2003-10-02 13:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(438221, 39192, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice timing, lot of noise in the picture though.</td>', 'Nice timing, lot of noise in the picture though.', '2003-10-02 13:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
