(438397, 39870, 12733, '<td valign="top">Brilliant response to the requested topic, and a beautiful sharp photo.</td>', 'Brilliant response to the requested topic, and a beautiful sharp photo.', '2003-10-02 18:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(438400, 40081, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice tight, sharp photo. Interesting lighting and color.</td>', 'Nice tight, sharp photo. Interesting lighting and color.', '2003-10-02 18:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(438402, 39471, 12733, '<td valign="top">Amazing composition, given the moving target and difficult platform. Is this an aerial photo?</td>', 'Amazing composition, given the moving target and difficult platform. Is this an aerial photo?', '2003-10-02 18:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(438406, 40050, 12733, '<td valign="top">A great moment in sports, but so far out of focus. How does the football, which is so close to the people in the stands, come out so sharp???</td>', 'A great moment in sports, but so far out of focus. How does the football, which is so close to the people in the stands, come out so sharp???', '2003-10-02 18:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(438409, 39956, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Having taken similar photos (gulls, though, not pigeons), I know it can be tough to get so many in the air at once. Nice exposure and sharpness.</td>', 'Nice shot. Having taken similar photos (gulls, though, not pigeons), I know it can be tough to get so many in the air at once. Nice exposure and sharpness.', '2003-10-02 18:25:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(438413, 39794, 12733, '<td valign="top">Nice tight shot, clean composition. A little more breathing room in front might give more of a sense of movement.</td>', 'Nice tight shot, clean composition. A little more breathing room in front might give more of a sense of movement.', '2003-10-02 18:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(438440, 39891, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great contrast on the birds give a great layering look to the feathers. The blue hue in the sky really help to make the birds pop out of the picture. I like that the tree is really blurred. Kind of distracting, but it helps give a sense of height. I preferred it cropped out or getting a shot in which more of the treeline is shown to even out the composition.</td>', 'Great contrast on the birds give a great layering look to the feathers. The blue hue in the sky really help to make the birds pop out of the picture. I like that the tree is really blurred. Kind of distracting, but it helps give a sense of height. I preferred it cropped out or getting a shot in which more of the treeline is shown to even out the composition.', '2003-10-02 19:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(438464, 39471, 10883, '<td valign="top">Nice angle which the wings create.  I do spot a bit of noise in the picture though.</td>', 'Nice angle which the wings create.  I do spot a bit of noise in the picture though.', '2003-10-02 20:08:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(438476, 39528, 10084, '<td valign="top">Yes, beautiful silhouette back by an impressive sunset/sunrise. Love the fluffy clouds. Great contrast helps to separate the clouds and gives it a very interesting depth of field.<br/> <br/>Slight blurring of the wings on the birds give a sense of flight. Probably south for the winter. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Yes, beautiful silhouette back by an impressive sunset/sunrise. Love the fluffy clouds. Great contrast helps to separate the clouds and gives it a very interesting depth of field. Slight blurring of the wings on the birds give a sense of flight. Probably south for the winter. Beautiful shot.', '2003-10-02 20:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(438507, 39936, 6900, '<td valign="top">THat''s so good it should be outlawed. 10</td>', 'THat''s so good it should be outlawed. 10', '2003-10-02 21:48:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(438508, 39542, 6900, '<td valign="top">cute!!!</td>', 'cute!!!', '2003-10-02 21:50:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(438509, 40085, 6900, '<td valign="top">Borders should be illegal.  At least this one. lol  (Just kidding around).   I like the tone of the leaf and the composition.  Could be a better finished product.</td>', 'Borders should be illegal.  At least this one. lol  (Just kidding around).   I like the tone of the leaf and the composition.  Could be a better finished product.', '2003-10-02 21:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(438511, 39898, 3599, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle for the subject and nice photo.  But I don''t see flight here, sorry I have to vote you down for that.</td>', 'Interesting angle for the subject and nice photo.  But I don''t see flight here, sorry I have to vote you down for that.', '2003-10-02 21:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(438512, 40095, 6900, '<td valign="top">How''d you pull this one off? :)</td>', 'How''d you pull this one off? :)', '2003-10-02 21:54:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(438513, 40096, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like sense of motion with this photo.  It seems a good number of photos freezed their birds in place but you didn''t and it worked out really well.  Nice focus on the crow itself.  Nice work, good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like sense of motion with this photo.  It seems a good number of photos freezed their birds in place but you didn''t and it worked out really well.  Nice focus on the crow itself.  Nice work, good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-02 21:58:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(438515, 40086, 3599, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot, it almost has the look of a painting.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot, it almost has the look of a painting.  Good work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-02 22:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(438518, 39184, 3599, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp focus on the helicopter and thanks for not freezing the blades.  It never looks realistic.  Here they are bit but at least I see movement which makes it look real.  Nice work and good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Nice sharp focus on the helicopter and thanks for not freezing the blades.  It never looks realistic.  Here they are bit but at least I see movement which makes it look real.  Nice work and good luck in the challenge.', '2003-10-02 22:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(438521, 40047, 3599, '<td valign="top">Very cool photo, I actually don''t mind that you''ve framed it as tight as you have.  Not much else to say except nice work.</td>', 'Very cool photo, I actually don''t mind that you''ve framed it as tight as you have.  Not much else to say except nice work.', '2003-10-02 22:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(438567, 39942, 12741, '<td valign="top">This picture is virtually flawless. notice the contrast with the black and white of the bird while, at the same time, the beautiful blend of the blue and green from the water. WOW! The wing span and angle - not to mention the definition.</td>', 'This picture is virtually flawless. notice the contrast with the black and white of the bird while, at the same time, the beautiful blend of the blue and green from the water. WOW! The wing span and angle - not to mention the definition.', '2003-10-02 23:27:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(438577, 40048, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great sense of flight. Love the reflections on the plane from the sunset/sunrise. Really good contrast  in the plane.The shadows and reflections on the plane itself really gives you a sense of the beautiful shapes in the plane. The fluffy clouds and the blue hues is a great backdrop to highlight the plane.</td>', 'Great sense of flight. Love the reflections on the plane from the sunset/sunrise. Really good contrast  in the plane.The shadows and reflections on the plane itself really gives you a sense of the beautiful shapes in the plane. The fluffy clouds and the blue hues is a great backdrop to highlight the plane.', '2003-10-02 23:45:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(438581, 39133, 10084, '<td valign="top">Great details in the feathers of the hummingbird. Good focusing really helps show us the beautiful colors and contrast in the feathers. The incredible depth of field really makes the hummingbird stand out from the background. Beautiful shot.</td>', 'Great details in the feathers of the hummingbird. Good focusing really helps show us the beautiful colors and contrast in the feathers. The incredible depth of field really makes the hummingbird stand out from the background. Beautiful shot.', '2003-10-02 23:48:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(438635, 39603, 4871, '<td valign="top">I know that getting live action can be hard, but its still important to maintain focus. This would have been a great shot! However watch the whites - they are overexposed. In most photographs that you take you should always be able to see detail in every part of your picture. Here there is no detail under his wing.</td>', 'I know that getting live action can be hard, but its still important to maintain focus. This would have been a great shot! However watch the whites - they are overexposed. In most photographs that you take you should always be able to see detail in every part of your picture. Here there is no detail under his wing.', '2003-10-03 02:40:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(438636, 39933, 4871, '<td valign="top">Almost a great shot - I love how his feet are just leaving the wood! I would have preferred to see his face than his butt though!!!</td>', 'Almost a great shot - I love how his feet are just leaving the wood! I would have preferred to see his face than his butt though!!!', '2003-10-03 02:41:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(438638, 39985, 4871, '<td valign="top">Great idea! I love the vibrant colours!</td>', 'Great idea! I love the vibrant colours!', '2003-10-03 02:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(438639, 39802, 4871, '<td valign="top">Fantastic picture!! This photo is very pleasing to the eye - good work on the post adjustment. This photo is something that''s different and appealing. Well done!</td>', 'Fantastic picture!! This photo is very pleasing to the eye - good work on the post adjustment. This photo is something that''s different and appealing. Well done!', '2003-10-03 02:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
