(438645, 39886, 4871, '<td valign="top">I really like this one. Great highlights and the sky is quite dramatic. Can be taken quite emotively. Wish the sky could have been a little MORE dramatic  ie more breakup in the clouds, but without seeing it I don''t know if that would look better or worse. Great shot!</td>', 'I really like this one. Great highlights and the sky is quite dramatic. Can be taken quite emotively. Wish the sky could have been a little MORE dramatic  ie more breakup in the clouds, but without seeing it I don''t know if that would look better or worse. Great shot!', '2003-10-03 02:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
