(438710, 40078, 12733, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of flare to enhance the photo and give a dreamlike effect, but unless one of these horses is Pegasus, I''m not sure where the flight comes from. As with any shot where flare is used, it takes care to avoid losing part of the subject, as with the one horse whose head is almost lost.</td>', 'Interesting use of flare to enhance the photo and give a dreamlike effect, but unless one of these horses is Pegasus, I''m not sure where the flight comes from. As with any shot where flare is used, it takes care to avoid losing part of the subject, as with the one horse whose head is almost lost.', '2003-10-03 09:19:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(438712, 40092, 12733, '<td valign="top">The spectacular sky and seascape turn what might be a fairly ordinary picture of birds in flight into a work of art.</td>', 'The spectacular sky and seascape turn what might be a fairly ordinary picture of birds in flight into a work of art.', '2003-10-03 09:21:10.000000', NULL, 1),
