(439372, 39959, 669, '<td valign="top">Nice use of thirds.  Good focus.  Looks a little oversharpened - not too keen on the bright outlines of some parts.  I like the B&amp;W here - good choice.  Good luck.</td>', 'Nice use of thirds.  Good focus.  Looks a little oversharpened - not too keen on the bright outlines of some parts.  I like the B&W here - good choice.  Good luck.', '2003-10-04 14:33:38.000000', NULL, 1),
