(439479, 39192, 12448, '<td valign="top">Nice caputre of an eagle, but very grainy and the coloring looks completely off</td>', 'Nice caputre of an eagle, but very grainy and the coloring looks completely off', '2003-10-04 17:31:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(439480, 39884, 12448, '<td valign="top">Meets the challenge in capturing flight but the bird almost gets lost in the background</td>', 'Meets the challenge in capturing flight but the bird almost gets lost in the background', '2003-10-04 17:33:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(439519, 40037, 10084, '<td valign="top">Gives great dynamic motion in the piece. Love that one is blurred and shows great motion , the other one is almost still. Great contrast. Beautiful colors in the costume. I find the gutter on the lower left distract, but overall a nice picture.</td>', 'Gives great dynamic motion in the piece. Love that one is blurred and shows great motion , the other one is almost still. Great contrast. Beautiful colors in the costume. I find the gutter on the lower left distract, but overall a nice picture.', '2003-10-04 19:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(439523, 39910, 10084, '<td valign="top">Love shots of chrome. Such beautiful colors in the reflections. Composition is interesting. Great curves in the propellor. The sky helps to push the plane out in the shot.</td>', 'Love shots of chrome. Such beautiful colors in the reflections. Composition is interesting. Great curves in the propellor. The sky helps to push the plane out in the shot.', '2003-10-04 19:36:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(439524, 40059, 10084, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition. Feels like your on the field with the players. You can almost feel the emotion of the players. Great expressions on them. The extra blurred ball gives a sense of flight to it. Depth of field is good and help bring the foreground out of the background.</td>', 'Interesting composition. Feels like your on the field with the players. You can almost feel the emotion of the players. Great expressions on them. The extra blurred ball gives a sense of flight to it. Depth of field is good and help bring the foreground out of the background.', '2003-10-04 19:38:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(439525, 40026, 10084, '<td valign="top">Beautiful contrast in the shot. The dark backgrond of the water really helps to bring out the pigeon flying. Love the slight shadow in the water. You can pick out each feather of the bird. The shutter speed really give motion to the wings and helps with the "in flight" theme. Excellent .</td>', 'Beautiful contrast in the shot. The dark backgrond of the water really helps to bring out the pigeon flying. Love the slight shadow in the water. You can pick out each feather of the bird. The shutter speed really give motion to the wings and helps with the "in flight" theme. Excellent .', '2003-10-04 19:40:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(439526, 39644, 10084, '<td valign="top">This is a fun picture. Seems like he''s in flight. Love the shadow on the ground. It also notice you there. lol. The beautiful blue hue of the sky frames this shot perfectly.</td>', 'This is a fun picture. Seems like he''s in flight. Love the shadow on the ground. It also notice you there. lol. The beautiful blue hue of the sky frames this shot perfectly.', '2003-10-04 19:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(439530, 40017, 10402, '<td valign="top">You caught the wings at just the right moment, and I like the spread tail feathers. The rippled water makes a great background.</td>', 'You caught the wings at just the right moment, and I like the spread tail feathers. The rippled water makes a great background.', '2003-10-04 19:57:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(439534, 39985, 10402, '<td valign="top">The colorful dress does suggest a butterfly and contrasts nicely with the background. I like how the tilt of her head parallels the shape of the tree next to it.</td>', 'The colorful dress does suggest a butterfly and contrasts nicely with the background. I like how the tilt of her head parallels the shape of the tree next to it.', '2003-10-04 20:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(439536, 39794, 10402, '<td valign="top">Blurry and noisy. But the composition is great; the diagonal lines and bright contrast make this photo very dynamic.</td>', 'Blurry and noisy. But the composition is great; the diagonal lines and bright contrast make this photo very dynamic.', '2003-10-04 20:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(439537, 39018, 10402, '<td valign="top">The tilt of the plane and space below and above it are perfect; some extra space in front would improve the composition. Good lighting; I like the bottoms of the wings, etc. in silhouette but am glad to see the wheels lit. The white halo is distracting; perhaps a little less sharpening would have prevented it.</td>', 'The tilt of the plane and space below and above it are perfect; some extra space in front would improve the composition. Good lighting; I like the bottoms of the wings, etc. in silhouette but am glad to see the wheels lit. The white halo is distracting; perhaps a little less sharpening would have prevented it.', '2003-10-04 20:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(439540, 39867, 10402, '<td valign="top">The foreground trees nicely frame the subject and makes a pleasing composition. The colors are nice (except in the frame you added). The midtones are a bit washed out and it could use a little sharpening.</td>', 'The foreground trees nicely frame the subject and makes a pleasing composition. The colors are nice (except in the frame you added). The midtones are a bit washed out and it could use a little sharpening.', '2003-10-04 20:40:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(439549, 39942, 8860, '<td valign="top">Is this the ocean? Looks like a lake with trees etc. Great angle - slightly over exposed - excellent capture. Background is a bit busy (can''t help that though). How would this look in b+w? It may make the gull come forward more, since the background is not very interesting, the gull is quite colourless and it does not aid your title!</td>', 'Is this the ocean? Looks like a lake with trees etc. Great angle - slightly over exposed - excellent capture. Background is a bit busy (can''t help that though). How would this look in b+w? It may make the gull come forward more, since the background is not very interesting, the gull is quite colourless and it does not aid your title!', '2003-10-04 21:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(439550, 39992, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture but there''s some weird colour saturation going on in the dark areas. Bground is distracting.</td>', 'Great capture but there''s some weird colour saturation going on in the dark areas. Bground is distracting.', '2003-10-04 21:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(439552, 39991, 8860, '<td valign="top">Unusual take on challenge - like this. They almost look like bats with their positions. Sky is noisy but it kind of adds to the vibe. (Omen II is the best - and I met Damien''s actor once!)</td>', 'Unusual take on challenge - like this. They almost look like bats with their positions. Sky is noisy but it kind of adds to the vibe. (Omen II is the best - and I met Damien''s actor once!)', '2003-10-04 21:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(439554, 39644, 8860, '<td valign="top">Not exactly faster than a speeding bullet is he? Let''s face it - he''s going nowhere fast and it looks like SuperMat left the rest of his gear in the phone box.<br/> <br/>Composition isn''t good (shadow of photographer visible). I''d have cropped it tighter and made it portrait - leaving lots of sky.</td>', 'Not exactly faster than a speeding bullet is he? Let''s face it - he''s going nowhere fast and it looks like SuperMat left the rest of his gear in the phone box. Composition isn''t good (shadow of photographer visible). I''d have cropped it tighter and made it portrait - leaving lots of sky.', '2003-10-04 21:13:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(439556, 40081, 8860, '<td valign="top">Top gull shot. Nice DOF (lost the busy background) but although the sunlight is nice it lacks context, so I wonder if this may be better in mono?</td>', 'Top gull shot. Nice DOF (lost the busy background) but although the sunlight is nice it lacks context, so I wonder if this may be better in mono?', '2003-10-04 21:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(439557, 39640, 8860, '<td valign="top">I think this would be more striking in mono - it would be more atmospheric. The sky is ''too blue'' and the birds are not detailed or interesting enough.</td>', 'I think this would be more striking in mono - it would be more atmospheric. The sky is ''too blue'' and the birds are not detailed or interesting enough.', '2003-10-04 21:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(439558, 39818, 8860, '<td valign="top">Nice concept and I like the space in the shot.</td>', 'Nice concept and I like the space in the shot.', '2003-10-04 21:19:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(439559, 40096, 8860, '<td valign="top">Great capture but a bit over-sharpened.</td>', 'Great capture but a bit over-sharpened.', '2003-10-04 21:20:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(439564, 39802, 3306, '<td valign="top">Very serene. I like the sepia tone. 10</td>', 'Very serene. I like the sepia tone. 10', '2003-10-04 21:50:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(439565, 39554, 3306, '<td valign="top">Nice. Definite ribbon.</td>', 'Nice. Definite ribbon.', '2003-10-04 21:52:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(439575, 39133, 3306, '<td valign="top">Wonderful picture. Can''t tell if it is a female Allen''s Hummingbird or a female Rufous Hummingbird. We Only get Ruby throats on the east coast.</td>', 'Wonderful picture. Can''t tell if it is a female Allen''s Hummingbird or a female Rufous Hummingbird. We Only get Ruby throats on the east coast.', '2003-10-04 22:20:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(439578, 39521, 12817, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  The elements in this photo work very well together, and of course paying attention to the rule of thirds on THIS shot anyway was an excellent decision.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  The elements in this photo work very well together, and of course paying attention to the rule of thirds on THIS shot anyway was an excellent decision.', '2003-10-04 22:40:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(439582, 39563, 7969, '<td valign="top">I like the shades of gray of his feathers, and I think you used his flying out of the picture to your advantage by making her so  extreme in the corner.</td>', 'I like the shades of gray of his feathers, and I think you used his flying out of the picture to your advantage by making her so  extreme in the corner.', '2003-10-04 22:47:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(439590, 39640, 9932, '<td valign="top">The white border is a little to much IMHO, it seems to clash with the white clouds. I wish the birds were a little larger also. Nice shot otherwise.  7<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2003-10-07 21:44:42.</i></td>', 'The white border is a little to much IMHO, it seems to clash with the white clouds. I wish the birds were a little larger also. Nice shot otherwise.  7', '2003-10-05 00:46:03.000000', '2003-10-07 22:44:42.000000', 1),
(439591, 40085, 9932, '<td valign="top">How do we know if it is really falling or in flight? The white background keeps us from knowing. The blue border is to much IMO. 6</td>', 'How do we know if it is really falling or in flight? The white background keeps us from knowing. The blue border is to much IMO. 6', '2003-10-05 00:50:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(439592, 40026, 10402, '<td valign="top">Fabulous pose and great focus. I like the small amount of motion blur in the wings. The shadow is nice too. The digital noise in the water makes a nice background.</td>', 'Fabulous pose and great focus. I like the small amount of motion blur in the wings. The shadow is nice too. The digital noise in the water makes a nice background.', '2003-10-05 00:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(439593, 39666, 9932, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot,  but I do believe the challenge description read "In Flight"? 7</td>', 'Beautiful shot,  but I do believe the challenge description read "In Flight"? 7', '2003-10-05 00:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(439594, 39990, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, did you edit the blues in this? They all seem flat except the parachute? The blue in the border I think is to much blue? 8</td>', 'Nice shot, did you edit the blues in this? They all seem flat except the parachute? The blue in the border I think is to much blue? 8', '2003-10-05 00:52:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(439595, 39994, 9932, '<td valign="top">Just a little to boring? Maybe zoom in on one or two of the birds? 6</td>', 'Just a little to boring? Maybe zoom in on one or two of the birds? 6', '2003-10-05 00:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(439596, 39873, 10402, '<td valign="top">Nice macro. I like the composition and the softness. I''d have probably sharpened it, but the more I look at it, the more I like it without sharpening.</td>', 'Nice macro. I like the composition and the softness. I''d have probably sharpened it, but the more I look at it, the more I like it without sharpening.', '2003-10-05 00:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(439597, 39521, 9932, '<td valign="top">Not my idea for the challenge, but nice work catching the dog in air. 6</td>', 'Not my idea for the challenge, but nice work catching the dog in air. 6', '2003-10-05 00:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(439599, 39649, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work to bad it was a cloudy day! 7</td>', 'Nice work to bad it was a cloudy day! 7', '2003-10-05 00:55:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(439600, 40080, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work, a little to busy IMO. If you could have concentrated on the birds in flight or cropped it to that I think it would have been better. Also use less DOF. 8</td>', 'Nice work, a little to busy IMO. If you could have concentrated on the birds in flight or cropped it to that I think it would have been better. Also use less DOF. 8', '2003-10-05 00:58:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(439601, 40083, 9932, '<td valign="top">More cropping would have made this a lot better photo IMO. 6</td>', 'More cropping would have made this a lot better photo IMO. 6', '2003-10-05 00:59:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(439602, 39857, 9932, '<td valign="top">Not bad. Did you do sharpening? The bird and tree branches seem to have halos?<br/>More cropping also would have helped. 6</td>', 'Not bad. Did you do sharpening? The bird and tree branches seem to have halos?More cropping also would have helped. 6', '2003-10-05 01:00:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(439603, 40062, 9932, '<td valign="top">Object to small for photo area? 7</td>', 'Object to small for photo area? 7', '2003-10-05 01:00:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(439605, 39891, 9932, '<td valign="top">Cropping to the rule of thirds I think would have helped? 7</td>', 'Cropping to the rule of thirds I think would have helped? 7', '2003-10-05 01:01:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(439606, 39984, 9932, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot, nice timing and cropping! 8</td>', 'Excellent shot, nice timing and cropping! 8', '2003-10-05 01:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(439607, 40095, 10402, '<td valign="top">The tail shows motion very effectively and the black background adds impact. I wish the plane was just a bit more interesting; even a simple crayon drawn design.</td>', 'The tail shows motion very effectively and the black background adds impact. I wish the plane was just a bit more interesting; even a simple crayon drawn design.', '2003-10-05 01:02:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(439608, 40048, 9932, '<td valign="top">The sky is washed out to much IMO. 7</td>', 'The sky is washed out to much IMO. 7', '2003-10-05 01:02:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(439609, 39511, 9932, '<td valign="top">Nice work. More contrast on the person flying would have helped.  7</td>', 'Nice work. More contrast on the person flying would have helped.  7', '2003-10-05 01:04:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(439610, 40089, 9932, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry what are we looking at? Is that a para jumper or a sack of grain on fire? 6</td>', 'I''m sorry what are we looking at? Is that a para jumper or a sack of grain on fire? 6', '2003-10-05 01:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(439613, 39936, 9932, '<td valign="top">Does that look like a piece of fishing line or etc attached to his tail? Well nice work. 7</td>', 'Does that look like a piece of fishing line or etc attached to his tail? Well nice work. 7', '2003-10-05 01:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(439617, 40019, 9932, '<td valign="top">LOL<br/>Nice idea. To much black border IMO. Cropping closer to the plane and house would have helped more I think. 8</td>', 'LOLNice idea. To much black border IMO. Cropping closer to the plane and house would have helped more I think. 8', '2003-10-05 01:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
