(439681, 40078, 10402, '<td valign="top">I had forgotten about the sense of flight meaning running away that you have captured so well here. The bright sun washes out the one horse''s head and puts noise on both horses, but I like the overall feeling of this image. The backlit dust contrasts nicely with the mostly silhouetted horses and adds to the feeling of motion.</td>', 'I had forgotten about the sense of flight meaning running away that you have captured so well here. The bright sun washes out the one horse''s head and puts noise on both horses, but I like the overall feeling of this image. The backlit dust contrasts nicely with the mostly silhouetted horses and adds to the feeling of motion.', '2003-10-05 10:36:40.000000', NULL, 1),
