(439687, 39968, 10402, '<td valign="top">Great pose! The way his body curves makes the unusual composition of putting space behind instead of in front of the subject a good choice. His clothes and hair contrast well with the background but his face sort of blends in, giving the image an abstract quality. I especially like the interaction of the model with the tree right behind him: his feet are aligned with the trunk, the branch extends forward to meet his hand, and his head meets the foilage at the top.</td>', 'Great pose! The way his body curves makes the unusual composition of putting space behind instead of in front of the subject a good choice. His clothes and hair contrast well with the background but his face sort of blends in, giving the image an abstract quality. I especially like the interaction of the model with the tree right behind him: his feet are aligned with the trunk, the branch extends forward to meet his hand, and his head meets the foilage at the top.', '2003-10-05 10:49:30.000000', NULL, 1),
