(439811, 39964, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOW! Top points for originality here! I love the concept! It says" the hell with it!" to me. :-) I think there''s a little too much negative space at the top. Cutting about a quarter of it would draw my eye faster to the main subject! 8</td>', 'WOW! Top points for originality here! I love the concept! It says" the hell with it!" to me. :-) I think there''s a little too much negative space at the top. Cutting about a quarter of it would draw my eye faster to the main subject! 8', '2003-10-05 16:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
