(439818, 39603, 4411, '<td valign="top">Very soft looking. Either out of focus or too slow shutter speed. Composition is good, though I would have cropped it down at the top.</td>', 'Very soft looking. Either out of focus or too slow shutter speed. Composition is good, though I would have cropped it down at the top.', '2003-10-05 17:10:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(439820, 39798, 4411, '<td valign="top">Different, but very difficult to tell what I''m looking at. The black background means there''s no actual sense of flight - whatever this is could just be sat on a black background.</td>', 'Different, but very difficult to tell what I''m looking at. The black background means there''s no actual sense of flight - whatever this is could just be sat on a black background.', '2003-10-05 17:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(439821, 39928, 4411, '<td valign="top">The desaturation doesn''t work for me. Probably your subject isn''t strong enough for the effect. In full colour this could have been quite good.</td>', 'The desaturation doesn''t work for me. Probably your subject isn''t strong enough for the effect. In full colour this could have been quite good.', '2003-10-05 17:15:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(439822, 40033, 4411, '<td valign="top">The bird is too soft and lacks any detail - either out of focus or too short shutter speed I guess. The background is very difficult to expose correctly being a mix of light and shadow, and here the top half of the image is overexposed.</td>', 'The bird is too soft and lacks any detail - either out of focus or too short shutter speed I guess. The background is very difficult to expose correctly being a mix of light and shadow, and here the top half of the image is overexposed.', '2003-10-05 17:19:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(439823, 39512, 4411, '<td valign="top">The bird seems too soft and noisy, and the B&amp;W makes it blend into the background too much. A great ''pose'' but the bird really needed to be sharper to pop out at the viewer.</td>', 'The bird seems too soft and noisy, and the B&W makes it blend into the background too much. A great ''pose'' but the bird really needed to be sharper to pop out at the viewer.', '2003-10-05 17:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(439824, 39991, 280, '<td valign="top">Beautiful shot, my only slight complaint would be that the border looks a little too complex especially with the extra 1pixel wide border added by DPC, but thats just nit-picking. Fantastic use of duo-tone and the grain really suits the picture. 10. Good luck, tom.</td>', 'Beautiful shot, my only slight complaint would be that the border looks a little too complex especially with the extra 1pixel wide border added by DPC, but thats just nit-picking. Fantastic use of duo-tone and the grain really suits the picture. 10. Good luck, tom.', '2003-10-05 17:21:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(439826, 39994, 4411, '<td valign="top">Too random. None of the birds are providing a focal point, and if anything this seems like a shot of the lighthouse which is spoiled by the birds and cyclist(?).</td>', 'Too random. None of the birds are providing a focal point, and if anything this seems like a shot of the lighthouse which is spoiled by the birds and cyclist(?).', '2003-10-05 17:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
