(439840, 40086, 7969, '<td valign="top">Nice sky and smoke.  Just curious if it is in the dates?  I am always suprised how many of these sorts of ''shows'' fall in the same week of challenge, never works out for me, maybe I should move to a different city. :  )</td>', 'Nice sky and smoke.  Just curious if it is in the dates?  I am always suprised how many of these sorts of ''shows'' fall in the same week of challenge, never works out for me, maybe I should move to a different city. :  )', '2003-10-05 19:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
