(439845, 39956, 7969, '<td valign="top">This shot feels a bit too busy to me, I would think cropping out some (all) tree or bridge may help it feel not so busy and help viewer to focus on flight aspects.  Sharp image,</td>', 'This shot feels a bit too busy to me, I would think cropping out some (all) tree or bridge may help it feel not so busy and help viewer to focus on flight aspects.  Sharp image,', '2003-10-05 19:07:42.000000', NULL, 1),
