(439861, 39802, 7778, '<td valign="top">Mais oui! Lovely! The spatial emptiness in this photo is absolutely gorgeous.<br/> <br/>Boy and toy could be positioned a tad further to the left - to assign a more generous flight path for the plane and to emphasize a classic composition. <br/>I''d consider rotating the image very slightly to level the horizon line...<br/>Ideally, perhaps, the shadow side of the boy could do with more brightness (fill flash?). Yet overall, it is especially the meticulously variable lighting, which is so astounding.<br/> <br/>The subtlety of the hue chosen for the image documents fine taste, IMHO.<br/> <br/>[It is a 7 on my personal scale (of all I know). I am rating it at 10 in the context of DPC.]  <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Mais oui! Lovely! The spatial emptiness in this photo is absolutely gorgeous. Boy and toy could be positioned a tad further to the left - to assign a more generous flight path for the plane and to emphasize a classic composition. I''d consider rotating the image very slightly to level the horizon line...Ideally, perhaps, the shadow side of the boy could do with more brightness (fill flash?). Yet overall, it is especially the meticulously variable lighting, which is so astounding. The subtlety of the hue chosen for the image documents fine taste, IMHO. [It is a 7 on my personal scale (of all I know). I am rating it at 10 in the context of DPC.]       ', '2003-10-05 20:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(439863, 40026, 7778, '<td valign="top">Great capture and an example of the dramatic effect of natural light and contrast. The title, too, is poetically inclusive.</td>', 'Great capture and an example of the dramatic effect of natural light and contrast. The title, too, is poetically inclusive.', '2003-10-05 20:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
