(439872, 40096, 7778, '<td valign="top">I''ve never managed to achieve such marked detail on a crow (being so nearly black)!<br/>I am impressed indeed!</td>', 'I''ve never managed to achieve such marked detail on a crow (being so nearly black)!I am impressed indeed!', '2003-10-05 20:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(439875, 39959, 10167, '<td valign="top">Normally the fact that part of the wing didn''t make the shot would bug me a little, but not this time.  This is a great picture all around.  Good job!</td>', 'Normally the fact that part of the wing didn''t make the shot would bug me a little, but not this time.  This is a great picture all around.  Good job!', '2003-10-05 21:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(439894, 39563, 7778, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous. <br/> <br/>I don''t really mind the unusual placement of the bird leaving the image. Graphically, the arrow-like shape of the bird in an outer corner makes for dynamic composition. The texture (wings and body) appears somewhat (deliberately?) oversharpened, adding a proliferated contrast to the given tedium of the water.</td>', 'Gorgeous.  I don''t really mind the unusual placement of the bird leaving the image. Graphically, the arrow-like shape of the bird in an outer corner makes for dynamic composition. The texture (wings and body) appears somewhat (deliberately?) oversharpened, adding a proliferated contrast to the given tedium of the water.', '2003-10-05 21:46:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(439905, 39905, 12661, '<td valign="top">Some graininess in the background, but the foreground definately makes up for it. Very well done.</td>', 'Some graininess in the background, but the foreground definately makes up for it. Very well done.', '2003-10-05 22:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(439907, 39471, 12661, '<td valign="top">One of few bird pictures I rated this high. I really like the angle from which this was taken.</td>', 'One of few bird pictures I rated this high. I really like the angle from which this was taken.', '2003-10-05 22:05:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(439908, 40041, 12661, '<td valign="top">I love the colors of this picture.</td>', 'I love the colors of this picture.', '2003-10-05 22:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(439920, 39563, 11738, '<td valign="top">What great timing.  An EXCELLENT action shot!  good job!</td>', 'What great timing.  An EXCELLENT action shot!  good job!', '2003-10-05 22:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(439922, 40048, 11738, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  Love the sky.  You picked the perect time of day to take this.  I also like the way you cropped this image.  It gives it a sense of movement.  Among my favourites for this challenge.</td>', 'Great shot!  Love the sky.  You picked the perect time of day to take this.  I also like the way you cropped this image.  It gives it a sense of movement.  Among my favourites for this challenge.', '2003-10-05 22:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
