(439978, 39941, 1031, '<td valign="top">I''ll have to take your word for it, unless your EXIF includes GPS data (will soon, I expect). I''ve never managed to spot it myself -- I think it''s always been too cloudy when it was in my neighborhood..</td>', 'I''ll have to take your word for it, unless your EXIF includes GPS data (will soon, I expect). I''ve never managed to spot it myself -- I think it''s always been too cloudy when it was in my neighborhood..', '2003-10-06 00:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
