(440000, 39905, 5705, '<td valign="top">Its an great capture, I has tried these before-- Without a challenge topic its a 10, but it doesnt really fit the topic, so I gotta say 8</td>', 'Its an great capture, I has tried these before-- Without a challenge topic its a 10, but it doesnt really fit the topic, so I gotta say 8', '2003-10-06 00:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
