(440013, 39928, 8911, '<td valign="top">I like this, but I''m curious what it would look like with all the colors - while it does draw the eye to your subject, in this case the removal of the other colors makes the image seem a bit - faded? Flat?</td>', 'I like this, but I''m curious what it would look like with all the colors - while it does draw the eye to your subject, in this case the removal of the other colors makes the image seem a bit - faded? Flat?', '2003-10-06 00:23:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(440014, 40019, 8911, '<td valign="top">That is a really disturbing image. My eyes tell me that you must have had an incredible bit of timing to get that just so, but I am wondering if there''s a model involved in this somewhere, even though it doesn''t look like it....</td>', 'That is a really disturbing image. My eyes tell me that you must have had an incredible bit of timing to get that just so, but I am wondering if there''s a model involved in this somewhere, even though it doesn''t look like it....', '2003-10-06 00:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(440015, 40045, 8911, '<td valign="top">Lovely image - very crisp focus. The lines are just great; the background''s a little distracting, but I doubt the bird was amenable to being asked to fly somewhere else....</td>', 'Lovely image - very crisp focus. The lines are just great; the background''s a little distracting, but I doubt the bird was amenable to being asked to fly somewhere else....', '2003-10-06 00:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(440018, 39133, 8911, '<td valign="top">On this one, I''m just in awe. That''s an amazing split-second catch you made, with only the faint blurring on the wings....</td>', 'On this one, I''m just in awe. That''s an amazing split-second catch you made, with only the faint blurring on the wings....', '2003-10-06 00:27:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(440020, 39959, 8911, '<td valign="top">I really like this one - black and white works well, and the image is very crisp. The left wing seems to have a few artifacts (around the upper feathers), and it is a pity the right wing extends out of the shot, but all in all this is lovely.</td>', 'I really like this one - black and white works well, and the image is very crisp. The left wing seems to have a few artifacts (around the upper feathers), and it is a pity the right wing extends out of the shot, but all in all this is lovely.', '2003-10-06 00:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(440023, 40080, 5705, '<td valign="top">Great Light, lotta flight 10</td>', 'Great Light, lotta flight 10', '2003-10-06 00:35:59.000000', NULL, 1),
