(440054, 40033, 11923, '<td valign="top">I''m glad this one is finally over so I can reply.  Actually the bird was taking off - I was chasing it.  The lazy thing felt like walking most of the time, but finally it slowly took off.   Also, this was taken in the mid morning, around 9:30 or 10ish.  Go figure huh?  Took me forever to get even this shot, its not perfect but it took a bit of work to get even it.  Thanks for all the comments! :)</td>', 'I''m glad this one is finally over so I can reply.  Actually the bird was taking off - I was chasing it.  The lazy thing felt like walking most of the time, but finally it slowly took off.   Also, this was taken in the mid morning, around 9:30 or 10ish.  Go figure huh?  Took me forever to get even this shot, its not perfect but it took a bit of work to get even it.  Thanks for all the comments! :)', '2003-10-06 01:11:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(440070, 40078, 6900, '<td valign="top">Ouch.  This deserved a much higher rank.  People missed the connection to the topic because of a) language barriers or b) they didn''t THINK ABOUT IT.<br/> <br/>(oh big surprise).<br/> <br/>Excellent shot.</td>', 'Ouch.  This deserved a much higher rank.  People missed the connection to the topic because of a) language barriers or b) they didn''t THINK ABOUT IT. (oh big surprise). Excellent shot.', '2003-10-06 01:18:47.000000', NULL, 0),
