(441783, 39133, 12131, '<td valign="top">I am beginning to wonder...who keeps giving these winning photos one''s, two''s and three''s?  Whose the person with such selective taste out there?  I''d love to hear why (s)he would give this a one, two or three.  But especially the one.  The shot is well focused, amazingly timed and highly colorful while not distractingly so.  So why give it a low score?</td>', 'I am beginning to wonder...who keeps giving these winning photos one''s, two''s and three''s?  Whose the person with such selective taste out there?  I''d love to hear why (s)he would give this a one, two or three.  But especially the one.  The shot is well focused, amazingly timed and highly colorful while not distractingly so.  So why give it a low score?', '2003-10-07 20:40:48.000000', NULL, 0),
