(442625, 39995, 6202, '<td valign="top">*Critique Club*<br/> <br/>Very pretty color here.  It definately does meet the challenge.  The problem I see with it is just to much negative space.  You needed to crop in closer on the plane and also use the rule of thirds it will help greatly.  Try to put your subject in the outter 1/3 instead of dead center.  It will increase interest.</td>', '*Critique Club* Very pretty color here.  It definately does meet the challenge.  The problem I see with it is just to much negative space.  You needed to crop in closer on the plane and also use the rule of thirds it will help greatly.  Try to put your subject in the outter 1/3 instead of dead center.  It will increase interest.', '2003-10-08 08:55:46.000000', NULL, 0),
