(537719, 40019, 9581, '<td valign="top">Ok I have to know how this picture was taken! Its so shocking to see it so close! Is that house really that close to a airport and you see that everyday I believe I would be a paranoid person living there! LOL! I live in an area where plains go over all day sometimes 2 at a time little distance between them or 5 minutes a part but never have I seen one that big so close! So please tell me is this a real thing or photoshop trick so I can believe it! Oh yeah by the way Its an awesome picture!!!</td>', 'Ok I have to know how this picture was taken! Its so shocking to see it so close! Is that house really that close to a airport and you see that everyday I believe I would be a paranoid person living there! LOL! I live in an area where plains go over all day sometimes 2 at a time little distance between them or 5 minutes a part but never have I seen one that big so close! So please tell me is this a real thing or photoshop trick so I can believe it! Oh yeah by the way Its an awesome picture!!!', '2004-01-09 22:12:41.000000', NULL, 0),
